(2780877, 388981, 60862, '<td valign="top">The horizon''s tilted left.  No wait.  It''s tilted right! :)<br/> <br/>In all seriousness, this is a very cool shot.  It seems to me, though, that the snow should be brighter than it is.  With an advanced challenge, I think it''s probably possible to brighten it up without destroying the beautiful color in the sky.</td>', 'The horizon''s tilted left.  No wait.  It''s tilted right! :) In all seriousness, this is a very cool shot.  It seems to me, though, that the snow should be brighter than it is.  With an advanced challenge, I think it''s probably possible to brighten it up without destroying the beautiful color in the sky.', '2006-09-01 01:17:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2780878, 374261, 31403, '<td valign="top">all the way to B&amp;W on the selective desat makes this feel very unnatural - you could still draw attention to the kid and keep it looking more natural if you just desat a little.<br/> <br/>Doesn''t work for me - great photo - would LOVE to see it in color with that electric socket removed.  good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'all the way to B&W on the selective desat makes this feel very unnatural - you could still draw attention to the kid and keep it looking more natural if you just desat a little. Doesn''t work for me - great photo - would LOVE to see it in color with that electric socket removed.  good luck in the challenge.', '2006-09-01 01:17:39.000000', NULL, 1),
