(2781000, 388578, 18197, '<td valign="top">I have a personal weakness in the form of intolerance for tilted horizons. To me, they give the impression of sloppiness. Sometimes a horizon tilted purposefully will improve a photo. In this case I don''t think it does and it''s tilted to a minor degree so that I can''t tell if it''s on purpose, or an error. Otherwise it is a well composed and executed photo. Great color. Gives a sense of drama.</td>', 'I have a personal weakness in the form of intolerance for tilted horizons. To me, they give the impression of sloppiness. Sometimes a horizon tilted purposefully will improve a photo. In this case I don''t think it does and it''s tilted to a minor degree so that I can''t tell if it''s on purpose, or an error. Otherwise it is a well composed and executed photo. Great color. Gives a sense of drama.', '2006-09-01 01:31:14.000000', NULL, 1),
