(2781122, 382227, 40106, '<td valign="top">an interesting perspective and i really like the idea here... however, it could have been executed better.  to make this a really strong shot you would probably need a tripod, or something like it to avoid camera shake.  then, it would be really neat to use your manual settings and have the shutter stay open for a couple of seconds to get the effect of long exposure.  just some ideas :)  5</td>', 'an interesting perspective and i really like the idea here... however, it could have been executed better.  to make this a really strong shot you would probably need a tripod, or something like it to avoid camera shake.  then, it would be really neat to use your manual settings and have the shutter stay open for a couple of seconds to get the effect of long exposure.  just some ideas :)  5', '2006-09-01 01:44:02.000000', NULL, 1),
