(2781591, 388897, 43405, '<td valign="top">Nicely times shot, and composed well. I think this photograph is a nice candidate for a bit of D&amp;B, esp around the face and eye in particular. Very nice otherwise.</td>', 'Nicely times shot, and composed well. I think this photograph is a nice candidate for a bit of D&B, esp around the face and eye in particular. Very nice otherwise.', '2006-09-01 03:42:01.000000', NULL, 1),
