(2781768, 387181, 53316, '<td valign="top">I have always loved sunflowers with a dark blue. Pillows, napkins, etc... I just always have admired it.  And you have placed this wonderful combination in a photo. Also, the great color combination is enhanced by great focus and composition.  The border is a nice touch - I feel like the color really works.</td>', 'I have always loved sunflowers with a dark blue. Pillows, napkins, etc... I just always have admired it.  And you have placed this wonderful combination in a photo. Also, the great color combination is enhanced by great focus and composition.  The border is a nice touch - I feel like the color really works.', '2006-09-01 05:35:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2781769, 377518, 64888, '<td valign="top">Nice treatment of this!</td>', 'Nice treatment of this!', '2006-09-01 05:36:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2781771, 384388, 53316, '<td valign="top">I love the colors and contrast here.</td>', 'I love the colors and contrast here.', '2006-09-01 05:37:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2781772, 383553, 58055, '<td valign="top">I''m always torn on shots such as these, I''m in awe at the actual capture and crispness of the humming bird but IMO the image is missing something, (6)</td>', 'I''m always torn on shots such as these, I''m in awe at the actual capture and crispness of the humming bird but IMO the image is missing something, (6)', '2006-09-01 05:37:37.000000', NULL, 1),
