(2781774, 387738, 53316, '<td valign="top">Some people hate patriotic shots. I am not one of those.<br/> <br/>This is an amazing photograph technically and artistically.  Absolutely amazing.  Lighting is just perfect, and I love his gaze.</td>', 'Some people hate patriotic shots. I am not one of those. This is an amazing photograph technically and artistically.  Absolutely amazing.  Lighting is just perfect, and I love his gaze.', '2006-09-01 05:39:33.000000', NULL, 1),
