(2781779, 388298, 53316, '<td valign="top">The texture of the water looks just a bit off to me, but I love the composition and the contrast is great.</td>', 'The texture of the water looks just a bit off to me, but I love the composition and the contrast is great.', '2006-09-01 05:40:44.000000', NULL, 1),
