(2781789, 388578, 58055, '<td valign="top">Great composition and the light is fantastic, but...  imo I would have had the model standing or in a different outfit, at first glance she looks like another rock - maybe just me (6)</td>', 'Great composition and the light is fantastic, but...  imo I would have had the model standing or in a different outfit, at first glance she looks like another rock - maybe just me (6)', '2006-09-01 05:44:25.000000', NULL, 1),
