(2781826, 376216, 31307, '<td valign="top">Great capture.  Beautiful framing.  Not sure how I feel about the border, but I think it is growing on me as I look at it more.  Very nice job.</td>', 'Great capture.  Beautiful framing.  Not sure how I feel about the border, but I think it is growing on me as I look at it more.  Very nice job.', '2006-09-01 06:01:29.000000', NULL, 1),
