(2781829, 389026, 31307, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what the terrain was like right around you as you took this shot, but I feel like I want to get closer to the edge so that it is not in the image.  Nice shot on the whole though.</td>', 'I don''t know what the terrain was like right around you as you took this shot, but I feel like I want to get closer to the edge so that it is not in the image.  Nice shot on the whole though.', '2006-09-01 06:03:08.000000', NULL, 1),
