(2781832, 386384, 58055, '<td valign="top">great capture (7)</td>', 'great capture (7)', '2006-09-01 06:04:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2781834, 388678, 31307, '<td valign="top">Really grabs the attention.  Looks like an 80''s rock-n-roll horse with a stylin'' hair-do, screaming the lyrics of a song...</td>', 'Really grabs the attention.  Looks like an 80''s rock-n-roll horse with a stylin'' hair-do, screaming the lyrics of a song...', '2006-09-01 06:05:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2781836, 388784, 31307, '<td valign="top">I feel like there is an agent from the matrix ready to emerge from the shadows behind her.  Very cool lighting and tonality.</td>', 'I feel like there is an agent from the matrix ready to emerge from the shadows behind her.  Very cool lighting and tonality.', '2006-09-01 06:06:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2781839, 378681, 56167, '<td valign="top">very nice</td>', 'very nice', '2006-09-01 06:07:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2781840, 380178, 56167, '<td valign="top">beautiful</td>', 'beautiful', '2006-09-01 06:07:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2781841, 388905, 16004, '<td valign="top">like most of these types of IR shots, it has masses of instant visual appeal.  though, this one more so than others because it''s so damn picturesque!  composition is wonderful; the girl on the left really makes it gel, and the skyline really adds a depth, sense of scale and a nice break between the light sky and trees.  only slight quibble is that the slightly yellow tinge makes the trees less visually appealing (like smokers teeth) and the blob of turquoise on the brolly is a bit distrcting.  otherwise, great stuff that''s visually lovely.  9.<br/> <br/>on a side note, i must confess i have been dabbling with this sort of thing recently, and really everything i do is really crud compared to this - technically i wonder how you got such a great shot from the evidentally short exposure time (either that of the swan is amazingly compliant with the still pose).  was this with a dslr, or a converted compact?</td>', 'like most of these types of IR shots, it has masses of instant visual appeal.  though, this one more so than others because it''s so damn picturesque!  composition is wonderful; the girl on the left really makes it gel, and the skyline really adds a depth, sense of scale and a nice break between the light sky and trees.  only slight quibble is that the slightly yellow tinge makes the trees less visually appealing (like smokers teeth) and the blob of turquoise on the brolly is a bit distrcting.  otherwise, great stuff that''s visually lovely.  9. on a side note, i must confess i have been dabbling with this sort of thing recently, and really everything i do is really crud compared to this - technically i wonder how you got such a great shot from the evidentally short exposure time (either that of the swan is amazingly compliant with the still pose).  was this with a dslr, or a converted compact?', '2006-09-01 06:08:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2781842, 388590, 31307, '<td valign="top">I feel like the image needs more contrast and that, with the exception of the rocks in the lower right, the shadows could be strengthened more.  I think that doing that could really make this image "pop."</td>', 'I feel like the image needs more contrast and that, with the exception of the rocks in the lower right, the shadows could be strengthened more.  I think that doing that could really make this image "pop."', '2006-09-01 06:08:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2781844, 388416, 58055, '<td valign="top">quite a nice candid shot, not sure about the title though</td>', 'quite a nice candid shot, not sure about the title though', '2006-09-01 06:09:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2781845, 387597, 5354, '<td valign="top">Feels too plastic - I think you have overdone the neat image filter just a tad</td>', 'Feels too plastic - I think you have overdone the neat image filter just a tad', '2006-09-01 06:10:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2781846, 388114, 31307, '<td valign="top">Looks almost fantastical.  There is something a little weird seeming with the edges of the hill and the trees on it.  They seem just a little darker right before it becomes sky.</td>', 'Looks almost fantastical.  There is something a little weird seeming with the edges of the hill and the trees on it.  They seem just a little darker right before it becomes sky.', '2006-09-01 06:12:04.000000', NULL, 1),
