(2781857, 384769, 31307, '<td valign="top">I''d give you a "larger image, please" comment if I did not think that several other people will tell you the same thing.  This photo''s score will suffer because of its size I am sure.  You have a lot of great detail and nice contrast, but because of the size of the image, it is harder to really take it in and enjoy it all.</td>', 'I''d give you a "larger image, please" comment if I did not think that several other people will tell you the same thing.  This photo''s score will suffer because of its size I am sure.  You have a lot of great detail and nice contrast, but because of the size of the image, it is harder to really take it in and enjoy it all.', '2006-09-01 06:17:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2781858, 385160, 31307, '<td valign="top">Hee hee hee.  I like how the pig, as a metaphor for uncleaniness and ugliness, is juxtaposed with the pure and white sucks and beautiful sky.</td>', 'Hee hee hee.  I like how the pig, as a metaphor for uncleaniness and ugliness, is juxtaposed with the pure and white sucks and beautiful sky.', '2006-09-01 06:18:51.000000', NULL, 1),
