(2781863, 387226, 31307, '<td valign="top">There is a lot of extra space here that I think does not really contribute to the image.  A closer crop on the schooner and sun would be better, I feel.</td>', 'There is a lot of extra space here that I think does not really contribute to the image.  A closer crop on the schooner and sun would be better, I feel.', '2006-09-01 06:20:32.000000', NULL, 1),
