(2781878, 388783, 46097, '<td valign="top">I just LOVE this.....the colour contrast is so powerful, and the whole photo just has such ''pop''. Only thing is, I wish you''d used your whole size allocation, and made it a bigger photo, and perhaps toned down the highlights to the left of the picture. But very nice....well done.</td>', 'I just LOVE this.....the colour contrast is so powerful, and the whole photo just has such ''pop''. Only thing is, I wish you''d used your whole size allocation, and made it a bigger photo, and perhaps toned down the highlights to the left of the picture. But very nice....well done.', '2006-09-01 06:25:21.000000', NULL, 1),
