(2782482, 385096, 8125, '<td valign="top">Absolutely fabulous shot!  This is a terrific new baby set up.  Love it!  The diaper is a tiny bit blown out which catches my eye, but doesn''t take away from my scoring in the least bit as everything else is perfect!  Wonderful job!!!!</td>', 'Absolutely fabulous shot!  This is a terrific new baby set up.  Love it!  The diaper is a tiny bit blown out which catches my eye, but doesn''t take away from my scoring in the least bit as everything else is perfect!  Wonderful job!!!!', '2006-09-01 09:28:17.000000', NULL, 1),
