(2782529, 381288, 60396, '<td valign="top">Well done, it''s not easy to capture a bumble bee - lots of patience unless you''re extremely lucky.</td>', 'Well done, it''s not easy to capture a bumble bee - lots of patience unless you''re extremely lucky.', '2006-09-01 09:48:38.000000', NULL, 1),
