(2782536, 386272, 43774, '<td valign="top">Another wow. The 2nd one in the challenge so far. Deserves to be in the top 3, I hope I see it there!!</td>', 'Another wow. The 2nd one in the challenge so far. Deserves to be in the top 3, I hope I see it there!!', '2006-09-01 09:50:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2782537, 388026, 43463, '<td valign="top">The square format really helps tighten the composition. Good choice in going with B&amp;W because there is alot of elements in the photo that would get quite bogged down and overly busy if it had been in color. With the B&amp;W the viewer gets to drink in the shapes and textures present in the photo. Love how the masts of the ships ''mirror'' that of the city skyline. The sparkles on the water  give a little magical feel to it. The boats in the shipyard offer a promise of escape from the hectic bustle of the city to open waters that are calm and enchanting. And how wonderful that that the mood of serene calm is best represented by the name of the boat that is perfectly illuminated: Serenity.</td>', 'The square format really helps tighten the composition. Good choice in going with B&W because there is alot of elements in the photo that would get quite bogged down and overly busy if it had been in color. With the B&W the viewer gets to drink in the shapes and textures present in the photo. Love how the masts of the ships ''mirror'' that of the city skyline. The sparkles on the water  give a little magical feel to it. The boats in the shipyard offer a promise of escape from the hectic bustle of the city to open waters that are calm and enchanting. And how wonderful that that the mood of serene calm is best represented by the name of the boat that is perfectly illuminated: Serenity.', '2006-09-01 09:50:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2782538, 386173, 60396, '<td valign="top">Bit more DOF would be nice.  Lovely eyes.</td>', 'Bit more DOF would be nice.  Lovely eyes.', '2006-09-01 09:50:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2782539, 386903, 32345, '<td valign="top">Sorry but I don''t like the post processing you did with this picture. This is just my opinion and I''m not an expert. Others voters might fall in love with it. Good luck.</td>', 'Sorry but I don''t like the post processing you did with this picture. This is just my opinion and I''m not an expert. Others voters might fall in love with it. Good luck.', '2006-09-01 09:50:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2782543, 388374, 62671, '<td valign="top">To much empty sky,  I would have cropped the top to be more panoramic looking.  Lovely cityscape.</td>', 'To much empty sky,  I would have cropped the top to be more panoramic looking.  Lovely cityscape.', '2006-09-01 09:52:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2782549, 384956, 63104, '<td valign="top">too cute for words :)</td>', 'too cute for words :)', '2006-09-01 09:54:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2782555, 383810, 15711, '<td valign="top">Brilliant portrait. The eyes are telling.  The detail - outstanding. 10</td>', 'Brilliant portrait. The eyes are telling.  The detail - outstanding. 10', '2006-09-01 09:55:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2782558, 382385, 15711, '<td valign="top">I just wish she were smiling. ;~(</td>', 'I just wish she were smiling. ;~(', '2006-09-01 09:56:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2782559, 376642, 43463, '<td valign="top">I love the feel and mood that this composition projects. The colors and composition of the fish in the aquarium are wonderful. Viewed alongside the silent observer in the right hand corner it comes across as a scene in which he/she gazes upon the watery world and is lost in contemplation. My only critique is that the lighting illuminating the individual could be better. The upper half of the body and the head are too dark and the color tones tend to blend in to much with the color of the aquarium water. It would improve the composition if the shape of the person was much more distinct.</td>', 'I love the feel and mood that this composition projects. The colors and composition of the fish in the aquarium are wonderful. Viewed alongside the silent observer in the right hand corner it comes across as a scene in which he/she gazes upon the watery world and is lost in contemplation. My only critique is that the lighting illuminating the individual could be better. The upper half of the body and the head are too dark and the color tones tend to blend in to much with the color of the aquarium water. It would improve the composition if the shape of the person was much more distinct.', '2006-09-01 09:56:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2782560, 383720, 20066, '<td valign="top">too small....</td>', 'too small....', '2006-09-01 09:56:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2782564, 384844, 16004, '<td valign="top">a truly wonderful portrait.  playful, coy, warm, romantic and alluring, this is a really sweet, lovely image where the personality of the subject really shines through.  it feels <i>real</i> as well, not just a "strike a pose" moment like you get umpteen times elsewhere.  i love the monochrome and the nice level of contrast; really complements her hair.  the detail of the eye is super, though subtlety done so even though attention is gently nudged towards it, it isn''t forced.  love this - 10.</td>', 'a truly wonderful portrait.  playful, coy, warm, romantic and alluring, this is a really sweet, lovely image where the personality of the subject really shines through.  it feels real as well, not just a "strike a pose" moment like you get umpteen times elsewhere.  i love the monochrome and the nice level of contrast; really complements her hair.  the detail of the eye is super, though subtlety done so even though attention is gently nudged towards it, it isn''t forced.  love this - 10.', '2006-09-01 09:57:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2782565, 387292, 15711, '<td valign="top">Lovely in its simplicity. I can hear the wind rustling! What would happen if you saturated the colors a tad?? Just a thought. 7</td>', 'Lovely in its simplicity. I can hear the wind rustling! What would happen if you saturated the colors a tad?? Just a thought. 7', '2006-09-01 09:57:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2782568, 379985, 43410, '<td valign="top">beautiful detail on the eyes, great job.  only nitpick is i would have cloned out the circular splotch up top left.  it''s somewhat destracting, but what a beautiful image.  great job.  7</td>', 'beautiful detail on the eyes, great job.  only nitpick is i would have cloned out the circular splotch up top left.  it''s somewhat destracting, but what a beautiful image.  great job.  7', '2006-09-01 09:58:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2782569, 388349, 15711, '<td valign="top">Awesome capture. Perfect lighting. Symmetry always works with cars. RKT?</td>', 'Awesome capture. Perfect lighting. Symmetry always works with cars. RKT?', '2006-09-01 09:58:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2782571, 381508, 62671, '<td valign="top">Rainbows are so hard to get right.   Your horizon runs right thru the center.  You could loose a quarter of the image and still keep the rainbow intact.</td>', 'Rainbows are so hard to get right.   Your horizon runs right thru the center.  You could loose a quarter of the image and still keep the rainbow intact.', '2006-09-01 09:58:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2782572, 388320, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nostalgic sense. Almost looks painted. The diminished colors works well to help create the mood of long ago. 7</td>', 'Nostalgic sense. Almost looks painted. The diminished colors works well to help create the mood of long ago. 7', '2006-09-01 09:58:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2782574, 384243, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the idea but it seems that it might have been slightly blurred, so oversharpening is apparent.</td>', 'I like the idea but it seems that it might have been slightly blurred, so oversharpening is apparent.', '2006-09-01 09:59:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2782575, 386395, 43565, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity of this shot, however I find the front bud somewhat distracting.  8 for now and a second look later</td>', 'I like the simplicity of this shot, however I find the front bud somewhat distracting.  8 for now and a second look later', '2006-09-01 09:59:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2782576, 388347, 62671, '<td valign="top">exceptional lightning capture.  would have been better with the ground showing at the 1/3 line.</td>', 'exceptional lightning capture.  would have been better with the ground showing at the 1/3 line.', '2006-09-01 10:00:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2782577, 384877, 15711, '<td valign="top">Very sweet face. The light is nice. I might have cropped so that her face filled more of the frame. Great focus and detail. 7</td>', 'Very sweet face. The light is nice. I might have cropped so that her face filled more of the frame. Great focus and detail. 7', '2006-09-01 10:00:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2782578, 386438, 43410, '<td valign="top">beautiful!  nice capture :)</td>', 'beautiful!  nice capture :)', '2006-09-01 10:00:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2782590, 378498, 43463, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely portrait. Love the tones and colors on this from the rustic browns of the old wood to the soft pastel pink of the girl''s dress that brings the punch of color into the scene. I like the dichotomy of the old and new you present in this composition. The old and rustic (and falling apart) surroundings of the chair, porch, window, and iron gate juxtapositioned next to the little girl holding flowers which symbologically represents life anew. She is Spring to the rustic house''s Autumn. My only critique on this portrait is that the girl''s expression. She is looking directly at the photographer/viewer and projects the feel that she is not quite happy with her picture being taken. A much more candid or relaxed shot when she is not looking directly at the camera would have been better.</td>', 'This is a lovely portrait. Love the tones and colors on this from the rustic browns of the old wood to the soft pastel pink of the girl''s dress that brings the punch of color into the scene. I like the dichotomy of the old and new you present in this composition. The old and rustic (and falling apart) surroundings of the chair, porch, window, and iron gate juxtapositioned next to the little girl holding flowers which symbologically represents life anew. She is Spring to the rustic house''s Autumn. My only critique on this portrait is that the girl''s expression. She is looking directly at the photographer/viewer and projects the feel that she is not quite happy with her picture being taken. A much more candid or relaxed shot when she is not looking directly at the camera would have been better.', '2006-09-01 10:04:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2782593, 386039, 43565, '<td valign="top">I would like this better if the bee was more in focus since it is the subject.</td>', 'I would like this better if the bee was more in focus since it is the subject.', '2006-09-01 10:05:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2782597, 388298, 62671, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot.  The lights on the right are distracting to the image. Thats some serious erosion going on there.  Wonder when the last time one of those humongo boulders came away from the face.  I really like the lighting and the softness of the water.  The boulders are crisp and have great texture. I want to zoom in and see the boulders better.  Good one!</td>', 'This is a great shot.  The lights on the right are distracting to the image. Thats some serious erosion going on there.  Wonder when the last time one of those humongo boulders came away from the face.  I really like the lighting and the softness of the water.  The boulders are crisp and have great texture. I want to zoom in and see the boulders better.  Good one!', '2006-09-01 10:06:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2782605, 387709, 62671, '<td valign="top">I like the angle the butterfly is in.  Love how your showing the plant he is on and the pastel colors in the background.  This one is better than mine! ;)</td>', 'I like the angle the butterfly is in.  Love how your showing the plant he is on and the pastel colors in the background.  This one is better than mine! ;)', '2006-09-01 10:08:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2782618, 383991, 43410, '<td valign="top">great detail.  very nice job. 8</td>', 'great detail.  very nice job. 8', '2006-09-01 10:12:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2782621, 388578, 43463, '<td valign="top">Great composition. Alone on the barren rock surrounded by the vast and open sea sits a man curled up in contemplation. Yes, I get the sense that he is very alone with his thoughts because in the composition he is small to his surroundings. While that  composition choice plays as a strength to creating the mood it also is a weakness. I think that you could have cropped another 20% of the image and captured the same mood. And, the advantage would be that it would have called greater attention to the figure sitting on the rocks - he is a little too lost in his surroundings. The colors are a tad too surreal - the purple &amp; blue hues in the sky and the sea appear to vivid, too unnatural in that they almost take on a supernatural effect.</td>', 'Great composition. Alone on the barren rock surrounded by the vast and open sea sits a man curled up in contemplation. Yes, I get the sense that he is very alone with his thoughts because in the composition he is small to his surroundings. While that  composition choice plays as a strength to creating the mood it also is a weakness. I think that you could have cropped another 20% of the image and captured the same mood. And, the advantage would be that it would have called greater attention to the figure sitting on the rocks - he is a little too lost in his surroundings. The colors are a tad too surreal - the purple & blue hues in the sky and the sea appear to vivid, too unnatural in that they almost take on a supernatural effect.', '2006-09-01 10:12:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2782623, 388751, 43410, '<td valign="top">this is amazing.  if you did some free transform to pull down the right edge, this would be perfect.  not taking away from it, hope that doesn''t offend.  this really is a great image.  good luck!  6</td>', 'this is amazing.  if you did some free transform to pull down the right edge, this would be perfect.  not taking away from it, hope that doesn''t offend.  this really is a great image.  good luck!  6', '2006-09-01 10:13:33.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2782626, 384388, 56797, '<td valign="top">Beautiful processing. the grass looks so lush and soft I wanna dive in. that building has a lot of interest too and great job of burning the edges to draw the eye in. 8</td>', 'Beautiful processing. the grass looks so lush and soft I wanna dive in. that building has a lot of interest too and great job of burning the edges to draw the eye in. 8', '2006-09-01 10:14:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2782631, 388914, 31443, '<td valign="top">Wonderful clarity all around, I can almost hear the water...</td>', 'Wonderful clarity all around, I can almost hear the water...', '2006-09-01 10:16:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2782632, 388310, 56797, '<td valign="top">nice DOF and very interesting frog. the red adds interest too and pushes my eye down toward the frog where it should be.</td>', 'nice DOF and very interesting frog. the red adds interest too and pushes my eye down toward the frog where it should be.', '2006-09-01 10:16:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2782634, 388730, 31443, '<td valign="top">Looks like a huge ogre hovering over the houses, nice..</td>', 'Looks like a huge ogre hovering over the houses, nice..', '2006-09-01 10:17:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2782636, 386438, 56797, '<td valign="top">maybe a bit too busy. theres no where my eye wants to fall. its all over the place. except for maybe that closest cow who looks like his mouth is cut off(i realize its not). great saturation and colors though.</td>', 'maybe a bit too busy. theres no where my eye wants to fall. its all over the place. except for maybe that closest cow who looks like his mouth is cut off(i realize its not). great saturation and colors though.', '2006-09-01 10:18:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2782637, 385810, 43463, '<td valign="top">Love the vibrant hues of green and the variety of foliage in the shot - really makes an impact in the composition because I think spring and renewel which plays well with the title of the piece. I like how you used the columns to naturally frame the futuristic glass building seen in the background. It is that framing that really complements the main focus the futuristic glass building surrounded by nature.</td>', 'Love the vibrant hues of green and the variety of foliage in the shot - really makes an impact in the composition because I think spring and renewel which plays well with the title of the piece. I like how you used the columns to naturally frame the futuristic glass building seen in the background. It is that framing that really complements the main focus the futuristic glass building surrounded by nature.', '2006-09-01 10:18:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2782639, 376642, 52074, '<td valign="top">What an awesome, AWESOME photograph!!! "10"</td>', 'What an awesome, AWESOME photograph!!! "10"', '2006-09-01 10:20:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2782643, 383689, 56167, '<td valign="top">nice skies</td>', 'nice skies', '2006-09-01 10:21:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2782647, 388778, 56797, '<td valign="top">I like the movement of the clouds alot. nice effect. think it could maybe use some more contrast though. doesnt really pop.</td>', 'I like the movement of the clouds alot. nice effect. think it could maybe use some more contrast though. doesnt really pop.', '2006-09-01 10:22:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2782652, 387216, 56797, '<td valign="top">seems a little over neatimaged ont he skin but those eyes are STUNNING. I could stare at those all day. nice movement in the hair too. and nice cmposition.</td>', 'seems a little over neatimaged ont he skin but those eyes are STUNNING. I could stare at those all day. nice movement in the hair too. and nice cmposition.', '2006-09-01 10:23:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2782653, 387461, 43463, '<td valign="top">At the end of the day all that remains is the reminents of man''s creation. I think that this composition really does well to capture the mood of the passage of time and that what man creates does not stand up to the test of time. Because, eventually, the tides of time come and wash away what once was. Once there was a dock here - life teemed here with men making their way to this dock to fish and/or perhaps just contemplate. But it is no more - only the foundation - the bones remain and eventually they too will be swept away. Wonderfully composed picture.</td>', 'At the end of the day all that remains is the reminents of man''s creation. I think that this composition really does well to capture the mood of the passage of time and that what man creates does not stand up to the test of time. Because, eventually, the tides of time come and wash away what once was. Once there was a dock here - life teemed here with men making their way to this dock to fish and/or perhaps just contemplate. But it is no more - only the foundation - the bones remain and eventually they too will be swept away. Wonderfully composed picture.', '2006-09-01 10:23:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2782655, 381929, 56797, '<td valign="top">nice candid, and great contrast.</td>', 'nice candid, and great contrast.', '2006-09-01 10:24:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2782657, 386903, 58055, '<td valign="top">the effect is not for me i''m afraid</td>', 'the effect is not for me i''m afraid', '2006-09-01 10:24:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2782661, 386997, 52074, '<td valign="top">What a wonderful conceptual idea...love the shadows and highlites..great!!!</td>', 'What a wonderful conceptual idea...love the shadows and highlites..great!!!', '2006-09-01 10:25:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2782662, 387401, 37719, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and the b/w treatment.  But I find myself distracted by the foot.  All seems to be still in the shot except for that.</td>', 'I like the composition and the b/w treatment.  But I find myself distracted by the foot.  All seems to be still in the shot except for that.', '2006-09-01 10:25:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2782663, 386242, 56797, '<td valign="top">is that rain or movement of a ton of stars? very beautiful. I would love if I could see them better. beautiful star effect from the lighthouse light too. overall seems too dark and maybe a bit "cloudy" but still a nice image.</td>', 'is that rain or movement of a ton of stars? very beautiful. I would love if I could see them better. beautiful star effect from the lighthouse light too. overall seems too dark and maybe a bit "cloudy" but still a nice image.', '2006-09-01 10:26:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2782664, 383593, 56797, '<td valign="top">Wow! if this is real than WOW! thats beautiful. 8</td>', 'Wow! if this is real than WOW! thats beautiful. 8', '2006-09-01 10:27:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2782665, 388921, 16004, '<td valign="top">really cute, but oddly darkly ominous too.  it feels very modernist as well, in addition to being creative, bit mad and thoroughly likeable.  everything works; the high contrast, the whitening of the whites of the eyes, the big hit of noise reduction.  i also like the close crop, the nice background, and even the border. it''s all really effective and goes together to create a really diverse, interesting image.  10.</td>', 'really cute, but oddly darkly ominous too.  it feels very modernist as well, in addition to being creative, bit mad and thoroughly likeable.  everything works; the high contrast, the whitening of the whites of the eyes, the big hit of noise reduction.  i also like the close crop, the nice background, and even the border. it''s all really effective and goes together to create a really diverse, interesting image.  10.', '2006-09-01 10:27:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2782666, 383098, 61818, '<td valign="top">Lol, the girl at the Bristol Rennaisance Fair.  I took pictures of her as well, and also the other guy and girl working the Henna booth. <br/> <br/>Nice shot, good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Lol, the girl at the Bristol Rennaisance Fair.  I took pictures of her as well, and also the other guy and girl working the Henna booth.  Nice shot, good luck in the challenge.', '2006-09-01 10:28:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2782667, 389026, 56797, '<td valign="top">I love everything about this but the color of the water. its seems very unnatural to me. if it more closely mirrored the color of the sky it would be a 10. as is an 8. good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I love everything about this but the color of the water. its seems very unnatural to me. if it more closely mirrored the color of the sky it would be a 10. as is an 8. good luck in the challenge.', '2006-09-01 10:28:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2782669, 386910, 62671, '<td valign="top">I, personally don''t think the necklace matches the feel of the satin gloves. A string of pearls.  something that looks wealthy would work best.   I like the shy ''modesty'' look of the image. Like the virgin brides first time...  Pose of the hands look good but I would have straightened the finger of the glove, on the right hand.  The shoulders are square to the camera.  I would have brought the left shoulder closer just slightly and lower it.  bring her chin toward the left. Keep her face downward but had her look up at the camera for a shy ''happy'' occasion.</td>', 'I, personally don''t think the necklace matches the feel of the satin gloves. A string of pearls.  something that looks wealthy would work best.   I like the shy ''modesty'' look of the image. Like the virgin brides first time...  Pose of the hands look good but I would have straightened the finger of the glove, on the right hand.  The shoulders are square to the camera.  I would have brought the left shoulder closer just slightly and lower it.  bring her chin toward the left. Keep her face downward but had her look up at the camera for a shy ''happy'' occasion.', '2006-09-01 10:28:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2782670, 376657, 43463, '<td valign="top">Love the rich warm tones of the golds, oranges, and reds! It really projects a warm summer day spent in the ocean. Love the silhouette of the surfer and the golden ball of the sun as it sinks into the ocean waves. My only critique, and a little one at that, is that the mind fills in the blanks for us - we know he must be on a surfboard but it is not prominently visible. He appears like he is leviating on the surface of the water. If the shape of the board were more visible than it would improve the composition.</td>', 'Love the rich warm tones of the golds, oranges, and reds! It really projects a warm summer day spent in the ocean. Love the silhouette of the surfer and the golden ball of the sun as it sinks into the ocean waves. My only critique, and a little one at that, is that the mind fills in the blanks for us - we know he must be on a surfboard but it is not prominently visible. He appears like he is leviating on the surface of the water. If the shape of the board were more visible than it would improve the composition.', '2006-09-01 10:28:42.000000', NULL, 1),
