(2782777, 388788, 43463, '<td valign="top">I really love the colors, textures, and composition of this photo. I don''t know exactly why but I think of the book Cannery Row (which is set mainly on a fishing town and it''s docks). Perhaps it is the wooden barn/boathouse with all the accoutrements of daily life in and around it. The nettings, tarps, ladder, the hose, the great circular tub, and even the table and three white chairs ALL capture a feel &amp; ''culture'' of daily life that exists at this location. Wonderful photo.</td>', 'I really love the colors, textures, and composition of this photo. I don''t know exactly why but I think of the book Cannery Row (which is set mainly on a fishing town and it''s docks). Perhaps it is the wooden barn/boathouse with all the accoutrements of daily life in and around it. The nettings, tarps, ladder, the hose, the great circular tub, and even the table and three white chairs ALL capture a feel & ''culture'' of daily life that exists at this location. Wonderful photo.', '2006-09-01 10:49:40.000000', NULL, 1),
