(2782995, 388867, 60862, '<td valign="top">Are those spices?  I can''t tell from the picture, but I''m guessing that''s the meaning of "seasoning."<br/> <br/>This could be better, for me at least.  The shape is interesting, but the overexposure, lack of much contrast, and varied focus along its length make it hard for me to understand what I''m looking at.  And purely as an abstract, the dull colors don''t grab me.  I also find the bits to the left distract me from the main shape.<br/> <br/>Just my opinion;  I can see where others might really like it!</td>', 'Are those spices?  I can''t tell from the picture, but I''m guessing that''s the meaning of "seasoning." This could be better, for me at least.  The shape is interesting, but the overexposure, lack of much contrast, and varied focus along its length make it hard for me to understand what I''m looking at.  And purely as an abstract, the dull colors don''t grab me.  I also find the bits to the left distract me from the main shape. Just my opinion;  I can see where others might really like it!', '2006-09-01 11:23:10.000000', NULL, 1),
