(2783010, 388621, 60862, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot.  Good subject, great eyes, nice composition.  But since the eyes, as usual, are the real attention-grabber, they should be very sharp.  It looks like you (or your camera) focused instead on the beak.  Also, a broader DOF would''ve brought out the details in the feathers better.  Still, a 6.</td>', 'This is a great shot.  Good subject, great eyes, nice composition.  But since the eyes, as usual, are the real attention-grabber, they should be very sharp.  It looks like you (or your camera) focused instead on the beak.  Also, a broader DOF would''ve brought out the details in the feathers better.  Still, a 6.', '2006-09-01 11:25:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2783011, 386103, 56797, '<td valign="top">Gives me an odd uneasy feeling. maybe just becasue it makes me feel so close to the models face like i''m in his "personal space" lol. nice composition.</td>', 'Gives me an odd uneasy feeling. maybe just becasue it makes me feel so close to the models face like i''m in his "personal space" lol. nice composition.', '2006-09-01 11:25:26.000000', NULL, 1),
