(2783021, 387540, 2780, '<td valign="top">Composition: 7 - Really nice, not quite centered but not quite following the generic "rules" - works well!<br/>Technical: 6 - I like the soft focus and the high key but its a shame the hat blends into the sky.<br/>Creativity: 6 - I like that it poses questions such as where is she going, and what is she looking at?<br/>Appeal: 6 - Could add appeal by adding a slight sepia tint, really subtly, just to add some warmth. The B&amp;W just seems a bit cold and uninteresting.<br/> <br/>Overall Calculated Average Score: 6</td>', 'Composition: 7 - Really nice, not quite centered but not quite following the generic "rules" - works well!Technical: 6 - I like the soft focus and the high key but its a shame the hat blends into the sky.Creativity: 6 - I like that it poses questions such as where is she going, and what is she looking at?Appeal: 6 - Could add appeal by adding a slight sepia tint, really subtly, just to add some warmth. The B&W just seems a bit cold and uninteresting. Overall Calculated Average Score: 6', '2006-09-01 11:26:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2783022, 388259, 46177, '<td valign="top">Beautiful focus on the eyes, very nicely done.</td>', 'Beautiful focus on the eyes, very nicely done.', '2006-09-01 11:26:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2783023, 387149, 60862, '<td valign="top">Nice subject and good energy in her motion.  However, the lighting''s kind of flat - maybe you could enhance the contrast in processing?  And there seems to be a fair amount of noise.  I''m guessing you were at a relatively high ISO to stop the motion as much as possible, which creates noise.  If you don''t have noise reduction software, the Community Version of Noiseware is free and pretty good.</td>', 'Nice subject and good energy in her motion.  However, the lighting''s kind of flat - maybe you could enhance the contrast in processing?  And there seems to be a fair amount of noise.  I''m guessing you were at a relatively high ISO to stop the motion as much as possible, which creates noise.  If you don''t have noise reduction software, the Community Version of Noiseware is free and pretty good.', '2006-09-01 11:27:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2783024, 377149, 60779, '<td valign="top">Cool capture. I have a similar shot. Not easy to get exposure right. You''ve achieved that. 7</td>', 'Cool capture. I have a similar shot. Not easy to get exposure right. You''ve achieved that. 7', '2006-09-01 11:27:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2783025, 388804, 47205, '<td valign="top">I like the composition of this shot a lot, but I am not sure about the over saturation of the colors of the flowers in the foreground or the bridge. However with that said, the reflection is nice and I like the feel and color of the sky. (7)</td>', 'I like the composition of this shot a lot, but I am not sure about the over saturation of the colors of the flowers in the foreground or the bridge. However with that said, the reflection is nice and I like the feel and color of the sky. (7)', '2006-09-01 11:27:59.000000', NULL, 1),
