(2783073, 379935, 2780, '<td valign="top">Composition: 5 - Good, but too much black at the bottom imo.<br/>Technical: 5 - Nice exposure on the sky but there is actually some detail in the silhouette which I find distracting. Not enough to see it properly, but enough to stop it looking like a proper silhouette. Brightness/Contrast in PS would help make it darker, and also make the sky more vibrant.<br/>Creativity: 6 - I like how the castle is almost as tall as him! :)<br/>Appeal: 5 - Not an awful lot here to hold my interest for long, sorry.<br/> <br/>Overall Calculated Average Score: 5</td>', 'Composition: 5 - Good, but too much black at the bottom imo.Technical: 5 - Nice exposure on the sky but there is actually some detail in the silhouette which I find distracting. Not enough to see it properly, but enough to stop it looking like a proper silhouette. Brightness/Contrast in PS would help make it darker, and also make the sky more vibrant.Creativity: 6 - I like how the castle is almost as tall as him! :)Appeal: 5 - Not an awful lot here to hold my interest for long, sorry. Overall Calculated Average Score: 5', '2006-09-01 11:34:21.000000', NULL, 1),
