(2783248, 381288, 2780, '<td valign="top">Composition: 4 - Its too centred in my opinion.<br/>Technical: 3 - It looks like you''ve cropped a lot to get this close, and the sharpness and image quality has suffered.<br/>Creativity: 3 - I would have liked a further out crop so that we could see more of the surrounding flower, which would separate it from similar bee shots.<br/>Appeal: 3<br/> <br/>Overall Calculated Average Score: 3</td>', 'Composition: 4 - Its too centred in my opinion.Technical: 3 - It looks like you''ve cropped a lot to get this close, and the sharpness and image quality has suffered.Creativity: 3 - I would have liked a further out crop so that we could see more of the surrounding flower, which would separate it from similar bee shots.Appeal: 3 Overall Calculated Average Score: 3', '2006-09-01 11:59:55.000000', NULL, 1),
