(2783273, 384105, 2780, '<td valign="top">Composition: 7 - I like it, all areas of the photo have different points of interest.<br/>Technical: 6 - A little dark overall, and not as sharp as it could be, but still a nice mood is evoked.<br/>Creativity: 7 - The light really makes this unique<br/>Appeal: 6 - I think a little more detail and sharpness would really improve this, but its definately an interesting shot.<br/> <br/>Overall Calculated Average Score: 6</td>', 'Composition: 7 - I like it, all areas of the photo have different points of interest.Technical: 6 - A little dark overall, and not as sharp as it could be, but still a nice mood is evoked.Creativity: 7 - The light really makes this uniqueAppeal: 6 - I think a little more detail and sharpness would really improve this, but its definately an interesting shot. Overall Calculated Average Score: 6', '2006-09-01 12:03:09.000000', NULL, 1),
