(2783291, 386391, 31403, '<td valign="top">the most seductive motivational poster I''ve ever seen.<br/> <br/>I find myself wondering if this is a photo of a re-bar grid or of a beautiful woman.  My eye WANTS to see the woman (of course) but the composition shows me you liked the re-bar better.<br/> <br/>All that means I would prefer a tighter crop.<br/> <br/>One of the more creative shots I''ve seen in this challenge.  Thank you for that!</td>', 'the most seductive motivational poster I''ve ever seen. I find myself wondering if this is a photo of a re-bar grid or of a beautiful woman.  My eye WANTS to see the woman (of course) but the composition shows me you liked the re-bar better. All that means I would prefer a tighter crop. One of the more creative shots I''ve seen in this challenge.  Thank you for that!', '2006-09-01 12:05:59.000000', NULL, 1),
