(2783525, 388995, 34217, '<td valign="top">take the diaper off.  I realize that there may be a chance of pee or poop with the little one, but your picture will be better.  I have had my hand pooped on and my foot peed on and I was only the photographer not the mom or dad.  It is worth the risk, babies are meant to be photographed naked!  Nice moment though.</td>', 'take the diaper off.  I realize that there may be a chance of pee or poop with the little one, but your picture will be better.  I have had my hand pooped on and my foot peed on and I was only the photographer not the mom or dad.  It is worth the risk, babies are meant to be photographed naked!  Nice moment though.', '2006-09-01 12:54:15.000000', NULL, 1),
