(2783559, 377207, 2780, '<td valign="top">Composition: 10 - Spot on :)<br/>Technical: 6 - The sky is great, but the colour of the water doesn''t quite work for me, especially the blue parts nearer the horizon. The darks parts should be darker in my opinion, using levels, as they''re not quite black at the moment.<br/>Creativity: 6 - I''ve seen lots of similar shots before but the unique cloud patterns and colours make it stand out above the rest :)<br/>Appeal: 7 - Very nice photo to look at, with just a couple of minor flaws.<br/> <br/>Overall Calculated Average Score: 6</td>', 'Composition: 10 - Spot on :)Technical: 6 - The sky is great, but the colour of the water doesn''t quite work for me, especially the blue parts nearer the horizon. The darks parts should be darker in my opinion, using levels, as they''re not quite black at the moment.Creativity: 6 - I''ve seen lots of similar shots before but the unique cloud patterns and colours make it stand out above the rest :)Appeal: 7 - Very nice photo to look at, with just a couple of minor flaws. Overall Calculated Average Score: 6', '2006-09-01 13:03:52.000000', NULL, 1),
