(2783569, 388985, 2780, '<td valign="top">Composition: 6 - Nicely framed with lots of stuff going on all around the central point of the ball<br/>Technical: 7 - Well exposed, emotion captured, just the cropping of half the leftmost person is a small distraction. DoF works well, but shallower to hide the fence would improve it imo.<br/>Creativity: 4 - There isnt anything here that to me separates it from other football shots.<br/>Appeal: 5 - The nice rich colours and lots of things happening means this holds my attention for a while.<br/> <br/>Overall Calculated Average Score: 5</td>', 'Composition: 6 - Nicely framed with lots of stuff going on all around the central point of the ballTechnical: 7 - Well exposed, emotion captured, just the cropping of half the leftmost person is a small distraction. DoF works well, but shallower to hide the fence would improve it imo.Creativity: 4 - There isnt anything here that to me separates it from other football shots.Appeal: 5 - The nice rich colours and lots of things happening means this holds my attention for a while. Overall Calculated Average Score: 5', '2006-09-01 13:06:19.000000', NULL, 1),
