(2783623, 387790, 59215, '<td valign="top">Wonderful image. The warm colors combined with the soft horizon line and the delecate outlines of the flowers create a beautiful dream-like environment. I take it the little specks near the moon and to the right in the sky are stars? Took me a little while to realize as I found them distracting at first. I would suggest removing them, or perhaps adding a bunch more to add to the surealness of the image. Definately one of my favorites so far! 8</td>', 'Wonderful image. The warm colors combined with the soft horizon line and the delecate outlines of the flowers create a beautiful dream-like environment. I take it the little specks near the moon and to the right in the sky are stars? Took me a little while to realize as I found them distracting at first. I would suggest removing them, or perhaps adding a bunch more to add to the surealness of the image. Definately one of my favorites so far! 8', '2006-09-01 13:22:51.000000', NULL, 1),
