(2784352, 388619, 40106, '<td valign="top">Some thoughts:<br/> <br/>- Definitely a unique idea.<br/>- This photo could be a lot strong with better lighting and more post processing.<br/>-  Would be more compelling if it were in a different setting, something more dark and eerie.<br/>-  Wish the face on the box was more noticeable... perhaps use a sharpie ((this is assuming this portrait was set up))<br/>-Score: 5</td>', 'Some thoughts: - Definitely a unique idea.- This photo could be a lot strong with better lighting and more post processing.-  Would be more compelling if it were in a different setting, something more dark and eerie.-  Wish the face on the box was more noticeable... perhaps use a sharpie ((this is assuming this portrait was set up))-Score: 5', '2006-09-01 16:02:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2784353, 388651, 56797, '<td valign="top">way too much negative space for me. id like more black at the bottom too. the sillohoute(sp?) is done very well though.</td>', 'way too much negative space for me. id like more black at the bottom too. the sillohoute(sp?) is done very well though.', '2006-09-01 16:02:38.000000', NULL, 1),
