(2784361, 388943, 40106, '<td valign="top">Some thoughts:<br/> <br/>-Absolutely stunning!!<br/>-Black and white is perfect here!<br/>-Love the contrast!<br/>-In my opinon, this would be better if the legs were not included in the frame.  <br/>-Score: 8</td>', 'Some thoughts: -Absolutely stunning!!-Black and white is perfect here!-Love the contrast!-In my opinon, this would be better if the legs were not included in the frame.  -Score: 8', '2006-09-01 16:04:06.000000', NULL, 1),
