(2784365, 381395, 10268, '<td valign="top">To be honest, there just isn''t anything about this photo that makes me want to keep looking at it.  the colors are average, the clouds are average.  There are very few details in the statue.  I''m just finding it a little boring to be honest.  5</td>', 'To be honest, there just isn''t anything about this photo that makes me want to keep looking at it.  the colors are average, the clouds are average.  There are very few details in the statue.  I''m just finding it a little boring to be honest.  5', '2006-09-01 16:05:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2784366, 383593, 40718, '<td valign="top">Well, I''m quite confused about this one and how it was done.  I''ll give you a 7 right now, but I have to ask for validation, so look for it.</td>', 'Well, I''m quite confused about this one and how it was done.  I''ll give you a 7 right now, but I have to ask for validation, so look for it.', '2006-09-01 16:05:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2784367, 374261, 19708, '<td valign="top">Moments in life such as this are so important to capture.<br/>This is an exceptional image in my opinion, partly due to the human element, but also greatly in part because of the textures and details in the stone and fixtures. I really hope the selective destauration here isn''t getting this image voted down, as it is very well done, and has been added to my favorites.</td>', 'Moments in life such as this are so important to capture.This is an exceptional image in my opinion, partly due to the human element, but also greatly in part because of the textures and details in the stone and fixtures. I really hope the selective destauration here isn''t getting this image voted down, as it is very well done, and has been added to my favorites.', '2006-09-01 16:05:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2784368, 381650, 19708, '<td valign="top">Absolutely gorgeous.<br/>What a viewpoint too!</td>', 'Absolutely gorgeous.What a viewpoint too!', '2006-09-01 16:05:28.000000', NULL, 1),
