(2784688, 385063, 2780, '<td valign="top">Composition: 8 - Very nice, showing the character in the man''s face as well as part of the background. I''d have preferred him to be looking into the frame rather than out of it tho.<br/>Technical: 6 - Some overly bright spots in places on his face, but other than those the high contrast approach works well.<br/>Creativity: 5 - You do show a lot of the mans character in the shot, however you choice of background is obscured mostly by black so I can''t tell the situation well.<br/>Appeal: 5<br/> <br/>Overall Calculated Average Score: 6</td>', 'Composition: 8 - Very nice, showing the character in the man''s face as well as part of the background. I''d have preferred him to be looking into the frame rather than out of it tho.Technical: 6 - Some overly bright spots in places on his face, but other than those the high contrast approach works well.Creativity: 5 - You do show a lot of the mans character in the shot, however you choice of background is obscured mostly by black so I can''t tell the situation well.Appeal: 5 Overall Calculated Average Score: 6', '2006-09-01 17:03:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2784693, 388839, 6999, '<td valign="top">I rather like this: that hand, of course, but more perhaps the sheer graininess of it. There are sophisticated parallels of lines - the boarding, the boy''s fingers, the shadow fingers. There''s something more than a simple snapshot - or perhaps I mean that there''s something about certain snapshots that sometimes works on more levels - that escapes the derogatory meaning of ''snapshot''. Lovely work - and I hope I''m not the only one to notice.</td>', 'I rather like this: that hand, of course, but more perhaps the sheer graininess of it. There are sophisticated parallels of lines - the boarding, the boy''s fingers, the shadow fingers. There''s something more than a simple snapshot - or perhaps I mean that there''s something about certain snapshots that sometimes works on more levels - that escapes the derogatory meaning of ''snapshot''. Lovely work - and I hope I''m not the only one to notice.', '2006-09-01 17:04:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2784697, 388895, 25742, '<td valign="top">memorable. good luck. /8</td>', 'memorable. good luck. /8', '2006-09-01 17:05:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2784698, 379107, 2780, '<td valign="top">Composition: 4 - Everything seems at an angle, I think shooting from straight on would have more impact.<br/>Technical: 3 - The room on the right being brighter draws my attention away from the room with the man. Also, the photo overall seems too dark.<br/>Creativity: 4 - I can''t really see what you were going for here.<br/>Appeal: 3 - Its too dark and lacks contrast in the important areas, so doesn''t hold my interest for long.<br/> <br/>Overall Calculated Average Score: 3</td>', 'Composition: 4 - Everything seems at an angle, I think shooting from straight on would have more impact.Technical: 3 - The room on the right being brighter draws my attention away from the room with the man. Also, the photo overall seems too dark.Creativity: 4 - I can''t really see what you were going for here.Appeal: 3 - Its too dark and lacks contrast in the important areas, so doesn''t hold my interest for long. Overall Calculated Average Score: 3', '2006-09-01 17:06:02.000000', NULL, 1),
