(2784709, 387709, 2780, '<td valign="top">Composition: 4 - Too centered for me, and the right wing comes a bit close to the edge of the frame.<br/>Technical: 7 - Very nicely exposed with good vibrant colours and nice DoF too. The sharpness of the butterly is great.<br/>Creativity: 5 - There isn''t anything here for me that separates it from other butterfly shots. Perhaps a less traditional angle or more of a closeup would be better?<br/>Appeal: 6 - A pleasing photo to look at but nothing sets it above the rest.<br/> <br/>Overall Calculated Average Score: 5</td>', 'Composition: 4 - Too centered for me, and the right wing comes a bit close to the edge of the frame.Technical: 7 - Very nicely exposed with good vibrant colours and nice DoF too. The sharpness of the butterly is great.Creativity: 5 - There isn''t anything here for me that separates it from other butterfly shots. Perhaps a less traditional angle or more of a closeup would be better?Appeal: 6 - A pleasing photo to look at but nothing sets it above the rest. Overall Calculated Average Score: 5', '2006-09-01 17:08:09.000000', NULL, 1),
