(2784729, 382683, 2780, '<td valign="top">Composition: 8 - This works very well imo.<br/>Technical: 8 - Nice high contrast editing which really brings out the rich colours in the shot. The eye really sticks out well too, nice one.<br/>Creativity: 7 - Definately not the usual portrait :)<br/>Appeal: 6 - The rich colours really make this shot nice to look at for me, but it starts to creep me out if I look at it too long :P<br/> <br/>Overall Calculated Average Score: 7</td>', 'Composition: 8 - This works very well imo.Technical: 8 - Nice high contrast editing which really brings out the rich colours in the shot. The eye really sticks out well too, nice one.Creativity: 7 - Definately not the usual portrait :)Appeal: 6 - The rich colours really make this shot nice to look at for me, but it starts to creep me out if I look at it too long :P Overall Calculated Average Score: 7', '2006-09-01 17:11:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2784731, 383640, 56797, '<td valign="top">dont enjoy the shallow dof. id like to see the melon sharp too.</td>', 'dont enjoy the shallow dof. id like to see the melon sharp too.', '2006-09-01 17:11:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2784733, 386904, 6999, '<td valign="top">I''d really love this if it weren''t for the selective de-sat: sure, they have red dresses - but is that really the strong point of this image? For me, it detracts entirely from the strange interactions of the dancers, the falseness in some of those smiles, the leering, the sense of slight desperation. Red dresses are completely incidental, I think.</td>', 'I''d really love this if it weren''t for the selective de-sat: sure, they have red dresses - but is that really the strong point of this image? For me, it detracts entirely from the strange interactions of the dancers, the falseness in some of those smiles, the leering, the sense of slight desperation. Red dresses are completely incidental, I think.', '2006-09-01 17:11:49.000000', NULL, 1),
