(2784741, 385783, 47205, '<td valign="top">Nice capture</td>', 'Nice capture', '2006-09-01 17:13:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2784743, 388127, 56752, '<td valign="top">The subject stands out a little bit too much against the background for my tastes; almost as if it were cut and pasted on (obviously it wasn''t, but that''s what the appearance is of). I give it a 5, because it still is a good capture.</td>', 'The subject stands out a little bit too much against the background for my tastes; almost as if it were cut and pasted on (obviously it wasn''t, but that''s what the appearance is of). I give it a 5, because it still is a good capture.', '2006-09-01 17:13:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2784745, 389023, 2780, '<td valign="top">Composition: 5 - A standard non-adventurous composition, but still it works well for this shot.<br/>Technical: 6 - It seems over-smooth in places, and the B&amp;W makes it seem a bit cold. I''d have used a very subtle sepia tint just to add some warmth.<br/>Creativity: 5 - Its quite a usual shot for newborn babies, the 2 pairs of hands adds something though.<br/>Appeal: 4 - I''m sure the parents absolutely adore the photo, but for me it doesn''t do a lot, sorry.<br/> <br/>Overall Calculated Average Score: 5</td>', 'Composition: 5 - A standard non-adventurous composition, but still it works well for this shot.Technical: 6 - It seems over-smooth in places, and the B&W makes it seem a bit cold. I''d have used a very subtle sepia tint just to add some warmth.Creativity: 5 - Its quite a usual shot for newborn babies, the 2 pairs of hands adds something though.Appeal: 4 - I''m sure the parents absolutely adore the photo, but for me it doesn''t do a lot, sorry. Overall Calculated Average Score: 5', '2006-09-01 17:14:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2784748, 381650, 47205, '<td valign="top">Love the colors in this</td>', 'Love the colors in this', '2006-09-01 17:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2784756, 377296, 2780, '<td valign="top">Composition: 8 - Good choice of composition, it shows the subject off in a good way, and the stick on the right stops it looking too centered.<br/>Technical: 6 - Nicely exposed with good detail on the wing. The green fits well too. It seems like you may have used neatimage too much though, as a lot of the detail seems "smudged" out.<br/>Creativity: 6 - The nice vibrant greens set this apart from other similar macros.<br/>Appeal: 7 - The colour and contrast makes this an interesting shot to look at :)<br/> <br/>Overall Calculated Average Score: 6</td>', 'Composition: 8 - Good choice of composition, it shows the subject off in a good way, and the stick on the right stops it looking too centered.Technical: 6 - Nicely exposed with good detail on the wing. The green fits well too. It seems like you may have used neatimage too much though, as a lot of the detail seems "smudged" out.Creativity: 6 - The nice vibrant greens set this apart from other similar macros.Appeal: 7 - The colour and contrast makes this an interesting shot to look at :) Overall Calculated Average Score: 6', '2006-09-01 17:18:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2784760, 389005, 47205, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. The reflection is spot on. Good Job!! (8)</td>', 'Nice shot. The reflection is spot on. Good Job!! (8)', '2006-09-01 17:20:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2784762, 387130, 2780, '<td valign="top">Composition: 9 - Perfect, except I think perhaps a little less forhead so it doesn''t cut off just as the hairlines meet would look slightly better.<br/>Technical: 10 - Perfect, the glow, the sharpness on the eyelashes coupled with the softness elsewhere. Perfect skintones too.<br/>Creativity: 8 - Different from most portraits, in that the focus is mainly on the eye lashes rather than the eyes themselves. I like it.<br/>Appeal: 10 - Very appealing photo! Great work!<br/> <br/>Overall Calculated Average Score: 9</td>', 'Composition: 9 - Perfect, except I think perhaps a little less forhead so it doesn''t cut off just as the hairlines meet would look slightly better.Technical: 10 - Perfect, the glow, the sharpness on the eyelashes coupled with the softness elsewhere. Perfect skintones too.Creativity: 8 - Different from most portraits, in that the focus is mainly on the eye lashes rather than the eyes themselves. I like it.Appeal: 10 - Very appealing photo! Great work! Overall Calculated Average Score: 9', '2006-09-01 17:20:36.000000', NULL, 1),
