(2784766, 387151, 2780, '<td valign="top">Composition: 4 - Cutting off half of the other bird seems awkward and the main bird is too centered in my opinion.<br/>Technical: 3 - Seems a bit underexposed, no detail in the shadows and no actual highlights anywhere.<br/>Creativity: 4 - Its different in that it''s catching some food, but it still just looks a bit dull to me.<br/>Appeal: 3 - Nothing really holds my interest here, sorry. The underexposure and the unappealing colour of the water turn me off looking at the photo for too long.<br/> <br/>Overall Calculated Average Score: 3</td>', 'Composition: 4 - Cutting off half of the other bird seems awkward and the main bird is too centered in my opinion.Technical: 3 - Seems a bit underexposed, no detail in the shadows and no actual highlights anywhere.Creativity: 4 - Its different in that it''s catching some food, but it still just looks a bit dull to me.Appeal: 3 - Nothing really holds my interest here, sorry. The underexposure and the unappealing colour of the water turn me off looking at the photo for too long. Overall Calculated Average Score: 3', '2006-09-01 17:22:40.000000', NULL, 1),
