(2784776, 382654, 2780, '<td valign="top">Composition: 3 - I dont think the tight crop works here. It just makes everything seem too cramped.<br/>Technical: 2 - To me it looks over sharpened a lot and some areas are overexposed.<br/>Creativity: 2 - To me it just looks like a photo of a cat. There is nothing here that really sets it apart and makes it unique.<br/>Appeal: 2 - I''m sure to whoever owns the cat it''s a lovely portrait but it just doesnt do anything for me, sorry!<br/> <br/>Overall Calculated Average Score: 2</td>', 'Composition: 3 - I dont think the tight crop works here. It just makes everything seem too cramped.Technical: 2 - To me it looks over sharpened a lot and some areas are overexposed.Creativity: 2 - To me it just looks like a photo of a cat. There is nothing here that really sets it apart and makes it unique.Appeal: 2 - I''m sure to whoever owns the cat it''s a lovely portrait but it just doesnt do anything for me, sorry! Overall Calculated Average Score: 2', '2006-09-01 17:25:55.000000', NULL, 1),
