(2784782, 388539, 56797, '<td valign="top">a tighter crop would be nice to see the insect. i cant even tell what kind of insect it is. may have been hard to get even closer to an alligator though. lol.</td>', 'a tighter crop would be nice to see the insect. i cant even tell what kind of insect it is. may have been hard to get even closer to an alligator though. lol.', '2006-09-01 17:28:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2784787, 383689, 2780, '<td valign="top">Composition: 8 - Normally I''d think this showed too much sky, but considering the sky here I''d say you got it pretty much right :)<br/>Technical: 6 - The high contrast looks good but there are no real bright areas to really give it it''s full dynamic range. There is also some haloing around the trees and buildings. The exposure time however worked great, with the smooth water and the great looking streaks in the sky (from the moving clouds I guess?)<br/>Creativity: 7 - Quite a unique harbour shot!<br/>Appeal: 6 - It has a lot of initial impact, but it doesnt last when I started noticing things like the halos and the overall fairly flatness in the image.<br/> <br/>Overall Calculated Average Score: 6</td>', 'Composition: 8 - Normally I''d think this showed too much sky, but considering the sky here I''d say you got it pretty much right :)Technical: 6 - The high contrast looks good but there are no real bright areas to really give it it''s full dynamic range. There is also some haloing around the trees and buildings. The exposure time however worked great, with the smooth water and the great looking streaks in the sky (from the moving clouds I guess?)Creativity: 7 - Quite a unique harbour shot!Appeal: 6 - It has a lot of initial impact, but it doesnt last when I started noticing things like the halos and the overall fairly flatness in the image. Overall Calculated Average Score: 6', '2006-09-01 17:28:55.000000', NULL, 1),
