(2785264, 385347, 56797, '<td valign="top">a bit drab overall. but nicely natural for a change of pace.6</td>', 'a bit drab overall. but nicely natural for a change of pace.6', '2006-09-01 20:02:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2785265, 389021, 46097, '<td valign="top">Very cute subject. The bliss, on the big sister''s face, is so sincere and unstaged. Perhaps I find the white background a little too dazzling, given it''s large proportion of the area, and it''s total whiteness. But it''s a great photograph, full of feelgood appeal.</td>', 'Very cute subject. The bliss, on the big sister''s face, is so sincere and unstaged. Perhaps I find the white background a little too dazzling, given it''s large proportion of the area, and it''s total whiteness. But it''s a great photograph, full of feelgood appeal.', '2006-09-01 20:03:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2785266, 388653, 62637, '<td valign="top">that sky is amazing.  perfect ten!  added to favorites</td>', 'that sky is amazing.  perfect ten!  added to favorites', '2006-09-01 20:03:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2785268, 389016, 40430, '<td valign="top">nice image of Bodie Island Light.</td>', 'nice image of Bodie Island Light.', '2006-09-01 20:03:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2785270, 388541, 36999, '<td valign="top">What a cutie!  Nice light too, I love soft light like that.  Composition, could use a fraction more room above the ears and not quite as centered.</td>', 'What a cutie!  Nice light too, I love soft light like that.  Composition, could use a fraction more room above the ears and not quite as centered.', '2006-09-01 20:06:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2785272, 383555, 62637, '<td valign="top">nature at its worst at its best.  and out of a plane window, too!  8</td>', 'nature at its worst at its best.  and out of a plane window, too!  8', '2006-09-01 20:06:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2785274, 375837, 36999, '<td valign="top">nice texture, great conversion!</td>', 'nice texture, great conversion!', '2006-09-01 20:07:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2785280, 380545, 36999, '<td valign="top">how fun, I love to watch bathing birds!</td>', 'how fun, I love to watch bathing birds!', '2006-09-01 20:09:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2785281, 387498, 4411, '<td valign="top">Shouldn''t it be [adult swim]? ; )<br/>Quality photo. Real strong composition and a B&amp;W treatment that works well.</td>', 'Shouldn''t it be [adult swim]? ; )Quality photo. Real strong composition and a B&W treatment that works well.', '2006-09-01 20:10:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2785284, 387117, 2158, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but I find those yellow lines rather distracting.</td>', 'Nice idea, but I find those yellow lines rather distracting.', '2006-09-01 20:10:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2785285, 384209, 62637, '<td valign="top">sensuous indeed.  beautiful model, great curves, very visually appealing ;-).  excellent lighting, well composed.  8</td>', 'sensuous indeed.  beautiful model, great curves, very visually appealing ;-).  excellent lighting, well composed.  8', '2006-09-01 20:11:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2785287, 388657, 46097, '<td valign="top">The muted pastel colours, the gradient diffusion, the appropriate amount of neat image, all make this a great photo. One teeny nitpick, is that the asymmetry of the catchlights in her eyes draws my attention. Was the left eye''s catchlight postprocessed, or natural? It''s a very minor detail, but her eyes are such an integral part of the visual and subjective appeal, that that occurs to me. But a superb photo, the like of which I wish I could take. 9.</td>', 'The muted pastel colours, the gradient diffusion, the appropriate amount of neat image, all make this a great photo. One teeny nitpick, is that the asymmetry of the catchlights in her eyes draws my attention. Was the left eye''s catchlight postprocessed, or natural? It''s a very minor detail, but her eyes are such an integral part of the visual and subjective appeal, that that occurs to me. But a superb photo, the like of which I wish I could take. 9.', '2006-09-01 20:11:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2785288, 385426, 36999, '<td valign="top">wow what a moment!  nice shootin''!</td>', 'wow what a moment!  nice shootin''!', '2006-09-01 20:11:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2785290, 388661, 46097, '<td valign="top">love the negative space.</td>', 'love the negative space.', '2006-09-01 20:12:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2785291, 387435, 25355, '<td valign="top">I wonder how many young ''uns won''t get the meaning of the title...</td>', 'I wonder how many young ''uns won''t get the meaning of the title...', '2006-09-01 20:13:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2785292, 386591, 50641, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait, well-lit.  Her expression is borderline quixotic, but in the end, it''s enough of a smirk that I just think she''s peeved and cynical.... As if I just tried to sell her on Santa Claus or something. A more descriptive or interesting title might have enhanced the package, or told me why she''s making this face, or told me why her hair is uncombed. Good luck with this.</td>', 'Nice portrait, well-lit.  Her expression is borderline quixotic, but in the end, it''s enough of a smirk that I just think she''s peeved and cynical.... As if I just tried to sell her on Santa Claus or something. A more descriptive or interesting title might have enhanced the package, or told me why she''s making this face, or told me why her hair is uncombed. Good luck with this.', '2006-09-01 20:13:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2785296, 379842, 43281, '<td valign="top">You have made a loverly job of this, love the background, although i would have liked to have seen the sharpness come further across the pool .i gave a 10</td>', 'You have made a loverly job of this, love the background, although i would have liked to have seen the sharpness come further across the pool .i gave a 10', '2006-09-01 20:13:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2785298, 388781, 43281, '<td valign="top">love this great contrast 10</td>', 'love this great contrast 10', '2006-09-01 20:14:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2785301, 386643, 57278, '<td valign="top">Nice Image, Nice composition, slightly over sharpened for me. 8</td>', 'Nice Image, Nice composition, slightly over sharpened for me. 8', '2006-09-01 20:14:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2785307, 388332, 41337, '<td valign="top">Nice image. I like the processing but I''m a little puzzled as to why you chose to make the hands and feet the focal point. My eyes to go those brighter areas than his face which is in shadow.</td>', 'Nice image. I like the processing but I''m a little puzzled as to why you chose to make the hands and feet the focal point. My eyes to go those brighter areas than his face which is in shadow.', '2006-09-01 20:16:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2785317, 387566, 41337, '<td valign="top">Nice capture. Sharp and clean. The black point seems to be a bit too bright in this image probably due to the effect you were going for but I would try and strike a better balance with that. Also, to improve the clean aspect even more I would clone out those 3 stray grass blades near the top on both sides.</td>', 'Nice capture. Sharp and clean. The black point seems to be a bit too bright in this image probably due to the effect you were going for but I would try and strike a better balance with that. Also, to improve the clean aspect even more I would clone out those 3 stray grass blades near the top on both sides.', '2006-09-01 20:19:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2785323, 386588, 50641, '<td valign="top">Pretty buildings.  The bad news is that my eye is drawn the the do not enter signs, and then, they go right down the street they''re not supposed to enter and they find.... nothing to look at :(  Also, I am interested in the black sign to the left and am disappointed that I can''t read it.  I think this has potential, but I want to turn the photographer more towards that row of pretty buildings, perhaps with a fisheye or very wide angle lens if possible, and get the signs out of there.  Or, make them more prominent if that''s the message you want to convey.  I wish I knew what the heritage was. The rainy-rich colors are pleasing, and if you fixed a white sky, you did a good job. Good luck to you.</td>', 'Pretty buildings.  The bad news is that my eye is drawn the the do not enter signs, and then, they go right down the street they''re not supposed to enter and they find.... nothing to look at :(  Also, I am interested in the black sign to the left and am disappointed that I can''t read it.  I think this has potential, but I want to turn the photographer more towards that row of pretty buildings, perhaps with a fisheye or very wide angle lens if possible, and get the signs out of there.  Or, make them more prominent if that''s the message you want to convey.  I wish I knew what the heritage was. The rainy-rich colors are pleasing, and if you fixed a white sky, you did a good job. Good luck to you.', '2006-09-01 20:21:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2785327, 378530, 54283, '<td valign="top">Great picture, great moment.<br/>Love the texture. One of my favorites.</td>', 'Great picture, great moment.Love the texture. One of my favorites.', '2006-09-01 20:22:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2785330, 388392, 50641, '<td valign="top">Fluffy and soft. Excellent harnessing of yellow hues (I find them difficult to work with.) I love how the edges just fade away.</td>', 'Fluffy and soft. Excellent harnessing of yellow hues (I find them difficult to work with.) I love how the edges just fade away.', '2006-09-01 20:23:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2785337, 384844, 43298, '<td valign="top">Love the eye...:)</td>', 'Love the eye...:)', '2006-09-01 20:25:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2785339, 388839, 50641, '<td valign="top">This image is interesting, but I think you could have had a more mysterious or dramatic title and that would have given it some extra oomph.  Yes, this deserves something poetic. I like the grain.</td>', 'This image is interesting, but I think you could have had a more mysterious or dramatic title and that would have given it some extra oomph.  Yes, this deserves something poetic. I like the grain.', '2006-09-01 20:25:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2785341, 388599, 54283, '<td valign="top">Congratulations, one of my all time favorites. You´ve got a winner.. :))</td>', 'Congratulations, one of my all time favorites. You´ve got a winner.. :))', '2006-09-01 20:26:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2785343, 389022, 62637, '<td valign="top">last minute shot, im assuming?</td>', 'last minute shot, im assuming?', '2006-09-01 20:26:24.000000', NULL, 1),
