(2785378, 388299, 38234, '<td valign="top">cute!  great stock shot!!</td>', 'cute!  great stock shot!!', '2006-09-01 20:34:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2785379, 386989, 25355, '<td valign="top">Hey, I knew that was in Sydney just by looking at the colour of the station building - even before reading the station name and seeing the skyline. Nice job in editing.</td>', 'Hey, I knew that was in Sydney just by looking at the colour of the station building - even before reading the station name and seeing the skyline. Nice job in editing.', '2006-09-01 20:34:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2785383, 388356, 54283, '<td valign="top">And the sky is....????????<br/>Sorry to much sky.</td>', 'And the sky is....????????Sorry to much sky.', '2006-09-01 20:35:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2785384, 388938, 38234, '<td valign="top">beautiful light and cat portrait!! and I don''t even like cats LOL</td>', 'beautiful light and cat portrait!! and I don''t even like cats LOL', '2006-09-01 20:35:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2785385, 380676, 41337, '<td valign="top">FINALLY a hummingbird shot that isn''t your run of the mill snapshot at the old feeder. For all I know this may also be right at the feeder but it sure doesn''t look like it. This is oozing with artistic flair and it looks like some thought was put into this shot before clicking the shutter. The background works very well and the lighting is superb. Kudos. Hope you do well.</td>', 'FINALLY a hummingbird shot that isn''t your run of the mill snapshot at the old feeder. For all I know this may also be right at the feeder but it sure doesn''t look like it. This is oozing with artistic flair and it looks like some thought was put into this shot before clicking the shutter. The background works very well and the lighting is superb. Kudos. Hope you do well.', '2006-09-01 20:36:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2785386, 388306, 46097, '<td valign="top">Aish, this is lovely. His expression is wonderful. I''d just like to see his eyes sharper, and brighter. I dont know that the vignette effect is helpful either. But overall, I like it a lot.</td>', 'Aish, this is lovely. His expression is wonderful. I''d just like to see his eyes sharper, and brighter. I dont know that the vignette effect is helpful either. But overall, I like it a lot.', '2006-09-01 20:36:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2785387, 388656, 38234, '<td valign="top">the whites are just too hot</td>', 'the whites are just too hot', '2006-09-01 20:36:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2785388, 384447, 50641, '<td valign="top">It''s great to catch them at a natural food source.  My hummingbird feeder looks so nasty in the hummer shots I''ve gotten.  Bird and plant look pretty smooth, but your lovely muted background is a little on the grainy side.  Not bad in and of itself, but with the bird being green too, might want the background as undemanding/undistracting as possible.  Anyway, dpc loves hummers, you should do ok with this ;-)</td>', 'It''s great to catch them at a natural food source.  My hummingbird feeder looks so nasty in the hummer shots I''ve gotten.  Bird and plant look pretty smooth, but your lovely muted background is a little on the grainy side.  Not bad in and of itself, but with the bird being green too, might want the background as undemanding/undistracting as possible.  Anyway, dpc loves hummers, you should do ok with this ;-)', '2006-09-01 20:36:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2785389, 387675, 38234, '<td valign="top">focus is too soft</td>', 'focus is too soft', '2006-09-01 20:36:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2785391, 388822, 38234, '<td valign="top">nice texture and colour but I don''t know - just lacks any spunk in composition and subject</td>', 'nice texture and colour but I don''t know - just lacks any spunk in composition and subject', '2006-09-01 20:37:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2785392, 381775, 3032, '<td valign="top">What''s that? A couple of dingos have invaded the town?<br/>I really like the combo of backlighting and b&amp;w, it works very well with this scene. 8</td>', 'What''s that? A couple of dingos have invaded the town?I really like the combo of backlighting and b&w, it works very well with this scene. 8', '2006-09-01 20:38:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2785397, 388635, 38234, '<td valign="top">love the drama in this - nice contrast and tones - cool capture!</td>', 'love the drama in this - nice contrast and tones - cool capture!', '2006-09-01 20:38:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2785401, 388905, 62637, '<td valign="top">this photo really is something special.  i dont usually like heavy effects or pp, but this truly is a professional job.  9</td>', 'this photo really is something special.  i dont usually like heavy effects or pp, but this truly is a professional job.  9', '2006-09-01 20:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2785402, 385245, 50641, '<td valign="top">hahahahahahahahah... :) :)  I like how you processed this.  If you want to make <a href="//dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=377436" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">her face lighter</a>, try fooling around with the channel mixer and shadow/highlights, if you have photoshop.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-09-08 08:37:38.</i></td>', 'hahahahahahahahah... :) :)  I like how you processed this.  If you want to make her face lighter, try fooling around with the channel mixer and shadow/highlights, if you have photoshop.', '2006-09-01 20:39:08.000000', '2006-09-08 09:37:38.000000', 1),
(2785403, 387843, 38234, '<td valign="top">I think that if you went into selective colour and choose neutrals and slid back the yellow this would have better colour, nice detail and reflection though!</td>', 'I think that if you went into selective colour and choose neutrals and slid back the yellow this would have better colour, nice detail and reflection though!', '2006-09-01 20:39:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2785405, 383713, 38234, '<td valign="top">nicely done - love the expression LOL, nice detail and wonderful ight!!</td>', 'nicely done - love the expression LOL, nice detail and wonderful ight!!', '2006-09-01 20:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2785406, 388712, 3032, '<td valign="top">The wheels off the ground give it the action it needs. Nice still, good exposure and colors.<br/>It looks hot and the curbstones look like Valencia. Shot in spain? (I could be very wrong, because the car has the steering wheel on the Brittish side)</td>', 'The wheels off the ground give it the action it needs. Nice still, good exposure and colors.It looks hot and the curbstones look like Valencia. Shot in spain? (I could be very wrong, because the car has the steering wheel on the Brittish side)', '2006-09-01 20:40:10.000000', NULL, 1),
