(2785507, 381762, 50641, '<td valign="top">Uh oh, pretty scene but you gotta give me somewhere to look. Maybe if you crop  it a little differently and then turn up the pink on the far flowers?  Possibly lose some of the foreground. Your goldenrod is mixed in with the grasses.  If you desaturate and darken the greens a little, you may be able to get the yellow to stand out a bit more. Your sky is having an argument with the tops of the distant trees.  You can go in and fix that in a challenge that has advanced editing.  Looks like a great place for a picnic, if the geese haven''t already found it ;-)  Good luck to you.</td>', 'Uh oh, pretty scene but you gotta give me somewhere to look. Maybe if you crop  it a little differently and then turn up the pink on the far flowers?  Possibly lose some of the foreground. Your goldenrod is mixed in with the grasses.  If you desaturate and darken the greens a little, you may be able to get the yellow to stand out a bit more. Your sky is having an argument with the tops of the distant trees.  You can go in and fix that in a challenge that has advanced editing.  Looks like a great place for a picnic, if the geese haven''t already found it ;-)  Good luck to you.', '2006-09-01 21:06:38.000000', NULL, 1),
