(2785806, 388808, 56658, '<td valign="top">very interesting shapes. the canoe is a superb touch. the mist looks great on the mountain on the left but ruins the reflection of that mountain. I am not sure but i might prefer it without the mist and a better reflection. Great job!</td>', 'very interesting shapes. the canoe is a superb touch. the mist looks great on the mountain on the left but ruins the reflection of that mountain. I am not sure but i might prefer it without the mist and a better reflection. Great job!', '2006-09-01 22:22:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2785808, 386055, 51538, '<td valign="top">The Bridge can take on sombre tones sometimes.  I always try and avoid those.  The light has picked out the stone faces nicely.</td>', 'The Bridge can take on sombre tones sometimes.  I always try and avoid those.  The light has picked out the stone faces nicely.', '2006-09-01 22:23:01.000000', NULL, 1),
