(2785858, 388645, 35602, '<td valign="top">Nice colors.  Some of light is overblown which made it have a purple fringe around it.  That happens with high iso.  One way to be rid of purple fringe is to spot edit it out to match the background it is fringing.</td>', 'Nice colors.  Some of light is overblown which made it have a purple fringe around it.  That happens with high iso.  One way to be rid of purple fringe is to spot edit it out to match the background it is fringing.', '2006-09-01 22:30:43.000000', NULL, 1),
