(2786258, 386323, 19708, '<td valign="top">Well-balanced shot with great exposure levels and natural colors.<br/>The foreground elements make this shot in my opinion. You may be getting comments to say clone out the power lines - just ignore them if you do.<br/>Reality isn''t sterile.</td>', 'Well-balanced shot with great exposure levels and natural colors.The foreground elements make this shot in my opinion. You may be getting comments to say clone out the power lines - just ignore them if you do.Reality isn''t sterile.', '2006-09-02 00:30:38.000000', NULL, 1),
