(2786328, 383713, 58452, '<td valign="top">Love the subdued background with the direct light bringing out the  skin colors, textures, and lines.</td>', 'Love the subdued background with the direct light bringing out the  skin colors, textures, and lines.', '2006-09-02 00:51:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2786333, 387401, 19708, '<td valign="top">Very soft &amp; tender, just the way this should come across.<br/>Very nice choice for a black &amp; white too.<br/>I''m not sure what''s with her left foot, as it almost looks like her toes are negative. Maybe she has a deformity. Maybe my eyes are egtting old. Regardless, I won''t won''t cast judgement or take anything away because of it and will wait to see after the challenge is over.<br/>Well done!</td>', 'Very soft & tender, just the way this should come across.Very nice choice for a black & white too.I''m not sure what''s with her left foot, as it almost looks like her toes are negative. Maybe she has a deformity. Maybe my eyes are egtting old. Regardless, I won''t won''t cast judgement or take anything away because of it and will wait to see after the challenge is over.Well done!', '2006-09-02 00:52:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2786346, 378856, 19708, '<td valign="top">Great choice for a black &amp; white and good use of shadows to bring out depth.<br/>The subtle details in the shadows work well here.</td>', 'Great choice for a black & white and good use of shadows to bring out depth.The subtle details in the shadows work well here.', '2006-09-02 00:54:48.000000', NULL, 1),
