(2786355, 388764, 19708, '<td valign="top">Dark, powerful and bordering on sinister.<br/>When a photograph makes a first impression that it is a painting, it<br/>instantly changes everything for me, as this one did.<br/>This is very well done.</td>', 'Dark, powerful and bordering on sinister.When a photograph makes a first impression that it is a painting, itinstantly changes everything for me, as this one did.This is very well done.', '2006-09-02 00:58:48.000000', NULL, 1),
