(2786365, 389031, 19708, '<td valign="top">There is a lot of detail in this shot and and was very well set up.<br/>Perhaps too red overall for my tastes, but is probably correct based on the title.<br/>Well done.</td>', 'There is a lot of detail in this shot and and was very well set up.Perhaps too red overall for my tastes, but is probably correct based on the title.Well done.', '2006-09-02 01:02:45.000000', NULL, 1),
