(2786531, 381422, 60862, '<td valign="top">This image has some potential, but it also has several areas of concern, at least for me:<br/>- its size.  This was a challenge where we got extra space, but you used less than normal.  That reduces the impact substantially.<br/>- the blown out highlights in the middle.  I suspect it was difficult to expose well, given the contrast between the reflection and the rest of the shot, but sometimes that means trying a different angle.<br/>- the flag cut off at the bottom.  The shot might work better cropped just above the flag, but of course, that would make it even smaller.</td>', 'This image has some potential, but it also has several areas of concern, at least for me:- its size.  This was a challenge where we got extra space, but you used less than normal.  That reduces the impact substantially.- the blown out highlights in the middle.  I suspect it was difficult to expose well, given the contrast between the reflection and the rest of the shot, but sometimes that means trying a different angle.- the flag cut off at the bottom.  The shot might work better cropped just above the flag, but of course, that would make it even smaller.', '2006-09-02 02:01:19.000000', NULL, 1),
