(2786542, 388914, 29269, '<td valign="top">Frame! I did not really see the frame as necessary, nor as complementing the photo. It kind of ruins it for me to be frank. You''ll probably get mixed reviews on it, and polarizing the voting body usually does not produce good results. However, if you shoot (and post-process) to please yourself first, you''ve done a great job! 7</td>', 'Frame! I did not really see the frame as necessary, nor as complementing the photo. It kind of ruins it for me to be frank. You''ll probably get mixed reviews on it, and polarizing the voting body usually does not produce good results. However, if you shoot (and post-process) to please yourself first, you''ve done a great job! 7', '2006-09-02 02:05:14.000000', NULL, 1),
