(2786553, 388938, 29269, '<td valign="top">I would have preferred it if you''d cleaned up that background completely. I wiped my monitor, but the smudge is still there... distracting to say the least. Maybe on your monitor did not see what I''m talking about (and I can see the difference between the two whites on the far left and two blacks on the far right so it is not my monitor). pity, such a great image.</td>', 'I would have preferred it if you''d cleaned up that background completely. I wiped my monitor, but the smudge is still there... distracting to say the least. Maybe on your monitor did not see what I''m talking about (and I can see the difference between the two whites on the far left and two blacks on the far right so it is not my monitor). pity, such a great image.', '2006-09-02 02:12:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2786556, 386914, 33352, '<td valign="top">To much grian in the sky..</td>', 'To much grian in the sky..', '2006-09-02 02:12:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2786568, 388084, 16230, '<td valign="top">A very nice image. I like the subject, color treatment, and composition. You might have cloned out the bright spots around the wetsuit. Your score may get knocked down because of the lack of detail in the sand and water, but I kind of like it. It gives the image a misty/mystical feel.<br/> <br/>BTW, been there, done that. Too many times. :D</td>', 'A very nice image. I like the subject, color treatment, and composition. You might have cloned out the bright spots around the wetsuit. Your score may get knocked down because of the lack of detail in the sand and water, but I kind of like it. It gives the image a misty/mystical feel. BTW, been there, done that. Too many times. :D', '2006-09-02 02:18:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2786570, 386667, 29269, '<td valign="top">I think that Venus had a bigger stomach :-)<br/>Your gorgeous model either held her stomach in, or she''s been hungry recently. Then again, my metabolism was similar at her age, so tell her to not take it personal. <br/>Great photo, perfect exposure, except for the slight motion blur in her left elbow. I''m not sure if it was intentional, but it draws the attention upon it and then immediately I see the in-focus hand which is farther away...<br/>Because of this imperfection, only an 8.</td>', 'I think that Venus had a bigger stomach :-)Your gorgeous model either held her stomach in, or she''s been hungry recently. Then again, my metabolism was similar at her age, so tell her to not take it personal. Great photo, perfect exposure, except for the slight motion blur in her left elbow. I''m not sure if it was intentional, but it draws the attention upon it and then immediately I see the in-focus hand which is farther away...Because of this imperfection, only an 8.', '2006-09-02 02:19:03.000000', NULL, 1),
