(2786781, 386647, 59754, '<td valign="top">The noise at the top in the clouds bothers me a tiny bit, but pixel-peeping aside, I live the water and reflection effects.  Could have used more softening to counter the noise and make the rocks nicer looking in the lower right.  The smoothness contrasts wierdly with the rough and gritty rocks.  Otherwise fantastic, 7!</td>', 'The noise at the top in the clouds bothers me a tiny bit, but pixel-peeping aside, I live the water and reflection effects.  Could have used more softening to counter the noise and make the rocks nicer looking in the lower right.  The smoothness contrasts wierdly with the rough and gritty rocks.  Otherwise fantastic, 7!', '2006-09-02 03:44:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2786782, 384758, 59754, '<td valign="top">I was just in Thailand for three weeks!  I guess I like this shot because it really does show the character of Thailand.  The grit adds to it as well, but it seems that the color balance is a tad too bit... redish.  Otherwise awsome, hope it does well.</td>', 'I was just in Thailand for three weeks!  I guess I like this shot because it really does show the character of Thailand.  The grit adds to it as well, but it seems that the color balance is a tad too bit... redish.  Otherwise awsome, hope it does well.', '2006-09-02 03:46:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2786783, 388804, 59754, '<td valign="top">I think that at first glance this photo is great! As I continue looking however I notice that it seems a bit lacking in contrast.  Perhaps this sets a nice mood, and the reflection is great.  I think it''s well worth an 8</td>', 'I think that at first glance this photo is great! As I continue looking however I notice that it seems a bit lacking in contrast.  Perhaps this sets a nice mood, and the reflection is great.  I think it''s well worth an 8', '2006-09-02 03:47:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2786785, 389013, 59754, '<td valign="top">Simple=Awsome.  8</td>', 'Simple=Awsome.  8', '2006-09-02 03:48:40.000000', NULL, 1),
