(2786812, 379876, 62095, '<td valign="top">Seems to be a bit odd-looking around top centre. Maybe something has happened in the resize, it doesn''t look quite right.  The rest of the photo has a nice dreamy effect to it.</td>', 'Seems to be a bit odd-looking around top centre. Maybe something has happened in the resize, it doesn''t look quite right.  The rest of the photo has a nice dreamy effect to it.', '2006-09-02 04:16:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2786813, 383720, 62095, '<td valign="top">This looks like it could be really interesting - if I could see the reflection.  It''s just far too small though. We had 700 pixels max length for this challenge and this photo needed every one of them to work.</td>', 'This looks like it could be really interesting - if I could see the reflection.  It''s just far too small though. We had 700 pixels max length for this challenge and this photo needed every one of them to work.', '2006-09-02 04:18:07.000000', NULL, 1),
