(2786816, 385708, 62095, '<td valign="top">Nice looking serene photo with great light hitting the building. The right hand edge of the photo is less impressive.</td>', 'Nice looking serene photo with great light hitting the building. The right hand edge of the photo is less impressive.', '2006-09-02 04:19:36.000000', NULL, 1),
