(2786819, 375549, 62095, '<td valign="top">Wonder what this would be like with colour? As it is, I would like to see some kind of point of interest in the distance, this doesn''t "grab" me in, and the water doesn''t have quite the calm quality that it''d need to be a zen-like shot</td>', 'Wonder what this would be like with colour? As it is, I would like to see some kind of point of interest in the distance, this doesn''t "grab" me in, and the water doesn''t have quite the calm quality that it''d need to be a zen-like shot', '2006-09-02 04:22:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2786820, 378603, 62095, '<td valign="top">Great colours here in a moody looking sky</td>', 'Great colours here in a moody looking sky', '2006-09-02 04:23:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2786822, 388943, 62095, '<td valign="top">I''m not that great a fan of this sort of shot but this does seem to be a good one, good shape.</td>', 'I''m not that great a fan of this sort of shot but this does seem to be a good one, good shape.', '2006-09-02 04:24:14.000000', NULL, 1),
