(2786858, 388258, 62095, '<td valign="top">I like the effect in the eyes, but I''m not really a fan of this kind of cropped close up on people''s faces.</td>', 'I like the effect in the eyes, but I''m not really a fan of this kind of cropped close up on people''s faces.', '2006-09-02 04:54:09.000000', NULL, 1),
