(2787180, 387498, 31133, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites so far. He''s got a great pose, and love that his trucks are in the shot. This is simple and the fact that it''s b&amp;w plus the lines in the background make the boy stand out even better. The only small thing is that I wish the bowl or whatever the object near the center front by the pool edge weren''t there. The tones are so nice - not over done at all, but just right.</td>', 'One of my favorites so far. He''s got a great pose, and love that his trucks are in the shot. This is simple and the fact that it''s b&w plus the lines in the background make the boy stand out even better. The only small thing is that I wish the bowl or whatever the object near the center front by the pool edge weren''t there. The tones are so nice - not over done at all, but just right.', '2006-09-02 08:45:44.000000', NULL, 1),
