(2787500, 388461, 2780, '<td valign="top">Composition: 7 - In this case the centeredness works I think.<br/>Technical: 6 - Nice appealing colour gradient, and teh silhouette looks good. I''m not sure if the texture is natural or post processed in, but either way I find it a little distracting. The whole thing could be a little sharper too.<br/>Creativity: 7 - Nice idea and executed well :)<br/>Appeal: 6<br/> <br/>Overall Calculated Average Score: 6</td>', 'Composition: 7 - In this case the centeredness works I think.Technical: 6 - Nice appealing colour gradient, and teh silhouette looks good. I''m not sure if the texture is natural or post processed in, but either way I find it a little distracting. The whole thing could be a little sharper too.Creativity: 7 - Nice idea and executed well :)Appeal: 6 Overall Calculated Average Score: 6', '2006-09-02 10:19:35.000000', NULL, 1),
