(2787561, 388825, 57260, '<td valign="top">I find the composition a bit plain and flat. It''s a picture of a building and nothing in it really commands my attention. The branches in the foreground distracts and they have some halos around it from the sharpening process (I get that a lot too from oversharpening sometimes) Also from the looks of it it appears hexagonal with only 6 sides and not 8 (assuming this is what you implied in your title). At the moment it looks like an oversharpened snapshot. Perhaps you can play around with the composition a bit to make it interesting, like a shallow DOP, or a wide-angle shot from an interesting perspective or something.</td>', 'I find the composition a bit plain and flat. It''s a picture of a building and nothing in it really commands my attention. The branches in the foreground distracts and they have some halos around it from the sharpening process (I get that a lot too from oversharpening sometimes) Also from the looks of it it appears hexagonal with only 6 sides and not 8 (assuming this is what you implied in your title). At the moment it looks like an oversharpened snapshot. Perhaps you can play around with the composition a bit to make it interesting, like a shallow DOP, or a wide-angle shot from an interesting perspective or something.', '2006-09-02 10:41:30.000000', NULL, 1),
