(2788163, 387842, 35602, '<td valign="top">Composition is well done and your lights came out really well.  It is very dark, though.  Can''t really see a dock.  Maybe the contrast was adjusted too much?</td>', 'Composition is well done and your lights came out really well.  It is very dark, though.  Can''t really see a dock.  Maybe the contrast was adjusted too much?', '2006-09-02 12:50:19.000000', NULL, 1),
