(2788166, 387216, 62671, '<td valign="top">Good job on this one.  The skin is perfectly soft wile the important parts are sharp.  It appears the skin tone on her cheeks don''t match the fore head.  Looks like a pink blush has been added to the cheeks.  I''m not fond of kids in makeup so I dropped it one point for that.  The lips look pretty natural though I suspect its a tinted gloss.  The green shirt really brings the color of her eyes out.</td>', 'Good job on this one.  The skin is perfectly soft wile the important parts are sharp.  It appears the skin tone on her cheeks don''t match the fore head.  Looks like a pink blush has been added to the cheeks.  I''m not fond of kids in makeup so I dropped it one point for that.  The lips look pretty natural though I suspect its a tinted gloss.  The green shirt really brings the color of her eyes out.', '2006-09-02 12:51:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2788167, 386997, 34192, '<td valign="top">Really like this. Feel its tilted to one side but you probably have a million comments on that.  Excellent portrait and the vignetting works very well here.  Tonal range excellent and conversion well done.  DOF enhances focus. 9 - good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Really like this. Feel its tilted to one side but you probably have a million comments on that.  Excellent portrait and the vignetting works very well here.  Tonal range excellent and conversion well done.  DOF enhances focus. 9 - good luck in the challenge!', '2006-09-02 12:51:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2788168, 386039, 35602, '<td valign="top">Nice processing on this one.  Looks very magical.  Love the almost neon looking stripes on the bee.</td>', 'Nice processing on this one.  Looks very magical.  Love the almost neon looking stripes on the bee.', '2006-09-02 12:51:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2788169, 381508, 51538, '<td valign="top">That''s not a part of the world I have visited but your rendering brings it nearer to me.  The wide open sky and elevation from which you took the photo give no hint that the world is indeed round.</td>', 'That''s not a part of the world I have visited but your rendering brings it nearer to me.  The wide open sky and elevation from which you took the photo give no hint that the world is indeed round.', '2006-09-02 12:51:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2788170, 386022, 34192, '<td valign="top">beautiful capture with excellent conversion.  I have a weakness for gorillas. :)  Very well done. 8 - After voting on all others - bump to 9</td>', 'beautiful capture with excellent conversion.  I have a weakness for gorillas. :)  Very well done. 8 - After voting on all others - bump to 9', '2006-09-02 12:51:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2788174, 385926, 51538, '<td valign="top">One of my favourites from this challenge.  The fully outstretched wingspan creates the feeling of aerial ballet.  The sepia tone enhances the elegance of the image.</td>', 'One of my favourites from this challenge.  The fully outstretched wingspan creates the feeling of aerial ballet.  The sepia tone enhances the elegance of the image.', '2006-09-02 12:52:51.000000', NULL, 1),
