(2788191, 385862, 51538, '<td valign="top">Shoreham?  I heard they restored the bridge recently.  If it is Shoreham, then my mother used to cross it with horses before WWII.</td>', 'Shoreham?  I heard they restored the bridge recently.  If it is Shoreham, then my mother used to cross it with horses before WWII.', '2006-09-02 12:55:21.000000', NULL, 1),
