(2788210, 386022, 51538, '<td valign="top">One sentient being appreciates another.  Your photo captures the innate intelligence in Sir Monkey.  Lovely exposure.</td>', 'One sentient being appreciates another.  Your photo captures the innate intelligence in Sir Monkey.  Lovely exposure.', '2006-09-02 12:57:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2788211, 381650, 51538, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful sight and well worth your getting up nice and early to catch it.  The colours are intriguing.</td>', 'What a beautiful sight and well worth your getting up nice and early to catch it.  The colours are intriguing.', '2006-09-02 12:57:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2788212, 384758, 51538, '<td valign="top">Lovely graphic image.  The real people become part of the graphic advert.  Quite an interesting way of seeing.  I find yours to be an inspiring and well executed photo.</td>', 'Lovely graphic image.  The real people become part of the graphic advert.  Quite an interesting way of seeing.  I find yours to be an inspiring and well executed photo.', '2006-09-02 12:57:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2788213, 388461, 51538, '<td valign="top">Gentle, subtle, but very good in my opinion.  Very nice colour and texture.</td>', 'Gentle, subtle, but very good in my opinion.  Very nice colour and texture.', '2006-09-02 12:57:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2788214, 387754, 51538, '<td valign="top">They''re remarkably deep crow''s feet.  This is an interesting portrait of the human condition.  Very nice work.</td>', 'They''re remarkably deep crow''s feet.  This is an interesting portrait of the human condition.  Very nice work.', '2006-09-02 12:57:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2788215, 388808, 51538, '<td valign="top">Is that a Fjord?  It''s a glacial valley anyway.  What a startling view.  Super-real rather than surreal.  The symbol in the geometry of the colours is what I view one moment, and in the next I view the countryside.  My mind oscillates between the two.  Strange effect.</td>', 'Is that a Fjord?  It''s a glacial valley anyway.  What a startling view.  Super-real rather than surreal.  The symbol in the geometry of the colours is what I view one moment, and in the next I view the countryside.  My mind oscillates between the two.  Strange effect.', '2006-09-02 12:57:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2788216, 388928, 51538, '<td valign="top">To me, this is quite exquisite.  But I don''t think I am your normal viewer.  8.</td>', 'To me, this is quite exquisite.  But I don''t think I am your normal viewer.  8.', '2006-09-02 12:57:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2788217, 384694, 51538, '<td valign="top">Precise and elegant beauty.  Lovely quality.</td>', 'Precise and elegant beauty.  Lovely quality.', '2006-09-02 12:57:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2788218, 387977, 51538, '<td valign="top">Very nicely taken photo.  Your subject is probably exceptional as well - his dignity and humour are obvious.</td>', 'Very nicely taken photo.  Your subject is probably exceptional as well - his dignity and humour are obvious.', '2006-09-02 12:57:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2788219, 389026, 51538, '<td valign="top">That''s an unreal sight.  Nicely captured.  Exceptional location.</td>', 'That''s an unreal sight.  Nicely captured.  Exceptional location.', '2006-09-02 12:57:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2788222, 379739, 34192, '<td valign="top">I love cows.  I love this image.  Love the contrast.  Nothing at all I would change.  Their positioning is almost mathematical which lends even more to the scene.  Think the processing is excellent - like the high contrast and the patterns. one of those I wish I was there.  I wish I had seen this. 10 and into my favorites.</td>', 'I love cows.  I love this image.  Love the contrast.  Nothing at all I would change.  Their positioning is almost mathematical which lends even more to the scene.  Think the processing is excellent - like the high contrast and the patterns. one of those I wish I was there.  I wish I had seen this. 10 and into my favorites.', '2006-09-02 12:58:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2788223, 388799, 51538, '<td valign="top">I find your photo to be very elegant and modest.  It invites the viewer to enjoy the scene without the use of overbearing effect.  Nice work!</td>', 'I find your photo to be very elegant and modest.  It invites the viewer to enjoy the scene without the use of overbearing effect.  Nice work!', '2006-09-02 12:58:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2788225, 389030, 62095, '<td valign="top">Good level of detail.</td>', 'Good level of detail.', '2006-09-02 12:58:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2788226, 388704, 34192, '<td valign="top">"American Gothic" with an odd twist.  Pretty cool!  Definitely like it.  Glad oyu didn''t hyper saturate the sky - would have lost something for me at least.  Well done! 8<br/> <br/>After viewing all the others must bump to 9</td>', '"American Gothic" with an odd twist.  Pretty cool!  Definitely like it.  Glad oyu didn''t hyper saturate the sky - would have lost something for me at least.  Well done! 8 After viewing all the others must bump to 9', '2006-09-02 12:59:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2788227, 379442, 35602, '<td valign="top">Interesting color processing.  The border, though, might me too wide for the image.  It doesn''t frame it well, since it is only on two sides.  Composition of rest of image is well done, and the rule of thirds was used well for your village portion of the image.</td>', 'Interesting color processing.  The border, though, might me too wide for the image.  It doesn''t frame it well, since it is only on two sides.  Composition of rest of image is well done, and the rule of thirds was used well for your village portion of the image.', '2006-09-02 12:59:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2788228, 388927, 51538, '<td valign="top">The personal nature of notebooks and sketchbooks always fascinates me.  To have the author in the same image as his creations is a double plus.  I think this is excellent work.</td>', 'The personal nature of notebooks and sketchbooks always fascinates me.  To have the author in the same image as his creations is a double plus.  I think this is excellent work.', '2006-09-02 12:59:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2788229, 389005, 62095, '<td valign="top">Lovely building, perfectly captured.</td>', 'Lovely building, perfectly captured.', '2006-09-02 12:59:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2788233, 388678, 35602, '<td valign="top">Looks like one very mad horse.  I wouldn''t want to get my hand near that mouth.  Nice detail on face and mane.  Like the lighting.</td>', 'Looks like one very mad horse.  I wouldn''t want to get my hand near that mouth.  Nice detail on face and mane.  Like the lighting.', '2006-09-02 13:00:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2788235, 385607, 34192, '<td valign="top">Is it the expressions?  the leading lines?  The tonal conversion?  Not sure, but I love this image.  Excellently taken and processed.  Crop and composition perfect. 9 - good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Is it the expressions?  the leading lines?  The tonal conversion?  Not sure, but I love this image.  Excellently taken and processed.  Crop and composition perfect. 9 - good luck in the challenge!', '2006-09-02 13:00:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2788236, 389003, 51538, '<td valign="top">That looks like a nice granite face in your photo.  To have only one person, a single climber, really enhances this image.  The general depth of field is excellent.</td>', 'That looks like a nice granite face in your photo.  To have only one person, a single climber, really enhances this image.  The general depth of field is excellent.', '2006-09-02 13:00:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2788238, 386989, 51538, '<td valign="top">I''m very partial to this type of photo and yours is one of the best.  The colours and moment are very well captured.  Going places - it has a great appeal.</td>', 'I''m very partial to this type of photo and yours is one of the best.  The colours and moment are very well captured.  Going places - it has a great appeal.', '2006-09-02 13:00:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2788239, 377998, 51538, '<td valign="top">Yours is a highly emotitive image.  There is a lot of feeling there (pun not intended).  The photography is also well done.</td>', 'Yours is a highly emotitive image.  There is a lot of feeling there (pun not intended).  The photography is also well done.', '2006-09-02 13:00:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2788240, 389018, 35602, '<td valign="top">Very whimsical.  Wonderful expression on her face.  Just a really nice compelling image.</td>', 'Very whimsical.  Wonderful expression on her face.  Just a really nice compelling image.', '2006-09-02 13:01:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2788242, 388543, 51538, '<td valign="top">The seascape behind the gull is just fullenough of colour and definition to really make this photo without detracting from the fine detail of the bird''s feathers.  The eye, of course, makes this bird very lively.</td>', 'The seascape behind the gull is just fullenough of colour and definition to really make this photo without detracting from the fine detail of the bird''s feathers.  The eye, of course, makes this bird very lively.', '2006-09-02 13:01:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2788243, 383713, 51538, '<td valign="top">Beautiful green tones in your photo.  I find it subtle and precise.  Very nice work.</td>', 'Beautiful green tones in your photo.  I find it subtle and precise.  Very nice work.', '2006-09-02 13:02:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2788244, 388857, 51538, '<td valign="top">Very nice model  Lovely, lasting photo.</td>', 'Very nice model  Lovely, lasting photo.', '2006-09-02 13:02:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2788248, 388863, 51538, '<td valign="top">Except for the helmets, your photo seems to come from another time in an earlier era.  The building behind fixes this race in the world.  The splatter adds the dynamic element needed.  Lovely work.</td>', 'Except for the helmets, your photo seems to come from another time in an earlier era.  The building behind fixes this race in the world.  The splatter adds the dynamic element needed.  Lovely work.', '2006-09-02 13:03:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2788251, 388714, 56658, '<td valign="top">DOF is pretty niec but lighting is knida harsh. not very exciting to me overall.</td>', 'DOF is pretty niec but lighting is knida harsh. not very exciting to me overall.', '2006-09-02 13:04:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2788252, 388573, 51538, '<td valign="top">That''s a lovely moment you have caught.  Personal, but not intrusive.  Very nice work.</td>', 'That''s a lovely moment you have caught.  Personal, but not intrusive.  Very nice work.', '2006-09-02 13:04:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2788254, 384437, 35602, '<td valign="top">The sky is really colorful.  Love that part of it.  The lower part of the image, though, is really showing a lot of artifacts, probably due to an image that started out very underexposed.  Need to either try a longer shutter speed, or maybe a higher iso, though that can create artifacts too.  If you have an express fix on your program, that might also create artifacts.  Brightness and contrast adjustments seem to work better, along with dodging.  You might also try to spot edit some of the artifacts out, or maybe apply a noise reducer to clear it up.</td>', 'The sky is really colorful.  Love that part of it.  The lower part of the image, though, is really showing a lot of artifacts, probably due to an image that started out very underexposed.  Need to either try a longer shutter speed, or maybe a higher iso, though that can create artifacts too.  If you have an express fix on your program, that might also create artifacts.  Brightness and contrast adjustments seem to work better, along with dodging.  You might also try to spot edit some of the artifacts out, or maybe apply a noise reducer to clear it up.', '2006-09-02 13:04:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2788259, 387690, 60698, '<td valign="top">It''s Bill Gates! :) Has the Windows XP default desktop feel to it. <br/>Nice photo!</td>', 'It''s Bill Gates! :) Has the Windows XP default desktop feel to it. Nice photo!', '2006-09-02 13:08:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2788261, 388938, 8637, '<td valign="top">Beautifully illuminated...really sets this apart from the usual cat portrait.</td>', 'Beautifully illuminated...really sets this apart from the usual cat portrait.', '2006-09-02 13:08:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2788266, 387237, 34192, '<td valign="top">I haven''t the opportunity to see the original but I don''t don''t think the inversion enhances the image.  I like the leading lines of the trees.</td>', 'I haven''t the opportunity to see the original but I don''t don''t think the inversion enhances the image.  I like the leading lines of the trees.', '2006-09-02 13:09:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2788272, 385192, 34192, '<td valign="top">well composed but I think the use of noise reduction software doesn''t enhance the image.</td>', 'well composed but I think the use of noise reduction software doesn''t enhance the image.', '2006-09-02 13:10:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2788274, 387597, 34192, '<td valign="top">Well composed but the noise reduction software doesn''t enhance the image.</td>', 'Well composed but the noise reduction software doesn''t enhance the image.', '2006-09-02 13:11:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2788276, 389012, 11854, '<td valign="top">This is such a cute candid! They look like they''re having a blast.</td>', 'This is such a cute candid! They look like they''re having a blast.', '2006-09-02 13:12:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2788277, 388373, 7485, '<td valign="top">Classic composition and the colors and contrast work very well, making the white sail look luminous. But the horizon looks tilted (maybe just a curve to the lake, but it still makes the image feel tilted). Also, those two birds in the center are too small to add interest, but big enough to be distracting (and they are easy to edit out).</td>', 'Classic composition and the colors and contrast work very well, making the white sail look luminous. But the horizon looks tilted (maybe just a curve to the lake, but it still makes the image feel tilted). Also, those two birds in the center are too small to add interest, but big enough to be distracting (and they are easy to edit out).', '2006-09-02 13:12:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2788278, 383538, 34192, '<td valign="top">well composed and great timing but I think noise reducing SW took away all the great texture.</td>', 'well composed and great timing but I think noise reducing SW took away all the great texture.', '2006-09-02 13:12:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2788283, 388857, 11854, '<td valign="top">What beautiful lighting! And the model is wonderful...the expression is priceless. I really love the piece of grass sticking out from between the toes! Excellent job, 8 from me.</td>', 'What beautiful lighting! And the model is wonderful...the expression is priceless. I really love the piece of grass sticking out from between the toes! Excellent job, 8 from me.', '2006-09-02 13:13:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2788284, 379655, 34192, '<td valign="top">good composition.  Contrast a little flat.</td>', 'good composition.  Contrast a little flat.', '2006-09-02 13:14:28.000000', NULL, 1);
