(2788286, 383291, 11854, '<td valign="top">Wonderful lines and silhouttes! The muted colors work well here. 8</td>', 'Wonderful lines and silhouttes! The muted colors work well here. 8', '2006-09-02 13:14:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2788290, 387754, 11854, '<td valign="top">Wow, what a penetrating stare! Excellent character. Colors and lighting are wonderful. 8 from me.</td>', 'Wow, what a penetrating stare! Excellent character. Colors and lighting are wonderful. 8 from me.', '2006-09-02 13:15:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2788291, 384877, 11854, '<td valign="top">Beautiful portrait of a beautiful woman! Great job. 8 from me.</td>', 'Beautiful portrait of a beautiful woman! Great job. 8 from me.', '2006-09-02 13:16:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2788294, 384219, 11854, '<td valign="top">Very dreamy surreal feel! Excellent work. 8</td>', 'Very dreamy surreal feel! Excellent work. 8', '2006-09-02 13:17:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2788297, 388129, 11854, '<td valign="top">Very surreal and dreamy. Excellent shot of "just an old stump"! Love the reflection. 8 from me.</td>', 'Very surreal and dreamy. Excellent shot of "just an old stump"! Love the reflection. 8 from me.', '2006-09-02 13:18:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2788298, 389035, 11854, '<td valign="top">I see the moon, and the moon see me. Goodnight moon. Goodnight me. Excellent job! 8 from me.</td>', 'I see the moon, and the moon see me. Goodnight moon. Goodnight me. Excellent job! 8 from me.', '2006-09-02 13:18:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2788299, 385607, 7485, '<td valign="top">The expression says it all: life is good! Also great use of deep focus, Gregg Toland would have been proud of this shot.</td>', 'The expression says it all: life is good! Also great use of deep focus, Gregg Toland would have been proud of this shot.', '2006-09-02 13:18:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2788302, 389000, 11854, '<td valign="top">Aawww, I love monkey shots! Excellent capture of a great expression!</td>', 'Aawww, I love monkey shots! Excellent capture of a great expression!', '2006-09-02 13:19:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2788304, 386384, 11854, '<td valign="top">Yes, it surely was! Great capture. 8 from me.</td>', 'Yes, it surely was! Great capture. 8 from me.', '2006-09-02 13:20:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2788305, 381208, 11854, '<td valign="top">Beautiful detail. Excellent sharpness. Love the selective desat. 8 from me.</td>', 'Beautiful detail. Excellent sharpness. Love the selective desat. 8 from me.', '2006-09-02 13:20:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2788306, 387790, 11854, '<td valign="top">Very surreal. Beautiful capture.</td>', 'Very surreal. Beautiful capture.', '2006-09-02 13:21:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2788308, 384471, 11854, '<td valign="top">Aawww, she is too cute! Very sharp and beautiful lighting.</td>', 'Aawww, she is too cute! Very sharp and beautiful lighting.', '2006-09-02 13:21:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2788311, 380178, 5885, '<td valign="top">One word... WOW</td>', 'One word... WOW', '2006-09-02 13:22:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2788313, 374261, 11854, '<td valign="top">Aawww, poor baby! I''d cry too if I had to get a bath outside in a sink! Great capture of that precious expression.</td>', 'Aawww, poor baby! I''d cry too if I had to get a bath outside in a sink! Great capture of that precious expression.', '2006-09-02 13:22:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2788318, 386832, 60698, '<td valign="top">Love the cool colors and simple composition. Original and refreshing!</td>', 'Love the cool colors and simple composition. Original and refreshing!', '2006-09-02 13:26:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2788325, 387289, 7485, '<td valign="top">Easily the coolest sports photo I''ve seen for a long time! Catching all four hoofs and the ball in the air is amazing enough, but fitting them all into this tight crop and shallow DOF makes for an incredible photo. I think you''ve also chosen wisely to include this much foreground. My first instinct was to slide the window down on the screen because I thought the image would look better with less foreground, but it takes away from the feeling of the horse being truly airborne. 10</td>', 'Easily the coolest sports photo I''ve seen for a long time! Catching all four hoofs and the ball in the air is amazing enough, but fitting them all into this tight crop and shallow DOF makes for an incredible photo. I think you''ve also chosen wisely to include this much foreground. My first instinct was to slide the window down on the screen because I thought the image would look better with less foreground, but it takes away from the feeling of the horse being truly airborne. 10', '2006-09-02 13:29:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2788326, 383689, 5885, '<td valign="top">RIBBON! :-) Awesome , see you on the front page.</td>', 'RIBBON! :-) Awesome , see you on the front page.', '2006-09-02 13:29:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2788328, 389035, 5885, '<td valign="top">Nice detail in that moon.</td>', 'Nice detail in that moon.', '2006-09-02 13:32:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2788331, 387754, 7485, '<td valign="top">The matching textures between his skin and the leather cap are marvellous. Lighting and tight crop also excellent.</td>', 'The matching textures between his skin and the leather cap are marvellous. Lighting and tight crop also excellent.', '2006-09-02 13:33:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2788332, 388461, 34192, '<td valign="top">Interesting texture and composition.  Love the tones.  Frame and title work.  8 - good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Interesting texture and composition.  Love the tones.  Frame and title work.  8 - good luck in the challenge!', '2006-09-02 13:33:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2788333, 388698, 34192, '<td valign="top">I really like the very simple presentation.  The red border a little too bright for me but it helps at the bottom of the frame.  title so-so but I have no clue for an alternate. 8 - good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'I really like the very simple presentation.  The red border a little too bright for me but it helps at the bottom of the frame.  title so-so but I have no clue for an alternate. 8 - good luck in the challenge!', '2006-09-02 13:33:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2788334, 388742, 34192, '<td valign="top">in some odd way, I like this.  The noise, the shake, the garish colors, all provide me with such a sense of place, a sense of being there, that I can hear the pins drop.  Composed well. 8 - good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'in some odd way, I like this.  The noise, the shake, the garish colors, all provide me with such a sense of place, a sense of being there, that I can hear the pins drop.  Composed well. 8 - good luck in the challenge!', '2006-09-02 13:33:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2788335, 388034, 34192, '<td valign="top">beautiful black and white conversion.  Lighting makes the scene.</td>', 'beautiful black and white conversion.  Lighting makes the scene.', '2006-09-02 13:33:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2788336, 388633, 5885, '<td valign="top">Awwwww!</td>', 'Awwwww!', '2006-09-02 13:34:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2788349, 375476, 60698, '<td valign="top">Nice photo. Like the color combo, texture combo and model''s classic, quiet beauty. Would like to see it with different shoes.</td>', 'Nice photo. Like the color combo, texture combo and model''s classic, quiet beauty. Would like to see it with different shoes.', '2006-09-02 13:48:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2788353, 388956, 30982, '<td valign="top">I really like the light and the composition.  I''d have preferred either all in duotone/B&amp;W or in color, maybe desaturated a little (not knowing what the color version looks like, of course.)</td>', 'I really like the light and the composition.  I''d have preferred either all in duotone/B&W or in color, maybe desaturated a little (not knowing what the color version looks like, of course.)', '2006-09-02 13:50:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2788354, 388704, 60698, '<td valign="top">Nice idea for a bride and groom. Great photo, but I wonder why they look so unhappy?</td>', 'Nice idea for a bride and groom. Great photo, but I wonder why they look so unhappy?', '2006-09-02 13:51:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2788357, 388945, 30982, '<td valign="top">Now how did you manage to pull this off?  Tame moth?  Very nice!!</td>', 'Now how did you manage to pull this off?  Tame moth?  Very nice!!', '2006-09-02 13:52:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2788360, 388778, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like the long exposure (at least that''s how I suspect the clouds are done) and the composition a lot.  Not a huge fan of IR but I like it better in B&amp;W than in color.</td>', 'I like the long exposure (at least that''s how I suspect the clouds are done) and the composition a lot.  Not a huge fan of IR but I like it better in B&W than in color.', '2006-09-02 13:53:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2788361, 388717, 30982, '<td valign="top">The dramatic sky adds nicely to this.  The aqua of the water seems a bit unnatural, but I wasn''t there so I''ll trust it was that color.</td>', 'The dramatic sky adds nicely to this.  The aqua of the water seems a bit unnatural, but I wasn''t there so I''ll trust it was that color.', '2006-09-02 13:54:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2788363, 388865, 30982, '<td valign="top">Wonderful texture study!</td>', 'Wonderful texture study!', '2006-09-02 13:55:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2788367, 388788, 30982, '<td valign="top">Well seen, nicely presented.</td>', 'Well seen, nicely presented.', '2006-09-02 13:57:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2788368, 389026, 30982, '<td valign="top">Would work nicely as a postcard!</td>', 'Would work nicely as a postcard!', '2006-09-02 13:57:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2788369, 389031, 37961, '<td valign="top">Really diggin the pose, model and light on the hat. Only thing i see that I dont like is that her right eye seems dodged more than the left, but most people probably wont notice this. Good job!</td>', 'Really diggin the pose, model and light on the hat. Only thing i see that I dont like is that her right eye seems dodged more than the left, but most people probably wont notice this. Good job!', '2006-09-02 13:57:34.000000', NULL, 1),
