(2788377, 388927, 30982, '<td valign="top">The angle and the toning work well for this shot.  The bit of dark under his arm is unfortunate but really doesn''t detract very much from this portrait.</td>', 'The angle and the toning work well for this shot.  The bit of dark under his arm is unfortunate but really doesn''t detract very much from this portrait.', '2006-09-02 13:59:51.000000', NULL, 1),
