(2788380, 382683, 60698, '<td valign="top">I love this one because of the color, the bright eye and because it''s artistic and ORIGINAL! My first 10 so far!</td>', 'I love this one because of the color, the bright eye and because it''s artistic and ORIGINAL! My first 10 so far!', '2006-09-02 14:01:01.000000', NULL, 1),
