(2788555, 386323, 18367, '<td valign="top">A very nice image, but a tad to centered for my liking. <br/> <br/>Rather sad that there isn''t a fence on this side as you could have used that as a leading line to the buildings and rocks.  Good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'A very nice image, but a tad to centered for my liking.  Rather sad that there isn''t a fence on this side as you could have used that as a leading line to the buildings and rocks.  Good luck with the challenge.', '2006-09-02 14:49:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2788557, 388475, 40106, '<td valign="top">Some thoughts:<br/> <br/>-Nice use of the rule of thirds<br/>-May have been better in black and white because of the dull colors in the sky<br/>- I love the pose!! What a little cutie!<br/>- Score: 6</td>', 'Some thoughts: -Nice use of the rule of thirds-May have been better in black and white because of the dull colors in the sky- I love the pose!! What a little cutie!- Score: 6', '2006-09-02 14:50:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2788561, 379985, 40106, '<td valign="top">Some thoughts:<br/>-Gorgeous blue eyes!!<br/>-Nice work capturing her personality perfectly. Some people make the mistake of giving a young person a pose or expression that is too old for them... this is right on the money!<br/>-Nice colors and lighting!<br/>-Score: 7</td>', 'Some thoughts:-Gorgeous blue eyes!!-Nice work capturing her personality perfectly. Some people make the mistake of giving a young person a pose or expression that is too old for them... this is right on the money!-Nice colors and lighting!-Score: 7', '2006-09-02 14:51:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2788563, 388784, 25773, '<td valign="top">Great idea and execution. The only thing that feel a bit odd for me is the sunglasses in her hand...</td>', 'Great idea and execution. The only thing that feel a bit odd for me is the sunglasses in her hand...', '2006-09-02 14:52:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2788565, 379109, 15204, '<td valign="top">I like the high key look here, but the lack of catchlights in her dark eyes (except for the pin-light flash) really hurts the image.  Try putting her nearer to a window and watch for light in the eyes before you shoot.  I like that you got down on her level for this shot.  You captured a great little girl expression.  You have a lovely little model.</td>', 'I like the high key look here, but the lack of catchlights in her dark eyes (except for the pin-light flash) really hurts the image.  Try putting her nearer to a window and watch for light in the eyes before you shoot.  I like that you got down on her level for this shot.  You captured a great little girl expression.  You have a lovely little model.', '2006-09-02 14:52:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2788566, 388214, 40106, '<td valign="top">Some thoughts:<br/> <br/>-Looks like a super cute couple!!<br/>-Love the title<br/>-Some post processing would be good to lighten the picture up, add a little bit of contrast, and sharpen <br/>-Would have been stronger if the feet were not cut off in my opinion<br/>-Score: 5</td>', 'Some thoughts: -Looks like a super cute couple!!-Love the title-Some post processing would be good to lighten the picture up, add a little bit of contrast, and sharpen -Would have been stronger if the feet were not cut off in my opinion-Score: 5', '2006-09-02 14:52:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2788567, 388575, 18367, '<td valign="top">Oh my.  This is a very daring photo on your part, since it does require that the viewer have a very well calibrated monitor.  I do hope for your sake that I am wrong, but your score might suffer because of this. Good luck</td>', 'Oh my.  This is a very daring photo on your part, since it does require that the viewer have a very well calibrated monitor.  I do hope for your sake that I am wrong, but your score might suffer because of this. Good luck', '2006-09-02 14:53:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2788570, 387259, 37818, '<td valign="top">I wish the baby was all alone on the shelf...but very cute!</td>', 'I wish the baby was all alone on the shelf...but very cute!', '2006-09-02 14:53:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2788572, 387226, 40106, '<td valign="top">Some thoughts:<br/> <br/>-Looks like you waited for the perfect moment!<br/>-Very serene and peaceful<br/>-Perfectly straight horizon :)<br/>-The texture of the water looks somewhat off, not sure why.. too sharp??<br/>-While this is a beautiful photo, it''s one that I''ve seen over and over again... it lacks the creativity I am looking for.<br/>-Score: 6</td>', 'Some thoughts: -Looks like you waited for the perfect moment!-Very serene and peaceful-Perfectly straight horizon :)-The texture of the water looks somewhat off, not sure why.. too sharp??-While this is a beautiful photo, it''s one that I''ve seen over and over again... it lacks the creativity I am looking for.-Score: 6', '2006-09-02 14:54:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2788574, 388633, 15204, '<td valign="top">A wonderful angle for a sleeping newborn.  So many photographers get a sort of ''up-the-nose'' angle on babies lying down.  Great DOF and wonderful shrpness in the face.  I love the fist curled up by the face.  So sweet.  This seems cool and a tad underexposed, though.</td>', 'A wonderful angle for a sleeping newborn.  So many photographers get a sort of ''up-the-nose'' angle on babies lying down.  Great DOF and wonderful shrpness in the face.  I love the fist curled up by the face.  So sweet.  This seems cool and a tad underexposed, though.', '2006-09-02 14:55:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2788575, 385708, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nice round the corner scene with good exposure.</td>', 'Nice round the corner scene with good exposure.', '2006-09-02 14:55:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2788577, 388830, 18367, '<td valign="top">Absolutely stunning image.  Great DOF, fantastics colours, beautiful bokeh.  Let us hope that those that abhor bugs are in the minority and that this does very well.  Good job.</td>', 'Absolutely stunning image.  Great DOF, fantastics colours, beautiful bokeh.  Let us hope that those that abhor bugs are in the minority and that this does very well.  Good job.', '2006-09-02 14:55:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2788578, 387409, 40106, '<td valign="top">Some thoughts:<br/> <br/>-I usually don''t like pictures where the subject is centered but I think it works really nicely here!!  Good choice<br/>-Cute girl, beautiful expression!<br/>-Nice lighting!<br/>-Score: 7</td>', 'Some thoughts: -I usually don''t like pictures where the subject is centered but I think it works really nicely here!!  Good choice-Cute girl, beautiful expression!-Nice lighting!-Score: 7', '2006-09-02 14:55:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2788580, 381536, 51538, '<td valign="top">Scuttled on a sandy shoreline.  The rusty subject would be hard to resist photographing.</td>', 'Scuttled on a sandy shoreline.  The rusty subject would be hard to resist photographing.', '2006-09-02 14:56:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2788583, 388884, 40106, '<td valign="top">Some thoughts:<br/> <br/>-I like the idea of the off centered composition, however, I would have placed the birds on the right side of the frame to give the idea that they are flying into the wide open, instead of to the end of the frame.<br/>-AWESOME lighting and colors, they couldn''t be better<br/>-Score: 5</td>', 'Some thoughts: -I like the idea of the off centered composition, however, I would have placed the birds on the right side of the frame to give the idea that they are flying into the wide open, instead of to the end of the frame.-AWESOME lighting and colors, they couldn''t be better-Score: 5', '2006-09-02 14:57:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2788584, 385685, 51538, '<td valign="top">Undressed for all the world to see.  Your view of their view is an interesting composition.</td>', 'Undressed for all the world to see.  Your view of their view is an interesting composition.', '2006-09-02 14:57:24.000000', NULL, 1),
