(2788628, 387897, 25773, '<td valign="top">Fantastic sharpness+great catch with the flying bee!</td>', 'Fantastic sharpness+great catch with the flying bee!', '2006-09-02 15:14:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2788630, 387288, 23053, '<td valign="top">Very sharp focus, and it is nice that the hands of the owner are slightly visible, to show that not only the pig is content.  Personally, I feel that some of the impact that is felt by the photographer may not be translated to the casual viewer, but that is often the case with subjects near and dear to the photographer''s heart.  Good luck.</td>', 'Very sharp focus, and it is nice that the hands of the owner are slightly visible, to show that not only the pig is content.  Personally, I feel that some of the impact that is felt by the photographer may not be translated to the casual viewer, but that is often the case with subjects near and dear to the photographer''s heart.  Good luck.', '2006-09-02 15:15:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2788632, 388788, 23053, '<td valign="top">The colors are very rich here, almost glowing.  I like the detail, but I do feel that the saturation is almost too strong.  It would make a fine postcard.  Good luck this week.</td>', 'The colors are very rich here, almost glowing.  I like the detail, but I do feel that the saturation is almost too strong.  It would make a fine postcard.  Good luck this week.', '2006-09-02 15:17:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2788635, 384198, 23053, '<td valign="top">Wow, four bug eyes in one shot.  Congratulations on that.  Quite a comical entry that should fair fairly well.  Good luck this week, both of you.</td>', 'Wow, four bug eyes in one shot.  Congratulations on that.  Quite a comical entry that should fair fairly well.  Good luck this week, both of you.', '2006-09-02 15:18:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2788643, 388784, 23053, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot, but I think it''s over my head as far as the subtext goes.  Maybe not...I mean, she''s in a dirty, dark place, and it will be hard to get out, but she knows what she has to do.  Too bad she''s wearing heels...always hard to climb drain culverts in heels.  Good luck.</td>', 'Interesting shot, but I think it''s over my head as far as the subtext goes.  Maybe not...I mean, she''s in a dirty, dark place, and it will be hard to get out, but she knows what she has to do.  Too bad she''s wearing heels...always hard to climb drain culverts in heels.  Good luck.', '2006-09-02 15:21:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2788650, 388656, 23053, '<td valign="top">These shots always drive me crazy when it comes time to post-process, but I think you did a good job.  Trying to keep the sky from getting too light and keep the trees from getting too dark is not a fun task.  Having the horizon line dead-center feels funny to me here...I think pushing it off-center could have added extra impact to this shot.  It is beautiful, and well executed besides.  Good luck this week.</td>', 'These shots always drive me crazy when it comes time to post-process, but I think you did a good job.  Trying to keep the sky from getting too light and keep the trees from getting too dark is not a fun task.  Having the horizon line dead-center feels funny to me here...I think pushing it off-center could have added extra impact to this shot.  It is beautiful, and well executed besides.  Good luck this week.', '2006-09-02 15:24:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2788654, 388802, 23053, '<td valign="top">Something tells me I won''t be the first or the last to mention the very bright pine needles at the bottom.  The green is quite strong and it pulls my eyes away from the rather spectacular sunset.  It is nice that you have something in your shot other than the mountains and the sunset, but this green was too much for me.  Good luck.</td>', 'Something tells me I won''t be the first or the last to mention the very bright pine needles at the bottom.  The green is quite strong and it pulls my eyes away from the rather spectacular sunset.  It is nice that you have something in your shot other than the mountains and the sunset, but this green was too much for me.  Good luck.', '2006-09-02 15:26:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2788658, 388320, 51793, '<td valign="top">She is very cute. I like the softness of the image and she makes it stand out very well.</td>', 'She is very cute. I like the softness of the image and she makes it stand out very well.', '2006-09-02 15:29:04.000000', NULL, 1),
