(2788683, 374466, 23053, '<td valign="top">Whoa...I almost missed the wings.  If not for the title, I probably would have.  This is an interesting shot, and I like the washed-out colors.  To be honest, though, I think the lights are almost too light, and the darks are almost too dark.</td>', 'Whoa...I almost missed the wings.  If not for the title, I probably would have.  This is an interesting shot, and I like the washed-out colors.  To be honest, though, I think the lights are almost too light, and the darks are almost too dark.', '2006-09-02 15:39:12.000000', NULL, 1),
