(2788691, 388826, 60779, '<td valign="top">Even though I''m not a big fan of this type, I appreciate your achievement in free study photography. I like the colors of the sky and the detail on the wood on the ''house''. 6</td>', 'Even though I''m not a big fan of this type, I appreciate your achievement in free study photography. I like the colors of the sky and the detail on the wood on the ''house''. 6', '2006-09-02 15:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
