(2788698, 388884, 60779, '<td valign="top">I''d prefer to see the birds flying into the majority of the photo. The crop makes it look as though they''re about to fly out of phot. Great sky in background. Another plus is the capture. That''s not easy. 6.</td>', 'I''d prefer to see the birds flying into the majority of the photo. The crop makes it look as though they''re about to fly out of phot. Great sky in background. Another plus is the capture. That''s not easy. 6.', '2006-09-02 15:44:01.000000', NULL, 1),
