(2789127, 379749, 62187, '<td valign="top">I''ve stood in this same spot many times and have taken very similar photos. This is where I''ve seen the Condors flying. You''re facing northeast - away from the sunset but yes, I can tell by the shadows it certainly is towards the end of the day according to the shadows. I''m wondering if while you were at Yavapai Point, you had a chance to watch the the clouds turn red? When the challenge is over I''ll have to come back to see if you''ve got a portfolio and check for more photos. Good job on this one and good luck to ya!</td>', 'I''ve stood in this same spot many times and have taken very similar photos. This is where I''ve seen the Condors flying. You''re facing northeast - away from the sunset but yes, I can tell by the shadows it certainly is towards the end of the day according to the shadows. I''m wondering if while you were at Yavapai Point, you had a chance to watch the the clouds turn red? When the challenge is over I''ll have to come back to see if you''ve got a portfolio and check for more photos. Good job on this one and good luck to ya!', '2006-09-02 17:18:22.000000', NULL, 1),
