(2789229, 388648, 19708, '<td valign="top">A scene that is timeless.<br/>I can hear the sounds of kids, playing, running and jumping off the dock, the quiet sounds of crickets &amp; frogs as a lone fisherman sits, straw in between his teeth, bobber sitting motionless in the water.<br/>It''s great when a photograph can stir the imagination. Well done!</td>', 'A scene that is timeless.I can hear the sounds of kids, playing, running and jumping off the dock, the quiet sounds of crickets & frogs as a lone fisherman sits, straw in between his teeth, bobber sitting motionless in the water.It''s great when a photograph can stir the imagination. Well done!', '2006-09-02 17:31:56.000000', NULL, 1),
