(2789542, 381111, 62187, '<td valign="top">Dang...it looks like he''s wearing a motorcycle helmet and a funny ''superhero'' mask or something. I''ve never tried macro but the focus is really sharp on the portion of his wings right behind his torso...the colors are amazing on this creature.</td>', 'Dang...it looks like he''s wearing a motorcycle helmet and a funny ''superhero'' mask or something. I''ve never tried macro but the focus is really sharp on the portion of his wings right behind his torso...the colors are amazing on this creature.', '2006-09-02 18:32:03.000000', NULL, 1),
