(2789625, 388945, 7485, '<td valign="top">Ironically, this otherwise great photo is ruined by its unnatural texture: there''s this grid pattern all over it, which I''m guessing is a compression artifact. Your file is just over 100KB, but the limit for this challenge was 200KB, so you didn''t need to compress nearly this much.</td>', 'Ironically, this otherwise great photo is ruined by its unnatural texture: there''s this grid pattern all over it, which I''m guessing is a compression artifact. Your file is just over 100KB, but the limit for this challenge was 200KB, so you didn''t need to compress nearly this much.', '2006-09-02 18:57:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2789630, 388841, 56658, '<td valign="top">the foreground out of focus is distracting. just not alot of WOW factor to me sorry.</td>', 'the foreground out of focus is distracting. just not alot of WOW factor to me sorry.', '2006-09-02 19:00:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2789632, 388985, 3102, '<td valign="top">An ok action shot, but I thought I''d add some suggestions since sports photography is one of my favority things (I shoot Steelers games for a local newspaper).  My first suggestion is to focus on the action.  There''s a bit too much clutter here in the form of players that aren''t intregal to the scene.  I''d probably make this a vertical shot of just the quarterback, and get rid of the guys on the right and left.<br/> <br/>I think this would have been a bit stronger if we were able to see the running back, or whomever the ball is being handed to.  As it is, it seems like it lacks a bit of punch since this isn''t really a decisive moment of the game, and we can''t clearly see any really good facial expressions.</td>', 'An ok action shot, but I thought I''d add some suggestions since sports photography is one of my favority things (I shoot Steelers games for a local newspaper).  My first suggestion is to focus on the action.  There''s a bit too much clutter here in the form of players that aren''t intregal to the scene.  I''d probably make this a vertical shot of just the quarterback, and get rid of the guys on the right and left. I think this would have been a bit stronger if we were able to see the running back, or whomever the ball is being handed to.  As it is, it seems like it lacks a bit of punch since this isn''t really a decisive moment of the game, and we can''t clearly see any really good facial expressions.', '2006-09-02 19:01:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2789634, 388857, 3102, '<td valign="top">Very adorable shot!  Assuming this is your kid, I''d be sure to blow this up and hang it somewhere prominent!</td>', 'Very adorable shot!  Assuming this is your kid, I''d be sure to blow this up and hang it somewhere prominent!', '2006-09-02 19:03:06.000000', NULL, 1),
