(2790818, 383720, 59215, '<td valign="top">What a fun image! Just wish you had taken advantage of the 720 pixel width allowance, I want to see it bigger:)</td>', 'What a fun image! Just wish you had taken advantage of the 720 pixel width allowance, I want to see it bigger:)', '2006-09-03 02:10:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2790826, 386317, 43463, '<td valign="top">Oh! Now the colors and level of detail in this flower macro is stunning!!! Love the hues of the purples and blacks for they are deep &amp; rich. They really ''pop'' visually. The additional element of the water drops adorning the flower petals adds even more visual appeal. The crop where the center of the flower (the tongue as you title it) curls down and out of the petals really anthropomorphizes this flower.</td>', 'Oh! Now the colors and level of detail in this flower macro is stunning!!! Love the hues of the purples and blacks for they are deep & rich. They really ''pop'' visually. The additional element of the water drops adorning the flower petals adds even more visual appeal. The crop where the center of the flower (the tongue as you title it) curls down and out of the petals really anthropomorphizes this flower.', '2006-09-03 02:13:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2790845, 374261, 43463, '<td valign="top">Great expression and capture of the elements in this photo. It challenges the stereotypical thoughts that we picture of a child happily splashing in the bath. This child is absolutey NOT HAPPY! It is that atypical reaction that catches and holds our attention. For most, this capture would make us uncomfortable for no one likes to see an unhappy child - and that is the hook that you caught us by. The hook that makes us stop to look. Lighting and skin tone colors are spot on perfect. The only critique I have on this photograph is that you could eliminate the bottom portion of the image right where the pipe meets the tub and crop it to a square crop. That would strengthen the composition by keeping the attention firmly focused on your main subject - the child in the tub.</td>', 'Great expression and capture of the elements in this photo. It challenges the stereotypical thoughts that we picture of a child happily splashing in the bath. This child is absolutey NOT HAPPY! It is that atypical reaction that catches and holds our attention. For most, this capture would make us uncomfortable for no one likes to see an unhappy child - and that is the hook that you caught us by. The hook that makes us stop to look. Lighting and skin tone colors are spot on perfect. The only critique I have on this photograph is that you could eliminate the bottom portion of the image right where the pipe meets the tub and crop it to a square crop. That would strengthen the composition by keeping the attention firmly focused on your main subject - the child in the tub.', '2006-09-03 02:24:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2790849, 384767, 19708, '<td valign="top">One of two things here:<br/>1) This saturation and contrast was done intentionally, or<br/>2) The monitor you edited this on was way off (laptop?)<br/> <br/>This is a spectacular view/landscape and amazing sky - Well done on the composition! Can I pretty please edit the original?????<br/>The post-processing hurts this submission in my opinion. (6)</td>', 'One of two things here:1) This saturation and contrast was done intentionally, or2) The monitor you edited this on was way off (laptop?) This is a spectacular view/landscape and amazing sky - Well done on the composition! Can I pretty please edit the original?????The post-processing hurts this submission in my opinion. (6)', '2006-09-03 02:31:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2790853, 387289, 19708, '<td valign="top">Great timing on this shot.<br/>Very unique approach in the crop and good supporting title.<br/>I have mixed feelings on this as to if the red band helps or hurts the overall here.</td>', 'Great timing on this shot.Very unique approach in the crop and good supporting title.I have mixed feelings on this as to if the red band helps or hurts the overall here.', '2006-09-03 02:33:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2790855, 387929, 19708, '<td valign="top">Nice silouhette. Very peaceful, calming, simple.<br/>Have you tried bumping the red &amp; yellow saturation up a bit to cast more of a sun reflection glow in the water? Just a thought.</td>', 'Nice silouhette. Very peaceful, calming, simple.Have you tried bumping the red & yellow saturation up a bit to cast more of a sun reflection glow in the water? Just a thought.', '2006-09-03 02:35:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2790856, 383437, 19708, '<td valign="top">Great point of view and scale, and certainly not the kind of shot most of us will ever get the chance to see or photograph. Well done!</td>', 'Great point of view and scale, and certainly not the kind of shot most of us will ever get the chance to see or photograph. Well done!', '2006-09-03 02:36:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2790859, 386911, 31133, '<td valign="top">The subject and the light are nice. I have two critiques that I hope are helpful. If you intended it this way, please forgive me: To me, there seems to be a yellow overtone that isn''t quite natural. Also I''d like to see stronger focus in the left side of the image (so that it''s as strong as in the right hand side). I love the way you got the masts in the water. The water is probably my favorite part of your image. There''s so much to look at there and it''s very calming.</td>', 'The subject and the light are nice. I have two critiques that I hope are helpful. If you intended it this way, please forgive me: To me, there seems to be a yellow overtone that isn''t quite natural. Also I''d like to see stronger focus in the left side of the image (so that it''s as strong as in the right hand side). I love the way you got the masts in the water. The water is probably my favorite part of your image. There''s so much to look at there and it''s very calming.', '2006-09-03 02:38:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2790864, 383720, 19708, '<td valign="top">Gotta'' love the fisheye lens distortion, as they can be so much fun.<br/>This would have had so much more "in your face" impact had you used the full 720 pixels allowed.</td>', 'Gotta'' love the fisheye lens distortion, as they can be so much fun.This would have had so much more "in your face" impact had you used the full 720 pixels allowed.', '2006-09-03 02:41:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2790866, 388867, 19708, '<td valign="top">I am finding it hard to be real interested in this image as the main focal point isn''t very clear, the "stray" portions in the lower left seem out of place and a bit distracting, and overall over-powered by the border.</td>', 'I am finding it hard to be real interested in this image as the main focal point isn''t very clear, the "stray" portions in the lower left seem out of place and a bit distracting, and overall over-powered by the border.', '2006-09-03 02:44:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2790868, 388780, 19708, '<td valign="top">What amazing detail!<br/>I have GOT TO get a decent macro lens - this is excellent!<br/>Well done.</td>', 'What amazing detail!I have GOT TO get a decent macro lens - this is excellent!Well done.', '2006-09-03 02:44:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2790869, 389032, 31133, '<td valign="top">Wow, what a landscape!! Could this be Colorado? You''ve done a super good job of retaining the clairity in everything while still showing the details in shadow and light areas. The reflections of the clouds on the river are breathtaking - the leading line of the river, leading the eye to the left third of the image is perfect.</td>', 'Wow, what a landscape!! Could this be Colorado? You''ve done a super good job of retaining the clairity in everything while still showing the details in shadow and light areas. The reflections of the clouds on the river are breathtaking - the leading line of the river, leading the eye to the left third of the image is perfect.', '2006-09-03 02:45:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2790872, 388783, 31133, '<td valign="top">I think this is a very good idea for an abstract. The focus on the petals and the blown spots, particularly in the lower left center (in the green) are both unfortunate in my opinion. I like the way the fan of petals takes up the entire frame. Beautiful symmetry portrayed here.</td>', 'I think this is a very good idea for an abstract. The focus on the petals and the blown spots, particularly in the lower left center (in the green) are both unfortunate in my opinion. I like the way the fan of petals takes up the entire frame. Beautiful symmetry portrayed here.', '2006-09-03 02:47:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2790875, 389026, 19708, '<td valign="top">What an amazing view and such a clear day to capture it.<br/>My eyes are having a lot of trouble with the color of the sky and the color of the water being so very different.<br/>I bet this would look absolutely stunning in black &amp; white!</td>', 'What an amazing view and such a clear day to capture it.My eyes are having a lot of trouble with the color of the sky and the color of the water being so very different.I bet this would look absolutely stunning in black & white!', '2006-09-03 02:48:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2790877, 388905, 19708, '<td valign="top">Most unusual effect using IR.<br/>Some shots work in InfraRed, some don''t. This is a case where it does work well, and the composition is really made with the girl in it. Well done.</td>', 'Most unusual effect using IR.Some shots work in InfraRed, some don''t. This is a case where it does work well, and the composition is really made with the girl in it. Well done.', '2006-09-03 02:50:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2790882, 375112, 19708, '<td valign="top">Not something I have seen before really, at least not on this site.<br/>I think I spent more time trying to find the title in the writing than I did actually looking at the picture. Not sure if that''s a good thing or not.<br/>My eyes are getting too old....</td>', 'Not something I have seen before really, at least not on this site.I think I spent more time trying to find the title in the writing than I did actually looking at the picture. Not sure if that''s a good thing or not.My eyes are getting too old....', '2006-09-03 02:55:13.000000', NULL, 1),
