(2790887, 388645, 19708, '<td valign="top">With a bit more post-processing, this could really pop.<br/>There is still some decent blue in the and a with touch of white balance adjustment to reduce some of the yellow/red cast, this would really stand out.</td>', 'With a bit more post-processing, this could really pop.There is still some decent blue in the and a with touch of white balance adjustment to reduce some of the yellow/red cast, this would really stand out.', '2006-09-03 02:58:52.000000', NULL, 1),
