(2790896, 382637, 19708, '<td valign="top">Very clear shot and overall nice tones &amp; levels.<br/>Timing of the shot is great as is the expression caught on the boy to the right.<br/>I think perhaps a little tighter crop would have helped the overall rpesentation, removing about 100 pixels from the right and 40 off the top. That would eliminate the unbalance caused by the white rectangle in the top right corner. <i>(has a way of drawing the eye''s attention to it)</i></td>', 'Very clear shot and overall nice tones & levels.Timing of the shot is great as is the expression caught on the boy to the right.I think perhaps a little tighter crop would have helped the overall rpesentation, removing about 100 pixels from the right and 40 off the top. That would eliminate the unbalance caused by the white rectangle in the top right corner. (has a way of drawing the eye''s attention to it)', '2006-09-03 03:10:08.000000', NULL, 1),
