(2790919, 388659, 19708, '<td valign="top">I like the point of view on this and the desturated background to bring the focal point in front.<br/>Not sure I understand the title, but I don''t need to in order to say well done!</td>', 'I like the point of view on this and the desturated background to bring the focal point in front.Not sure I understand the title, but I don''t need to in order to say well done!', '2006-09-03 03:25:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2790924, 388374, 19708, '<td valign="top">I kinda'' like the tilting of the buildings from the wide-angle lens, yet you maintained nearly a horizontal horizon.<br/>Great color and definition. Well done!</td>', 'I kinda'' like the tilting of the buildings from the wide-angle lens, yet you maintained nearly a horizontal horizon.Great color and definition. Well done!', '2006-09-03 03:28:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2790926, 375269, 19708, '<td valign="top">Very Zen-like.<br/>Had all the background been black, the depth would have been missing and would have looked like a regular studio"ish" photograph. Nicley done.</td>', 'Very Zen-like.Had all the background been black, the depth would have been missing and would have looked like a regular studio"ish" photograph. Nicley done.', '2006-09-03 03:30:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2790930, 388687, 19708, '<td valign="top">Way to go on not over-saturating this, as is generally the case in landscape shots I see like this. Well done.</td>', 'Way to go on not over-saturating this, as is generally the case in landscape shots I see like this. Well done.', '2006-09-03 03:31:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2790933, 388943, 31133, '<td valign="top">Sexy! Really nice pose and everything ;-) I even like that her elbow is slightly out of the frame.</td>', 'Sexy! Really nice pose and everything ;-) I even like that her elbow is slightly out of the frame.', '2006-09-03 03:33:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2790938, 387873, 31133, '<td valign="top">The water at top is wonderful - good detail, color, and the added benefit of being interesting to look at. The lower part lets you down however, in my opinion - please realize that I''m a total amatuer. I think the girl''s head is where the eye is drawn to, not to the water. And unfortunately, it looks like the image quality is suffering a bit there. It seems out of focus or something. The area to the right of her head is also distracting, as it is difficult to identify and looks sort of blobby. But the idea is fantastic as is the water at the top.</td>', 'The water at top is wonderful - good detail, color, and the added benefit of being interesting to look at. The lower part lets you down however, in my opinion - please realize that I''m a total amatuer. I think the girl''s head is where the eye is drawn to, not to the water. And unfortunately, it looks like the image quality is suffering a bit there. It seems out of focus or something. The area to the right of her head is also distracting, as it is difficult to identify and looks sort of blobby. But the idea is fantastic as is the water at the top.', '2006-09-03 03:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2790951, 387362, 58055, '<td valign="top">Great shot, i''m not a fan of showy borders and this image didn''t anything at all should have been a plain white or black border or left alone</td>', 'Great shot, i''m not a fan of showy borders and this image didn''t anything at all should have been a plain white or black border or left alone', '2006-09-03 04:01:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2790955, 388429, 19708, '<td valign="top">A difficult lighting situation well done.<br/>Either there is too much motion or not enough on the lower half and seems a bit odd with her hands and head sharp, and below the neck just a little blurry or out of focus.<br/>Oh well, whatcha'' gonna do in low light. Still a well-presented image regardless.</td>', 'A difficult lighting situation well done.Either there is too much motion or not enough on the lower half and seems a bit odd with her hands and head sharp, and below the neck just a little blurry or out of focus.Oh well, whatcha'' gonna do in low light. Still a well-presented image regardless.', '2006-09-03 04:08:28.000000', NULL, 1),
