(2791130, 381288, 44611, '<td valign="top">Lovely muted colours in this shot and an incredible up close image of the pollen.  Wish it were a bit sharper though.</td>', 'Lovely muted colours in this shot and an incredible up close image of the pollen.  Wish it were a bit sharper though.', '2006-09-03 07:57:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2791131, 388938, 31133, '<td valign="top">Hey, this is my cat''s twin! Really. Very good expression on his face and nice job overall. I like the detail above his eyes and around his nose.</td>', 'Hey, this is my cat''s twin! Really. Very good expression on his face and nice job overall. I like the detail above his eyes and around his nose.', '2006-09-03 07:58:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2791134, 385245, 44611, '<td valign="top">What a fun angle!  I love the sky but would like to see more detail in the shadows on the cow''s face.  This must have been difficult difficult exposure-wise.</td>', 'What a fun angle!  I love the sky but would like to see more detail in the shadows on the cow''s face.  This must have been difficult difficult exposure-wise.', '2006-09-03 08:00:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2791140, 387522, 44611, '<td valign="top">Had to laugh when I saw this as it is virtually idential to one of my ''nearly'' submissions for this challenge.  Good composition and colour.</td>', 'Had to laugh when I saw this as it is virtually idential to one of my ''nearly'' submissions for this challenge.  Good composition and colour.', '2006-09-03 08:02:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2791141, 383437, 39821, '<td valign="top">This belongs in National Geographic.</td>', 'This belongs in National Geographic.', '2006-09-03 08:02:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2791142, 379816, 44611, '<td valign="top">Good detail on the feather but I think either a bit more contrast or a completely plain background would have improved this.</td>', 'Good detail on the feather but I think either a bit more contrast or a completely plain background would have improved this.', '2006-09-03 08:03:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2791143, 387758, 44611, '<td valign="top">Love the title!  Great shot.</td>', 'Love the title!  Great shot.', '2006-09-03 08:04:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2791145, 388320, 44611, '<td valign="top">I really like the treatment you''ve applied to this.  I hope you give us details after voting is over.  It works particularly well here.</td>', 'I really like the treatment you''ve applied to this.  I hope you give us details after voting is over.  It works particularly well here.', '2006-09-03 08:05:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2791146, 388068, 44611, '<td valign="top">This has an essence of simplicity - almost zen.  I would rather the cliffs/hills on the left where not in the shot  (my eye keeps getting distracted by it), nor the branches on the right hand side but I guess that just wasn''t possible.</td>', 'This has an essence of simplicity - almost zen.  I would rather the cliffs/hills on the left where not in the shot  (my eye keeps getting distracted by it), nor the branches on the right hand side but I guess that just wasn''t possible.', '2006-09-03 08:07:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2791148, 384660, 44611, '<td valign="top">Great title!  Fun shot.</td>', 'Great title!  Fun shot.', '2006-09-03 08:07:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2791150, 381642, 31133, '<td valign="top">This seems like a really good idea and an interesting topic, but there''s a lot going on here, so it''s kind of hard to know what I should be looking at. The lines lead to a miner, but he kind of blends in with his surroundings, which becomes a bit confusing.</td>', 'This seems like a really good idea and an interesting topic, but there''s a lot going on here, so it''s kind of hard to know what I should be looking at. The lines lead to a miner, but he kind of blends in with his surroundings, which becomes a bit confusing.', '2006-09-03 08:09:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2791151, 389013, 40679, '<td valign="top">this could have been an entry in the Zen challenge... I like this a lot! beautiful pastel colors, repetition, simplicity. nice.</td>', 'this could have been an entry in the Zen challenge... I like this a lot! beautiful pastel colors, repetition, simplicity. nice.', '2006-09-03 08:09:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2791153, 388704, 44611, '<td valign="top">Gosh is it me or do those two look utterly miserable?  Great composition and idea but the expressions on their faces just do not compute with your title.</td>', 'Gosh is it me or do those two look utterly miserable?  Great composition and idea but the expressions on their faces just do not compute with your title.', '2006-09-03 08:10:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2791154, 383989, 39821, '<td valign="top">Hey!  Let''s see the whole car!</td>', 'Hey!  Let''s see the whole car!', '2006-09-03 08:11:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2791156, 388461, 44611, '<td valign="top">I actually quite like the treatment here, although this looks far more like digital art than photography.  Might have been improved if one could see a bit more of detail in the leaves though.</td>', 'I actually quite like the treatment here, although this looks far more like digital art than photography.  Might have been improved if one could see a bit more of detail in the leaves though.', '2006-09-03 08:12:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2791157, 386839, 44611, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lighting and detail.</td>', 'Beautiful lighting and detail.', '2006-09-03 08:13:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2791160, 388765, 31133, '<td valign="top">The way that beautiful fur fills the whole frame is striking. Issues for me are the pink spot at right and that the focus on his face seems a bit soft, but with oversharpened whiskers. My favorite part of this other than how his fur fills the frame is the color of his eyes. Really beautiful color overall (other than the pink color mentioned above). I love the way he''s looking directly at the camera!</td>', 'The way that beautiful fur fills the whole frame is striking. Issues for me are the pink spot at right and that the focus on his face seems a bit soft, but with oversharpened whiskers. My favorite part of this other than how his fur fills the frame is the color of his eyes. Really beautiful color overall (other than the pink color mentioned above). I love the way he''s looking directly at the camera!', '2006-09-03 08:14:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2791161, 381764, 57260, '<td valign="top">I don''t understand the title but it''s a lovely picture.</td>', 'I don''t understand the title but it''s a lovely picture.', '2006-09-03 08:14:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2791162, 384252, 44611, '<td valign="top">Oh, so cute!  Good composition and lovely natural colour.</td>', 'Oh, so cute!  Good composition and lovely natural colour.', '2006-09-03 08:15:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2791165, 387290, 44611, '<td valign="top">This would have been a great entry for the ''no subject'' challenge.  What an interesting and colourful collection of nothingness!  Well composed and good exposure.</td>', 'This would have been a great entry for the ''no subject'' challenge.  What an interesting and colourful collection of nothingness!  Well composed and good exposure.', '2006-09-03 08:19:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2791167, 379977, 44611, '<td valign="top">I think this could have been a stunning shot, but, I''m, it seems overprocessed to me.  Maybe that was the effect you were trying to achieve, but it just doesn''t appeal personally.</td>', 'I think this could have been a stunning shot, but, I''m, it seems overprocessed to me.  Maybe that was the effect you were trying to achieve, but it just doesn''t appeal personally.', '2006-09-03 08:21:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2791168, 388808, 44611, '<td valign="top">Fantastic reflections in the water, good colours and I like the way the front of the boat leads the eye towards the gap in the horizon.</td>', 'Fantastic reflections in the water, good colours and I like the way the front of the boat leads the eye towards the gap in the horizon.', '2006-09-03 08:22:46.000000', NULL, 1),
