(2791574, 385077, 29748, '<td valign="top">Nice concept, but there is a hot spot running through the bottom third of the screen, and it is very distracting.  The photo also seems too busy, with too many objects in the frame.</td>', 'Nice concept, but there is a hot spot running through the bottom third of the screen, and it is very distracting.  The photo also seems too busy, with too many objects in the frame.', '2006-09-03 11:32:02.000000', NULL, 1),
