(2791576, 387711, 29748, '<td valign="top">Beautiful portrait.</td>', 'Beautiful portrait.', '2006-09-03 11:32:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2791577, 385063, 56658, '<td valign="top">the selective desat is not really working for me here. the processing onthe man is interesting though. looks like you have a nice sky back there that has lost everything in the desat. I know the truck was most likely destarcting but I think I would ahve prefered it in color to get the trees and sky. one thing you could have done if the truck had too much color and was overtaking it is to select the truck and partially desat it maybe -30%. the truck would still maintain some color but it would be much more subtle and less destracting and if done well would not stand out at all.</td>', 'the selective desat is not really working for me here. the processing onthe man is interesting though. looks like you have a nice sky back there that has lost everything in the desat. I know the truck was most likely destarcting but I think I would ahve prefered it in color to get the trees and sky. one thing you could have done if the truck had too much color and was overtaking it is to select the truck and partially desat it maybe -30%. the truck would still maintain some color but it would be much more subtle and less destracting and if done well would not stand out at all.', '2006-09-03 11:32:33.000000', NULL, 1),
