(2791785, 388704, 15575, '<td valign="top">Wow, I think in a way, there are so many things wrong here - the couple are so sad, there is a physical split/distance between them and they both look super uncomfortable, the guy is very rigid too, almost like a scarecrow.  But as a piece of artwork, it''s great - I''ve been looking at this photo for a while now just trying to guess whats wrong and what the story is behind the shot.  In terms of technical details, not much to say, except maybe a polarizer would''ve given you a nice sky, I don''t know if that would fit the feel of the image.  I think that the slightly washed-out feel is probably better.  Good luck!</td>', 'Wow, I think in a way, there are so many things wrong here - the couple are so sad, there is a physical split/distance between them and they both look super uncomfortable, the guy is very rigid too, almost like a scarecrow.  But as a piece of artwork, it''s great - I''ve been looking at this photo for a while now just trying to guess whats wrong and what the story is behind the shot.  In terms of technical details, not much to say, except maybe a polarizer would''ve given you a nice sky, I don''t know if that would fit the feel of the image.  I think that the slightly washed-out feel is probably better.  Good luck!', '2006-09-03 12:54:20.000000', NULL, 1),
