(2791889, 386580, 64888, '<td valign="top">The exposure isn''t bad but this don''t work for quite a few reasons. People don''t fish for goldfish. If they did they would use bait. A fisherman wouldn''t put the splitshot so close to the hook.</td>', 'The exposure isn''t bad but this don''t work for quite a few reasons. People don''t fish for goldfish. If they did they would use bait. A fisherman wouldn''t put the splitshot so close to the hook.', '2006-09-03 13:25:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2791891, 386667, 64888, '<td valign="top">Looks like Venus has a sore neck. The head is out of proportion because you are to close for that lens</td>', 'Looks like Venus has a sore neck. The head is out of proportion because you are to close for that lens', '2006-09-03 13:26:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2791894, 388177, 56658, '<td valign="top">I like the processing for the most part. I might change a few things starting with the bottome left cornor but good job overall.</td>', 'I like the processing for the most part. I might change a few things starting with the bottome left cornor but good job overall.', '2006-09-03 13:27:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2791896, 388978, 56658, '<td valign="top">cool insect. I think I would have gone for a landscape crop and ahve less negative space.</td>', 'cool insect. I think I would have gone for a landscape crop and ahve less negative space.', '2006-09-03 13:28:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2791897, 387259, 56658, '<td valign="top">seems kinda noisy and not the sharpest focus.</td>', 'seems kinda noisy and not the sharpest focus.', '2006-09-03 13:29:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2791901, 382389, 56658, '<td valign="top">I like the colors and overall composition. could easily be a postcard or travel brocure. I ma sure everyone has commented on the title so i''ll skip it.</td>', 'I like the colors and overall composition. could easily be a postcard or travel brocure. I ma sure everyone has commented on the title so i''ll skip it.', '2006-09-03 13:31:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2791902, 387719, 64888, '<td valign="top">I think a crop with some off top to where the limd forks and some off right would be better.</td>', 'I think a crop with some off top to where the limd forks and some off right would be better.', '2006-09-03 13:31:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2791904, 389023, 15204, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely execution of a classic newborn shot.  You captured a great expression on the little one.  I love the tones of your b/w conversion.  I think this would have been better lit with the main light camera right.  Then, the light would not be coming from ''below'' the baby''s face, it would sweep across his face from the top down.  Your shadows would fall beneath the chin and below the nose where they should be, instead of above the nose and lip as they are here.</td>', 'This is a lovely execution of a classic newborn shot.  You captured a great expression on the little one.  I love the tones of your b/w conversion.  I think this would have been better lit with the main light camera right.  Then, the light would not be coming from ''below'' the baby''s face, it would sweep across his face from the top down.  Your shadows would fall beneath the chin and below the nose where they should be, instead of above the nose and lip as they are here.', '2006-09-03 13:32:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2791906, 374508, 64888, '<td valign="top">Please back off the sharpening before you put someone''s eye out!</td>', 'Please back off the sharpening before you put someone''s eye out!', '2006-09-03 13:33:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2791913, 374261, 64888, '<td valign="top">I really really hate this. Poor kid.</td>', 'I really really hate this. Poor kid.', '2006-09-03 13:34:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2791917, 388829, 30982, '<td valign="top">It appears as though you tried to dodge the shadows to bring out the detail but it''s very overdone.</td>', 'It appears as though you tried to dodge the shadows to bring out the detail but it''s very overdone.', '2006-09-03 13:35:50.000000', NULL, 1);
