(2791927, 385287, 30982, '<td valign="top">This looks like it have very good potential but is simply too dark to see what you''re after (I''ve checked on two monitors.)</td>', 'This looks like it have very good potential but is simply too dark to see what you''re after (I''ve checked on two monitors.)', '2006-09-03 13:37:45.000000', NULL, 1),
