(2791931, 387391, 56658, '<td valign="top">nice smile and a very good looking candid. great colors. seems to be a wierd outline to her though.</td>', 'nice smile and a very good looking candid. great colors. seems to be a wierd outline to her though.', '2006-09-03 13:39:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2791932, 384830, 56658, '<td valign="top">doesn''t seem very sharp to me.</td>', 'doesn''t seem very sharp to me.', '2006-09-03 13:40:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2791936, 384451, 56658, '<td valign="top">sorry the lighting and processing aren''t working for me here.</td>', 'sorry the lighting and processing aren''t working for me here.', '2006-09-03 13:41:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2791944, 376291, 56658, '<td valign="top">the foreground is nice. the top left seems a bit strange though</td>', 'the foreground is nice. the top left seems a bit strange though', '2006-09-03 13:43:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2791955, 385782, 56658, '<td valign="top">lighting seems a bit bright also I think i would have cropped out the thing at the bottom</td>', 'lighting seems a bit bright also I think i would have cropped out the thing at the bottom', '2006-09-03 13:46:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2791963, 388704, 15204, '<td valign="top">Very cool idea and well executed.  I love the textures of the wheat.  Your colors are great and you did a good job keeping detail ni the white dress.  I wish the horizon didn''t cut through their heads, especially with the three line back there.  Maybe a lower camera position would have worked better, putting more wheat in the foreground and having their head and shoulders above the horizon.</td>', 'Very cool idea and well executed.  I love the textures of the wheat.  Your colors are great and you did a good job keeping detail ni the white dress.  I wish the horizon didn''t cut through their heads, especially with the three line back there.  Maybe a lower camera position would have worked better, putting more wheat in the foreground and having their head and shoulders above the horizon.', '2006-09-03 13:48:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2791970, 388332, 56658, '<td valign="top">nice photo. the processing is pretty nice. I think I would have desaturated the entire thing about 10 but that is being nitpicky. good job.</td>', 'nice photo. the processing is pretty nice. I think I would have desaturated the entire thing about 10 but that is being nitpicky. good job.', '2006-09-03 13:48:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2791971, 373932, 57791, '<td valign="top">I love time exposures more then any other type...but I think ths one is a bit tight.</td>', 'I love time exposures more then any other type...but I think ths one is a bit tight.', '2006-09-03 13:49:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2791978, 387259, 15204, '<td valign="top">Sweet shot of an adorable little baby,  Nice job getting light in to his face.  I think the shoes are cute, but it makes the little feet look disproportionally big.  As a shot of your own little one, this is great.  If it were a professional shot, I would have the baby barefoot so we could see his cute little feet, and put the shoes on the shelp somewhere.  I would burn the hotshpot in the upper right corner of the frame</td>', 'Sweet shot of an adorable little baby,  Nice job getting light in to his face.  I think the shoes are cute, but it makes the little feet look disproportionally big.  As a shot of your own little one, this is great.  If it were a professional shot, I would have the baby barefoot so we could see his cute little feet, and put the shoes on the shelp somewhere.  I would burn the hotshpot in the upper right corner of the frame', '2006-09-03 13:51:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2791979, 375112, 56658, '<td valign="top">I would prefer the lighting to be even and to see mroe of the sky.</td>', 'I would prefer the lighting to be even and to see mroe of the sky.', '2006-09-03 13:51:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2791984, 379031, 56658, '<td valign="top">nice macro. you have done a good job with the DOF getting a pretty good bit of him in focus.</td>', 'nice macro. you have done a good job with the DOF getting a pretty good bit of him in focus.', '2006-09-03 13:53:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2791988, 388327, 56658, '<td valign="top">just too small to comment on</td>', 'just too small to comment on', '2006-09-03 13:55:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2791990, 388865, 42792, '<td valign="top">Nice textures but seems overly-sharpened.</td>', 'Nice textures but seems overly-sharpened.', '2006-09-03 13:57:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2791991, 385147, 56658, '<td valign="top">nice color. would have been better without the sun being behind that tree. good job overall.</td>', 'nice color. would have been better without the sun being behind that tree. good job overall.', '2006-09-03 13:58:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2791993, 385245, 55414, '<td valign="top">I love it.  The concept is great. Would have liked to be able to see the eyes (brighter highlights would have worked) but still a great shot.</td>', 'I love it.  The concept is great. Would have liked to be able to see the eyes (brighter highlights would have worked) but still a great shot.', '2006-09-03 13:59:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2791994, 387670, 56658, '<td valign="top">just seems jumbled to me. I am not a fan of the processing here either sorry. maybe if the flag was more flat.</td>', 'just seems jumbled to me. I am not a fan of the processing here either sorry. maybe if the flag was more flat.', '2006-09-03 13:59:31.000000', NULL, 1),
