(2792207, 385163, 42792, '<td valign="top">Excellent silhouette shot enhanced but gorgeous colour gradients.  Bumping up.  Coming back to this and bumping up again.  In fact, my first 10 and I''ve already voted 100%.  Good luck!</td>', 'Excellent silhouette shot enhanced but gorgeous colour gradients.  Bumping up.  Coming back to this and bumping up again.  In fact, my first 10 and I''ve already voted 100%.  Good luck!', '2006-09-03 14:55:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2792209, 385607, 64169, '<td valign="top">My first comment here on this forum after watching this site for several weeks. <br/>I really like this picture. It has a great sharpness and using wide angle on the kids makes it outstanding. The title suits the picture and the kids look nice and natural. White clothing is nice with the overal dark surrounding.<br/>My eye is still looking at the light point in the back of the bridge. But I also want to focus on the kids, it''s fun.<br/>B/w is also a great choice, I wouldn''t change a thing in this picture!.<br/> <br/>regards,<br/> <br/>Tom.</td>', 'My first comment here on this forum after watching this site for several weeks. I really like this picture. It has a great sharpness and using wide angle on the kids makes it outstanding. The title suits the picture and the kids look nice and natural. White clothing is nice with the overal dark surrounding.My eye is still looking at the light point in the back of the bridge. But I also want to focus on the kids, it''s fun.B/w is also a great choice, I wouldn''t change a thing in this picture!. regards, Tom.', '2006-09-03 14:56:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2792210, 388839, 52549, '<td valign="top">Very good. It looks like an old film photo. I like the placement of the child in the photo arrangement.</td>', 'Very good. It looks like an old film photo. I like the placement of the child in the photo arrangement.', '2006-09-03 14:56:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2792212, 385584, 64209, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately, too many distractions - the background and the thing at the bottom right hand corner - would have been better to just crop the right edge off.</td>', 'Unfortunately, too many distractions - the background and the thing at the bottom right hand corner - would have been better to just crop the right edge off.', '2006-09-03 14:58:03.000000', NULL, 1),
