(2792545, 382227, 19961, '<td valign="top">Whilst using movement blur in an image might give the image some dynamic impact, I don''t think it does in this case.  The movement is too small and the tilted view does not add to the scene. It is also rather noisy (in the sky), which draws attention. Perhaps it would have worked better without the rather distracting background?</td>', 'Whilst using movement blur in an image might give the image some dynamic impact, I don''t think it does in this case.  The movement is too small and the tilted view does not add to the scene. It is also rather noisy (in the sky), which draws attention. Perhaps it would have worked better without the rather distracting background?', '2006-09-03 17:30:44.000000', NULL, 1),
