(2792675, 384388, 16004, '<td valign="top">i like the derelict nature of the building a lot, and the post processing suits the ambience perfectly.  the burning around the edges is a bit obviously fake, but it fits with the style of the high contrast and bright colours.  composition is very nice; i like where the building is in relation to the surroundings muchly.  the choice of subject is really good too; the building is obviously kackered, and it has character and you feel there is narrative here.  the bushes in the background seem a bit grey / dudged compared to the rest of the setting.  love the green grass against the building and the grey skies.  nicely stylish - 9.</td>', 'i like the derelict nature of the building a lot, and the post processing suits the ambience perfectly.  the burning around the edges is a bit obviously fake, but it fits with the style of the high contrast and bright colours.  composition is very nice; i like where the building is in relation to the surroundings muchly.  the choice of subject is really good too; the building is obviously kackered, and it has character and you feel there is narrative here.  the bushes in the background seem a bit grey / dudged compared to the rest of the setting.  love the green grass against the building and the grey skies.  nicely stylish - 9.', '2006-09-03 18:22:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2792677, 379842, 42100, '<td valign="top">Good, fitting title to this.  I think you hit a very nice balance of saturation with this.  Very nice composition as well!</td>', 'Good, fitting title to this.  I think you hit a very nice balance of saturation with this.  Very nice composition as well!', '2006-09-03 18:23:18.000000', NULL, 1),
