(2793038, 385595, 19831, '<td valign="top">Wowsers! This is a very cool image. I really like it. The composition is awesome, excellant balance, and I just love the way you''ve used negative space here. It just really serves a purpose here, something that many shots fail to do. The space separates the subjects (man and leaves), yet also serves to join them together to complete the concept of the photo. His gaze is perfect. The processing is quite fitting and drives the idea home. Yes, very, very well done.</td>', 'Wowsers! This is a very cool image. I really like it. The composition is awesome, excellant balance, and I just love the way you''ve used negative space here. It just really serves a purpose here, something that many shots fail to do. The space separates the subjects (man and leaves), yet also serves to join them together to complete the concept of the photo. His gaze is perfect. The processing is quite fitting and drives the idea home. Yes, very, very well done.', '2006-09-03 20:36:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2793040, 383661, 56797, '<td valign="top">lightings a bit harsh. cute dog and great capture of the texture in his fur.</td>', 'lightings a bit harsh. cute dog and great capture of the texture in his fur.', '2006-09-03 20:36:54.000000', NULL, 1),
