(2793070, 388349, 19831, '<td valign="top">Aw man, not only a super cool auto, but presented in this photo in a totally cool manner. Just an awesome point of view you''ve used. Very ''abstracty'', in fact it took a moment for it to totally hit me what the photo was of (I find this very cool). Love the black background. A highly interesting photo, I really like it. One minor nitpick though, the reflections in the bumper :-) Looks like that could be a fairly easy clone job.</td>', 'Aw man, not only a super cool auto, but presented in this photo in a totally cool manner. Just an awesome point of view you''ve used. Very ''abstracty'', in fact it took a moment for it to totally hit me what the photo was of (I find this very cool). Love the black background. A highly interesting photo, I really like it. One minor nitpick though, the reflections in the bumper :-) Looks like that could be a fairly easy clone job.', '2006-09-03 20:44:54.000000', NULL, 1),
