(2793200, 388802, 40718, '<td valign="top">I would love to see the original of this.  What I''m suspecting is processing is most excellent. 8</td>', 'I would love to see the original of this.  What I''m suspecting is processing is most excellent. 8', '2006-09-03 21:12:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2793201, 384209, 15204, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lighting on your model.  It flatters her and brings out the curves (which suits your mood very nicely) and I love the shadow making a triangle with her legs.  Nice composition and tones throughout.  On my monitor (which is calibrated) you have lost detail in her hair and it has no seperation from the furniture.  I don''t like the hotspot on the wall in the upper corner.  It draws my attention away from the subject.  7 from me.</td>', 'Beautiful lighting on your model.  It flatters her and brings out the curves (which suits your mood very nicely) and I love the shadow making a triangle with her legs.  Nice composition and tones throughout.  On my monitor (which is calibrated) you have lost detail in her hair and it has no seperation from the furniture.  I don''t like the hotspot on the wall in the upper corner.  It draws my attention away from the subject.  7 from me.', '2006-09-03 21:12:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2793204, 388349, 15204, '<td valign="top">I love the way you lit this to show off the curves.  You nailed it.  Cool angle, too.</td>', 'I love the way you lit this to show off the curves.  You nailed it.  Cool angle, too.', '2006-09-03 21:12:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2793205, 388709, 15204, '<td valign="top">I love the grainy, contrasty b/w conversion you did here.  I like the negative space, too.  I am not sure about the tilt, though, but I can''t think of how I would have composed differently. I might have cropped off or burned the bright cloud at the very top of the frame.  7 from me.</td>', 'I love the grainy, contrasty b/w conversion you did here.  I like the negative space, too.  I am not sure about the tilt, though, but I can''t think of how I would have composed differently. I might have cropped off or burned the bright cloud at the very top of the frame.  7 from me.', '2006-09-03 21:13:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2793207, 386588, 1031, '<td valign="top">I wouldn''t park under that sagging building about halfway back! Is there ever a time when there''s no cars parked there?</td>', 'I wouldn''t park under that sagging building about halfway back! Is there ever a time when there''s no cars parked there?', '2006-09-03 21:13:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2793208, 384451, 46177, '<td valign="top">Love the colours and textures here, in this case the red frame is a perfect compliment, not to mention a daring choice, I think it works for you. 9</td>', 'Love the colours and textures here, in this case the red frame is a perfect compliment, not to mention a daring choice, I think it works for you. 9', '2006-09-03 21:13:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2793209, 385245, 15204, '<td valign="top">I really like the perspective in this shot.  The shadows seem a little blocked on my monitor, but not too badly and there is some detail there, so I didn''t take off for it.  Monitors differ.  I wish there were a bit more catchlight in the eye to bring them to life, and make the dark eyes easier to pick out from the black cow face.  Very cool and quirky shot.  7 from me.</td>', 'I really like the perspective in this shot.  The shadows seem a little blocked on my monitor, but not too badly and there is some detail there, so I didn''t take off for it.  Monitors differ.  I wish there were a bit more catchlight in the eye to bring them to life, and make the dark eyes easier to pick out from the black cow face.  Very cool and quirky shot.  7 from me.', '2006-09-03 21:13:45.000000', NULL, 1),
