(2793430, 385607, 43774, '<td valign="top">What cuties! Love that you chose B&amp;W for this, it really works. Also like the angle you took it from.</td>', 'What cuties! Love that you chose B&W for this, it really works. Also like the angle you took it from.', '2006-09-03 22:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
