(2793434, 388693, 34938, '<td valign="top">this image is stunning...there are so many complementary colours and textures and there are interesting things all over the image...the composition is superb....you are up against some stiff competition in this challenge, so good luck and I hope this does well</td>', 'this image is stunning...there are so many complementary colours and textures and there are interesting things all over the image...the composition is superb....you are up against some stiff competition in this challenge, so good luck and I hope this does well', '2006-09-03 22:27:11.000000', NULL, 1),
