(2793443, 387897, 43774, '<td valign="top">Very pretty colours, that wasp/bee flying in is a nice surprise. The out of focus bud in front is a bit distracting.</td>', 'Very pretty colours, that wasp/bee flying in is a nice surprise. The out of focus bud in front is a bit distracting.', '2006-09-03 22:30:39.000000', NULL, 1),
