(2793458, 388541, 10867, '<td valign="top">The little foal is adorable, but the focus on the head seems to be just the tinest bit off.</td>', 'The little foal is adorable, but the focus on the head seems to be just the tinest bit off.', '2006-09-03 22:35:29.000000', NULL, 1),
