(2793541, 388670, 25787, '<td valign="top">I like the frame.  Could be a postcard.</td>', 'I like the frame.  Could be a postcard.', '2006-09-03 23:16:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2793542, 388872, 25787, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.</td>', 'Nice composition.', '2006-09-03 23:16:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2793543, 387435, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice silhouettes but kind of plain.  Maybe including a bit more of the ground level to show scale would add interest.</td>', 'Nice silhouettes but kind of plain.  Maybe including a bit more of the ground level to show scale would add interest.', '2006-09-03 23:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2793544, 385245, 25787, '<td valign="top">She looks a little angry at you.  Nice shot.</td>', 'She looks a little angry at you.  Nice shot.', '2006-09-03 23:17:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2793546, 387470, 30982, '<td valign="top">Good sunset pic with nice clouds.  Foreground gets kinda lost - not sure if a very muted fill flash (I have no idea how to do such a thing) would help bring out the grasses just a little to add interest.</td>', 'Good sunset pic with nice clouds.  Foreground gets kinda lost - not sure if a very muted fill flash (I have no idea how to do such a thing) would help bring out the grasses just a little to add interest.', '2006-09-03 23:18:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2793547, 386386, 25787, '<td valign="top">Nice colors.  Good night work.  A little something in the middle of the frame would make it more interesting.</td>', 'Nice colors.  Good night work.  A little something in the middle of the frame would make it more interesting.', '2006-09-03 23:18:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2793548, 388491, 25787, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot.  Good composition.</td>', 'Interesting shot.  Good composition.', '2006-09-03 23:18:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2793549, 386645, 30982, '<td valign="top">A good study in lines and angles with a gorgeous sky as a backdrop.  Don''t think the interest factor is high enough for a free study at DPC, though.</td>', 'A good study in lines and angles with a gorgeous sky as a backdrop.  Don''t think the interest factor is high enough for a free study at DPC, though.', '2006-09-03 23:19:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2793551, 385096, 25787, '<td valign="top">That is special.</td>', 'That is special.', '2006-09-03 23:19:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2793552, 388938, 25787, '<td valign="top">Looks kinda smudgey.  (is that a word?)</td>', 'Looks kinda smudgey.  (is that a word?)', '2006-09-03 23:19:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2793553, 376126, 30982, '<td valign="top">A bit plain despite the dramatic sky.  Perhaps a closer crop?</td>', 'A bit plain despite the dramatic sky.  Perhaps a closer crop?', '2006-09-03 23:20:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2793557, 386384, 25787, '<td valign="top">Good timing.</td>', 'Good timing.', '2006-09-03 23:20:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2793558, 374621, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of an elusive critter.  Seems to have a bit of a bluish green cast to it - try taking into Photoshop (or equivalent) and do auto color.  Really brings out the butterfly''s colors and tones down the blue/green cast.</td>', 'Nice capture of an elusive critter.  Seems to have a bit of a bluish green cast to it - try taking into Photoshop (or equivalent) and do auto color.  Really brings out the butterfly''s colors and tones down the blue/green cast.', '2006-09-03 23:20:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2793559, 377149, 25787, '<td valign="top">Cool clowd.</td>', 'Cool clowd.', '2006-09-03 23:20:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2793562, 375100, 30982, '<td valign="top">The eyes are lovely, but I''m not fond of her expression - would rather see a smile.  (Then again, this probably works well as an expression for the opposite gender, I''m guessing.)</td>', 'The eyes are lovely, but I''m not fond of her expression - would rather see a smile.  (Then again, this probably works well as an expression for the opposite gender, I''m guessing.)', '2006-09-03 23:21:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2793563, 388633, 25787, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  Might have softened the skin...especially the lips.</td>', 'Nice shot.  Might have softened the skin...especially the lips.', '2006-09-03 23:22:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2793564, 387108, 60614, '<td valign="top">Great photo except for the dark shadows.  I would have liked to see them a bit lighter.  The darkness seems to take away from the chairs.</td>', 'Great photo except for the dark shadows.  I would have liked to see them a bit lighter.  The darkness seems to take away from the chairs.', '2006-09-03 23:22:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2793565, 388668, 25787, '<td valign="top">Great character study.  Nice background.</td>', 'Great character study.  Nice background.', '2006-09-03 23:22:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2793568, 388742, 30982, '<td valign="top">A quirky, fun shot.  Love the colors - how did she find an outfit to match the lanes?  Love the shoes, too.  I''d tell you to straighten it a bit, but I''m thinking that the slight angle actually works for this one.</td>', 'A quirky, fun shot.  Love the colors - how did she find an outfit to match the lanes?  Love the shoes, too.  I''d tell you to straighten it a bit, but I''m thinking that the slight angle actually works for this one.', '2006-09-03 23:23:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2793572, 384398, 25787, '<td valign="top">Good clarity of shot.  Not crazy about the composition, esp the pole in the middle.</td>', 'Good clarity of shot.  Not crazy about the composition, esp the pole in the middle.', '2006-09-03 23:24:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2793574, 388169, 25787, '<td valign="top">Beautiful golden field</td>', 'Beautiful golden field', '2006-09-03 23:24:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2793575, 388806, 60614, '<td valign="top">I am not a fan of spiders but I will say that this is a nice photo.  I love the gold and green background.</td>', 'I am not a fan of spiders but I will say that this is a nice photo.  I love the gold and green background.', '2006-09-03 23:24:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2793576, 388259, 25787, '<td valign="top">What a cutey.</td>', 'What a cutey.', '2006-09-03 23:25:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2793577, 385452, 60614, '<td valign="top">Great closeup and colors.</td>', 'Great closeup and colors.', '2006-09-03 23:25:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2793578, 386750, 25787, '<td valign="top">Awesome, I''ll second that.</td>', 'Awesome, I''ll second that.', '2006-09-03 23:25:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2793579, 388812, 34194, '<td valign="top">not liking how the top is cropped off.</td>', 'not liking how the top is cropped off.', '2006-09-03 23:25:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2793580, 383640, 30982, '<td valign="top">A nice simple still life; good color and texture on the grapes and the strawberry leaves.  The melon in front kinda distracts me a bit - a little more DOF to make it a bit less fuzzy, maybe?  Levels or a bit of color work to take some pink out of the background would make the colors a bit stronger.</td>', 'A nice simple still life; good color and texture on the grapes and the strawberry leaves.  The melon in front kinda distracts me a bit - a little more DOF to make it a bit less fuzzy, maybe?  Levels or a bit of color work to take some pink out of the background would make the colors a bit stronger.', '2006-09-03 23:26:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2793581, 380694, 30982, '<td valign="top">B&amp;W is a nice choice for this.  If it were me, I''d rotate just a hair to have the doorway straight.</td>', 'B&W is a nice choice for this.  If it were me, I''d rotate just a hair to have the doorway straight.', '2006-09-03 23:26:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2793582, 386508, 60614, '<td valign="top">Great perspective</td>', 'Great perspective', '2006-09-03 23:26:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2793583, 386011, 25787, '<td valign="top">The fog adds a lot to the photo.</td>', 'The fog adds a lot to the photo.', '2006-09-03 23:26:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2793586, 388967, 25787, '<td valign="top">Some nice textures.</td>', 'Some nice textures.', '2006-09-03 23:27:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2793588, 377450, 60614, '<td valign="top">This is a really nice photo.  I like how the trees and shadows frame the rest of the park.  Makes you want to go lay down in the grass.</td>', 'This is a really nice photo.  I like how the trees and shadows frame the rest of the park.  Makes you want to go lay down in the grass.', '2006-09-03 23:28:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2793589, 383291, 25787, '<td valign="top">Wow...how erie.  I like the mood.</td>', 'Wow...how erie.  I like the mood.', '2006-09-03 23:28:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2793594, 388863, 34194, '<td valign="top">well done. could have been a period shot if not for the helmets.</td>', 'well done. could have been a period shot if not for the helmets.', '2006-09-03 23:29:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2793596, 386317, 60614, '<td valign="top">Great macro.  Love the droplets and how everything is so crisp.</td>', 'Great macro.  Love the droplets and how everything is so crisp.', '2006-09-03 23:29:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2793597, 377518, 30982, '<td valign="top">This is very well done, but I fear it may be a bit too much "digital art" for DPC voters.  All in all, though it''s a nice photograph from which to start and a nice job of processing along the artistic lines.  I really like the reflection of the building that shows up in places.</td>', 'This is very well done, but I fear it may be a bit too much "digital art" for DPC voters.  All in all, though it''s a nice photograph from which to start and a nice job of processing along the artistic lines.  I really like the reflection of the building that shows up in places.', '2006-09-03 23:29:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2793598, 388751, 15032, '<td valign="top">This photo would be better if it were taken from directly straight on, not at an angle.  The top is level, but the bottom is not.  I may have skewed it in PS to make it less distracting</td>', 'This photo would be better if it were taken from directly straight on, not at an angle.  The top is level, but the bottom is not.  I may have skewed it in PS to make it less distracting', '2006-09-03 23:29:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2793600, 374508, 25787, '<td valign="top">Looks like the lighting is kinda flat?  Would like to see the shells stand out from the background a little more.</td>', 'Looks like the lighting is kinda flat?  Would like to see the shells stand out from the background a little more.', '2006-09-03 23:29:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2793602, 387633, 60614, '<td valign="top">Great composition and reflection.</td>', 'Great composition and reflection.', '2006-09-03 23:30:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2793603, 388017, 25787, '<td valign="top">Trees are a little distracting.  Otherwise, pretty good shot.</td>', 'Trees are a little distracting.  Otherwise, pretty good shot.', '2006-09-03 23:30:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2793604, 379842, 15032, '<td valign="top">Very nice colors and exposure.  Great job!</td>', 'Very nice colors and exposure.  Great job!', '2006-09-03 23:31:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2793605, 375476, 60614, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice candid shot.  The colors go well together.</td>', 'This is a very nice candid shot.  The colors go well together.', '2006-09-03 23:31:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2793607, 385119, 30982, '<td valign="top">This seems to be very gray and I can''t quite figure out why.  Not sure if it was underexposed of if you applied a gradient of some kind.  If you get a chance to shoot this again - and it''s a neat subject for a picture - try shooting from a lower angle, to take the viewer more up the path.</td>', 'This seems to be very gray and I can''t quite figure out why.  Not sure if it was underexposed of if you applied a gradient of some kind.  If you get a chance to shoot this again - and it''s a neat subject for a picture - try shooting from a lower angle, to take the viewer more up the path.', '2006-09-03 23:31:40.000000', NULL, 1),
