(2793715, 388169, 30982, '<td valign="top">I really like the angle you chose.  Seems a bit soft - I played with a bit in Photoshop and some sharpening really brings out the wheat and the tree.  You may also want to try putting the horizon dead center - right now it''s not quite center and not quite on a third.  A touch of saturation will help bring out the tree and the richness of the wheat too.</td>', 'I really like the angle you chose.  Seems a bit soft - I played with a bit in Photoshop and some sharpening really brings out the wheat and the tree.  You may also want to try putting the horizon dead center - right now it''s not quite center and not quite on a third.  A touch of saturation will help bring out the tree and the richness of the wheat too.', '2006-09-03 23:59:01.000000', NULL, 1),
