(2796280, 388678, 16004, '<td valign="top">noble and majestic creatures.  spiritual some say.  i always thought they were slightly mad in the head and suspected they were plotting things, and by thunder, you''ve captured the evidence completely.  it''s a hilarious image, superbly captured.  i like the crop, composition, the nothing but skies background, and the lack of any post processed stylistic flourishes or pretentions is refreshing.  a stonking image, and very entertaining.  9.</td>', 'noble and majestic creatures.  spiritual some say.  i always thought they were slightly mad in the head and suspected they were plotting things, and by thunder, you''ve captured the evidence completely.  it''s a hilarious image, superbly captured.  i like the crop, composition, the nothing but skies background, and the lack of any post processed stylistic flourishes or pretentions is refreshing.  a stonking image, and very entertaining.  9.', '2006-09-04 12:57:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2796289, 388839, 2764, '<td valign="top">Hmm - There are parts of this that are just wonderful!  The grain, of course.  The 50s feel, the boy, the hand shadow, the house, the sun, his shirt with the piping.  THE LINES, straight and receding on the house, diagonal shadows, angles pose of the boy.  Here''s what I don''t like:  I have a "what is it? mind.  Things I can''t identify are distractions for me.  What has he got in his other hand?  I''d be happier if you cropped it.  What are the odd things hanging on the house?</td>', 'Hmm - There are parts of this that are just wonderful!  The grain, of course.  The 50s feel, the boy, the hand shadow, the house, the sun, his shirt with the piping.  THE LINES, straight and receding on the house, diagonal shadows, angles pose of the boy.  Here''s what I don''t like:  I have a "what is it? mind.  Things I can''t identify are distractions for me.  What has he got in his other hand?  I''d be happier if you cropped it.  What are the odd things hanging on the house?', '2006-09-04 13:00:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2796295, 386903, 34194, '<td valign="top">PP to look like an oil painting, I love the image and PP work</td>', 'PP to look like an oil painting, I love the image and PP work', '2006-09-04 13:02:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2796316, 379416, 16004, '<td valign="top">nice sash!  <br/> <br/>sorry, couldn''t resist...  this is a great sensual highly charged image.  i love the voyeuristic element of this, which somehow lessens the degree of gratuitousness is might have otherwise had.  the sepia, level of noise and grain, and the lighting is also very nice and done to great effect.  clearly, she''s fit, which heightens the appeal of the image, but one thinks that with the artistic style and technical skill, the same would have been achieved if it were Jack Black.  possibly.  very lovely - 10.</td>', 'nice sash!   sorry, couldn''t resist...  this is a great sensual highly charged image.  i love the voyeuristic element of this, which somehow lessens the degree of gratuitousness is might have otherwise had.  the sepia, level of noise and grain, and the lighting is also very nice and done to great effect.  clearly, she''s fit, which heightens the appeal of the image, but one thinks that with the artistic style and technical skill, the same would have been achieved if it were Jack Black.  possibly.  very lovely - 10.', '2006-09-04 13:10:16.000000', NULL, 1),
