(2796356, 379442, 16004, '<td valign="top">i like the border; makes it very cinematic and adds an epic grandeur.  for me, i can''t quite decide about the sky.  it looks almost sci-fi and martian, and yet this is obviously not the case with the villa / farm. the colour of the sky is effective, but it is sending mixed messages.  however, i feel it''s a very environmental composition though, and it seems like an inviting place to be.  the picture got me thinking, and really, that''s what visual art is meant to do. 7.</td>', 'i like the border; makes it very cinematic and adds an epic grandeur.  for me, i can''t quite decide about the sky.  it looks almost sci-fi and martian, and yet this is obviously not the case with the villa / farm. the colour of the sky is effective, but it is sending mixed messages.  however, i feel it''s a very environmental composition though, and it seems like an inviting place to be.  the picture got me thinking, and really, that''s what visual art is meant to do. 7.', '2006-09-04 13:22:15.000000', NULL, 1),
