(2798078, 384698, 2553, '<td valign="top">A sweet photograph, really, but I would rather have seen something softer, such as a light colored soft scarf wrapped around the "waist", than the pants/jeans.  The photo has the potential to be quite lovely with just a little added touch to make it even more high-key.</td>', 'A sweet photograph, really, but I would rather have seen something softer, such as a light colored soft scarf wrapped around the "waist", than the pants/jeans.  The photo has the potential to be quite lovely with just a little added touch to make it even more high-key.', '2006-09-04 21:28:21.000000', NULL, 1),
