(2798251, 387835, 62642, '<td valign="top">I love everything about this picture...the details are perfect, and the only thing out of focus is the paw swatting at the stick.  Not sure why people dislike cat pictures.  Of course, we all have our preferences I guess.  Whether or not I am drawn to cat pictures, though, I can tell this is super.</td>', 'I love everything about this picture...the details are perfect, and the only thing out of focus is the paw swatting at the stick.  Not sure why people dislike cat pictures.  Of course, we all have our preferences I guess.  Whether or not I am drawn to cat pictures, though, I can tell this is super.', '2006-09-04 22:15:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2798258, 388977, 62642, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!</td>', 'Beautiful!', '2006-09-04 22:17:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2798265, 388034, 43463, '<td valign="top">Elengance simply stated, simply presented. Love how the light plays around the curve of the drum and illuminates it just enough to give us the identity of this musical instrument. The light carresses the subject perfectly. You present us with just a portion of this drum and that adds visual interest because the shape, the curve of the drum, is heighted. The negative space to the right might make some say it should be cropped out, but I say it serves a wonderful purpose. It serves as the perfect, simple backdrop for the presentation in that the drum slips out from the darkness and "pops" visually off the page. The B&amp;W was an excellent choice for the photo as that colors would have ''complicated'' and made the composition ''busy''.</td>', 'Elengance simply stated, simply presented. Love how the light plays around the curve of the drum and illuminates it just enough to give us the identity of this musical instrument. The light carresses the subject perfectly. You present us with just a portion of this drum and that adds visual interest because the shape, the curve of the drum, is heighted. The negative space to the right might make some say it should be cropped out, but I say it serves a wonderful purpose. It serves as the perfect, simple backdrop for the presentation in that the drum slips out from the darkness and "pops" visually off the page. The B&W was an excellent choice for the photo as that colors would have ''complicated'' and made the composition ''busy''.', '2006-09-04 22:20:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2798269, 387087, 62642, '<td valign="top">Very nice...it helped me to use the full screen function on my computer (F1 in Firefox anyway) so I didn''t have to scroll up and down to see the image as a while.  Once I did that, I love the stepladdeer effect, and the almost mystical shadowy landscape.  Could possibly use a bit of detail in the middle, as it almost seems too blurry, but very nice composition overall.</td>', 'Very nice...it helped me to use the full screen function on my computer (F1 in Firefox anyway) so I didn''t have to scroll up and down to see the image as a while.  Once I did that, I love the stepladdeer effect, and the almost mystical shadowy landscape.  Could possibly use a bit of detail in the middle, as it almost seems too blurry, but very nice composition overall.', '2006-09-04 22:21:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2798272, 388017, 42826, '<td valign="top">Technical:  the contrast for the feeling you are trying to portray, the coloring is great!  the softness adds ALOT!<br/>Creativity:  I think it is very creative, you hardly EVER see images like this!  <br/>Personal Opinion:  I love it!  it reminds me of my aunt and uncles old play set!  touching!<br/>Score: 10...i would give you a 20 if i could!</td>', 'Technical:  the contrast for the feeling you are trying to portray, the coloring is great!  the softness adds ALOT!Creativity:  I think it is very creative, you hardly EVER see images like this!  Personal Opinion:  I love it!  it reminds me of my aunt and uncles old play set!  touching!Score: 10...i would give you a 20 if i could!', '2006-09-04 22:22:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2798273, 389030, 62642, '<td valign="top">Unusual and cool.</td>', 'Unusual and cool.', '2006-09-04 22:22:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2798278, 388522, 42826, '<td valign="top">Technical: the contrast, coloring, the composition...they are all right on!  <br/>Creativity:  very creative, i don''t think i have ever seen this type of image!<br/>Personal Opinion:  i like it...i am not really sure why...just do!<br/>Score: 10</td>', 'Technical: the contrast, coloring, the composition...they are all right on!  Creativity:  very creative, i don''t think i have ever seen this type of image!Personal Opinion:  i like it...i am not really sure why...just do!Score: 10', '2006-09-04 22:23:32.000000', NULL, 1),
