(2798544, 385077, 42826, '<td valign="top">Technical: the composition is good, the backlighting on the ears is great, what ever kind of lines those are on the left of the photo is kind of distracting, could be a little sharper!<br/>Creativity: creative in the sake that there is something else besides just the cat, some people might call it clutter...but i think it''s ok <br/>Personal Opinion:  great job on capturing the cat...i like it!<br/>Score: 5</td>', 'Technical: the composition is good, the backlighting on the ears is great, what ever kind of lines those are on the left of the photo is kind of distracting, could be a little sharper!Creativity: creative in the sake that there is something else besides just the cat, some people might call it clutter...but i think it''s ok Personal Opinion:  great job on capturing the cat...i like it!Score: 5', '2006-09-04 23:44:07.000000', NULL, 1),
