(2798643, 386671, 43463, '<td valign="top">Love the colors in this photo. The colors of the sky are beautiful and serene. The lighthouse in the distance adds visual interest - I have to say that I have never before seen a lighthouse with a green light! It makes the image unusual and interesting to look upon. I also like the abstract shapes and curves of the rocks and the water cradled in the valley between the rocks. It adds visual appeal. I also like how the foreground reflection of the lighthouse in the water plays so well with the title of the piece. Very lovely work.</td>', 'Love the colors in this photo. The colors of the sky are beautiful and serene. The lighthouse in the distance adds visual interest - I have to say that I have never before seen a lighthouse with a green light! It makes the image unusual and interesting to look upon. I also like the abstract shapes and curves of the rocks and the water cradled in the valley between the rocks. It adds visual appeal. I also like how the foreground reflection of the lighthouse in the water plays so well with the title of the piece. Very lovely work.', '2006-09-05 00:10:35.000000', NULL, 1),
