(2798800, 387478, 43463, '<td valign="top">Love how those bold and vibrant yellow and blue colors of the bird visually ''pop'' off from the dull colored surroundings. That is where the strength of this composition lies, that and the curve/sweep of the two leaves that seem to cradle this bird between them. I think the visual impact would be stronger if you did a tighter crop where just the bird and the sweep of the two leaves dominate the scene. Get closer to your subject because when you do, you give your viewer an up close &amp; personal view of something that they might not be able to get a closer look at in his/her part of the world.</td>', 'Love how those bold and vibrant yellow and blue colors of the bird visually ''pop'' off from the dull colored surroundings. That is where the strength of this composition lies, that and the curve/sweep of the two leaves that seem to cradle this bird between them. I think the visual impact would be stronger if you did a tighter crop where just the bird and the sweep of the two leaves dominate the scene. Get closer to your subject because when you do, you give your viewer an up close & personal view of something that they might not be able to get a closer look at in his/her part of the world.', '2006-09-05 01:02:36.000000', NULL, 1),
