(2798866, 385423, 50695, '<td valign="top">great macro. the angle immerses us into the grass. the photo becomes not so much about the dragonfly but about immersion. and good bokeh!</td>', 'great macro. the angle immerses us into the grass. the photo becomes not so much about the dragonfly but about immersion. and good bokeh!', '2006-09-05 01:18:11.000000', NULL, 1),
