(2798869, 386667, 50695, '<td valign="top">this is one of very few nudes that are visually interesting. You achieve that by perspective distortion (a wide-angle lens close-up?) and by raking light across the back, revealing the intricate web of muscles and bones across the back. In the process, you give away the game: models are too skinny! Also, the model''s head is not turned all the way back over the shoulder, with the usual "do me" look. Instead the model''s head is halfway turned, and she seems inquisitive and even annoyed, i.e., "What''s going on back there?" Notice that I am simultaneously explaining why I like the picture and why DPC is going to vote it low.</td>', 'this is one of very few nudes that are visually interesting. You achieve that by perspective distortion (a wide-angle lens close-up?) and by raking light across the back, revealing the intricate web of muscles and bones across the back. In the process, you give away the game: models are too skinny! Also, the model''s head is not turned all the way back over the shoulder, with the usual "do me" look. Instead the model''s head is halfway turned, and she seems inquisitive and even annoyed, i.e., "What''s going on back there?" Notice that I am simultaneously explaining why I like the picture and why DPC is going to vote it low.', '2006-09-05 01:18:56.000000', NULL, 1),
