(2799352, 384297, 19708, '<td valign="top">The sailboat really adds to this shot as does the green floating life in the foreground. Overall seems to be lacking sharpness and may be due to it be a small section of a much larger image?</td>', 'The sailboat really adds to this shot as does the green floating life in the foreground. Overall seems to be lacking sharpness and may be due to it be a small section of a much larger image?', '2006-09-05 04:03:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2799354, 386011, 19708, '<td valign="top">ALmost looks more like a painting than a photograph, which is a good thing by the way.</td>', 'ALmost looks more like a painting than a photograph, which is a good thing by the way.', '2006-09-05 04:04:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2799359, 388972, 19708, '<td valign="top">Overall a nice &amp; calm/peaceful image.<br/>The person near the reflection and the sun burst rays really add a nice touch.</td>', 'Overall a nice & calm/peaceful image.The person near the reflection and the sun burst rays really add a nice touch.', '2006-09-05 04:05:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2799362, 388788, 19708, '<td valign="top">I really like the colors and tones here.<br/>This does remind me of something I would expect to see on a post card.<br/>Not sure if it needs a little rotation or perspective adjustment though. hmmmm</td>', 'I really like the colors and tones here.This does remind me of something I would expect to see on a post card.Not sure if it needs a little rotation or perspective adjustment though. hmmmm', '2006-09-05 04:06:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2799365, 388699, 19708, '<td valign="top">Well seen and a most unusual composition.<br/>A few image compression artifacts showing, but in an image with this much detail, it happens. Well done!</td>', 'Well seen and a most unusual composition.A few image compression artifacts showing, but in an image with this much detail, it happens. Well done!', '2006-09-05 04:08:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2799366, 388094, 19708, '<td valign="top">Quite the view point on this almost 3D appearing image.<br/>I''d be on oxygen for sure up that high...</td>', 'Quite the view point on this almost 3D appearing image.I''d be on oxygen for sure up that high...', '2006-09-05 04:09:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2799370, 387738, 19708, '<td valign="top">Emotive and powerful image presented here.<br/>A bit too much texture/detail lost in his skin in my opinion, possibly a touch high on the neat image? but a fine image regardless - well done!</td>', 'Emotive and powerful image presented here.A bit too much texture/detail lost in his skin in my opinion, possibly a touch high on the neat image? but a fine image regardless - well done!', '2006-09-05 04:10:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2799372, 388539, 19708, '<td valign="top">Most unusual with the cloud reflection the way it is.<br/>So which one is the beauty? ;)</td>', 'Most unusual with the cloud reflection the way it is.So which one is the beauty? ;)', '2006-09-05 04:11:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2799374, 388808, 19708, '<td valign="top">I love the perspective and intense scale presented here.<br/>Still waters ahead, mirror imaging, what''s not to like about this.<br/>Adding to my favorites - well done!</td>', 'I love the perspective and intense scale presented here.Still waters ahead, mirror imaging, what''s not to like about this.Adding to my favorites - well done!', '2006-09-05 04:13:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2799376, 388627, 19708, '<td valign="top">My first impression here was of a shot taken under a canopy in flight, which is what I think you were attempting to replicate, though there really is no way to take a pic, that close, in flight. Nice imaging &amp; presentation on this.<br/>I''ll be looking to see how this was done after the challenge ends.</td>', 'My first impression here was of a shot taken under a canopy in flight, which is what I think you were attempting to replicate, though there really is no way to take a pic, that close, in flight. Nice imaging & presentation on this.I''ll be looking to see how this was done after the challenge ends.', '2006-09-05 04:15:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2799377, 386750, 19708, '<td valign="top">Yes, this is awesome.<br/>This is what really matters in life - memories to cherish for a lifetime.<br/>Well done!</td>', 'Yes, this is awesome.This is what really matters in life - memories to cherish for a lifetime.Well done!', '2006-09-05 04:17:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2799380, 389026, 46294, '<td valign="top">Great bkue lake! And the picture is beautifully sharp.</td>', 'Great bkue lake! And the picture is beautifully sharp.', '2006-09-05 04:18:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2799381, 387633, 19708, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done with excellent control over the depth of field and lighting.</td>', 'Very nicely done with excellent control over the depth of field and lighting.', '2006-09-05 04:18:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2799384, 388678, 46294, '<td valign="top">Lol! A horse rotflho, Really funny shot!</td>', 'Lol! A horse rotflho, Really funny shot!', '2006-09-05 04:19:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2799385, 388575, 46294, '<td valign="top">Funny I made something like this with a black umbrella, I would have like to se a bit more.</td>', 'Funny I made something like this with a black umbrella, I would have like to se a bit more.', '2006-09-05 04:21:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2799386, 378530, 19708, '<td valign="top">Timeless. Nice story being told here and love the post-processing.<br/>The tones and levels here work well overall - well done!</td>', 'Timeless. Nice story being told here and love the post-processing.The tones and levels here work well overall - well done!', '2006-09-05 04:22:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2799387, 388751, 46294, '<td valign="top">It''s a very nice picture, it would have been better if you stand straight for the window and had all the lines totaly straight.</td>', 'It''s a very nice picture, it would have been better if you stand straight for the window and had all the lines totaly straight.', '2006-09-05 04:23:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2799389, 387070, 46294, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture! The border is a bit to big imho.</td>', 'Beautiful picture! The border is a bit to big imho.', '2006-09-05 04:25:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2799394, 387175, 16004, '<td valign="top">this is nice; very reminiscent of lost in translation.  not sure about the b&amp;W though, and also the tops of the stepping stones / trunks appear a bit overblown.  personally, i think because of the film relation, the lack of a human element is more obvious than it would normally be, and consequently it feels as if something is missing...  the crop is also a bit biased to one side, and it feels a tad unbalanced.  likeable nonetheless.  7.</td>', 'this is nice; very reminiscent of lost in translation.  not sure about the b&W though, and also the tops of the stepping stones / trunks appear a bit overblown.  personally, i think because of the film relation, the lack of a human element is more obvious than it would normally be, and consequently it feels as if something is missing...  the crop is also a bit biased to one side, and it feels a tad unbalanced.  likeable nonetheless.  7.', '2006-09-05 04:29:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2799405, 381929, 6912, '<td valign="top">Russian? :P</td>', 'Russian? :P', '2006-09-05 04:39:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2799407, 384844, 6912, '<td valign="top">stunning</td>', 'stunning', '2006-09-05 04:41:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2799409, 387461, 16004, '<td valign="top">if i were standing where you were, i don''t think i would have seen any merit in photographing such a mess; i like derelict stuff as much as the next arty farty fellow, but here all i would have seen is something without shape, coherence, sense of meaning or history or anything.  but <i>you</i> obvoiusly saw something, and by jove, you were so right!  it''s wonderful, it really feels like the jetty was born into this environment.  the use of a wide angle and presenting in portrait works really well, and does indeed give the posts a sense of shape and scale.  and the more explorative viewer is rewarded with a stunning view and gorgeous sky, which compliments the jetty, rather than competes for attention with.  the colours, predominantly those bluey greys, are super.  9.</td>', 'if i were standing where you were, i don''t think i would have seen any merit in photographing such a mess; i like derelict stuff as much as the next arty farty fellow, but here all i would have seen is something without shape, coherence, sense of meaning or history or anything.  but you obvoiusly saw something, and by jove, you were so right!  it''s wonderful, it really feels like the jetty was born into this environment.  the use of a wide angle and presenting in portrait works really well, and does indeed give the posts a sense of shape and scale.  and the more explorative viewer is rewarded with a stunning view and gorgeous sky, which compliments the jetty, rather than competes for attention with.  the colours, predominantly those bluey greys, are super.  9.', '2006-09-05 04:43:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2799425, 379842, 46294, '<td valign="top">Nice colorboost!</td>', 'Nice colorboost!', '2006-09-05 04:55:37.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2799427, 378530, 60036, '<td valign="top">Great framing, subject is well positioned, the only drawback for me is the powerlines, otherwise the picture would have been timeless. Good job.</td>', 'Great framing, subject is well positioned, the only drawback for me is the powerlines, otherwise the picture would have been timeless. Good job.', '2006-09-05 04:59:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2799431, 389005, 16004, '<td valign="top">this clearly ticks some of the "nice photo" boxes; the reflection is crystal clear with little movement in the water, everything is nice and sharp, the building is quaintily cute and rustic.  technically, it feels a little over exposed (the sky is a bit white, and near elevation is bright) and it''s a pity that a small portion on the right of the building is outside the frame.  i would possibly not have had the line of symmetry so close to the centre of the picture; the rule of thirds works for this sort of thing too, and by cropping everything below, say, the top of the reflected bushes, might lead to a more fluid and natural-looking composition.  it also just occured to me how it might look rotated 180° and you cropped the non-reflection above the bushes - i only say this because the reflection is prettier and better exposed than the top half... <br/> <br/>the only other thing i find mildly disappointing is that, for a working building, it appears dead; there''s no sense it''s doing very much and you can''t actually <i>hear</i> it in your head...  it''s not conveying much water millness - like a portrait, you expect to see characteristics or traits of a person, you feel the same is due for a building.  anyway, nice, but not pants on fire nice.  6.</td>', 'this clearly ticks some of the "nice photo" boxes; the reflection is crystal clear with little movement in the water, everything is nice and sharp, the building is quaintily cute and rustic.  technically, it feels a little over exposed (the sky is a bit white, and near elevation is bright) and it''s a pity that a small portion on the right of the building is outside the frame.  i would possibly not have had the line of symmetry so close to the centre of the picture; the rule of thirds works for this sort of thing too, and by cropping everything below, say, the top of the reflected bushes, might lead to a more fluid and natural-looking composition.  it also just occured to me how it might look rotated 180° and you cropped the non-reflection above the bushes - i only say this because the reflection is prettier and better exposed than the top half...  the only other thing i find mildly disappointing is that, for a working building, it appears dead; there''s no sense it''s doing very much and you can''t actually hear it in your head...  it''s not conveying much water millness - like a portrait, you expect to see characteristics or traits of a person, you feel the same is due for a building.  anyway, nice, but not pants on fire nice.  6.', '2006-09-05 05:10:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2799432, 388794, 19708, '<td valign="top">Very calming and soothing image.<br/>Does remind me of Myst too - well seen!</td>', 'Very calming and soothing image.Does remind me of Myst too - well seen!', '2006-09-05 05:10:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2799433, 389012, 19708, '<td valign="top">Gotta'' love life and the precious moments we capture to remember for a lifetime. Well done and thanks for sharing.</td>', 'Gotta'' love life and the precious moments we capture to remember for a lifetime. Well done and thanks for sharing.', '2006-09-05 05:12:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2799435, 388895, 19708, '<td valign="top">Something we have all seen before, and yet most would not try to remember.<br/>Thank you for sharing and preserving a slice of the real life!</td>', 'Something we have all seen before, and yet most would not try to remember.Thank you for sharing and preserving a slice of the real life!', '2006-09-05 05:13:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2799436, 388755, 19708, '<td valign="top">Great perspective and what really makes this for me is where her eyes are looking. Well done!</td>', 'Great perspective and what really makes this for me is where her eyes are looking. Well done!', '2006-09-05 05:14:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2799437, 378155, 19708, '<td valign="top">Thank you for sharing and preserving a slice of real life.<br/>Many/most would not want to study this, nor capture it.<br/>Well done! (Needs a bit more texture though in my opinion)</td>', 'Thank you for sharing and preserving a slice of real life.Many/most would not want to study this, nor capture it.Well done! (Needs a bit more texture though in my opinion)', '2006-09-05 05:16:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2799440, 374508, 19708, '<td valign="top">Title made me study this, and yes, I did spot it - most unusual.<br/>Post-processing is a bit too harsh / sharpened in my opinion.</td>', 'Title made me study this, and yes, I did spot it - most unusual.Post-processing is a bit too harsh / sharpened in my opinion.', '2006-09-05 05:17:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2799457, 388884, 32848, '<td valign="top">It may have already been mentioned, but a different crop on this may have looked better. It is an unusual shot, however.</td>', 'It may have already been mentioned, but a different crop on this may have looked better. It is an unusual shot, however.', '2006-09-05 05:37:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2799459, 388733, 25355, '<td valign="top">That looks quite like a computer-generated landscape I once did in Terragen...</td>', 'That looks quite like a computer-generated landscape I once did in Terragen...', '2006-09-05 05:40:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2799460, 388702, 32848, '<td valign="top">nice exposure to bring out the detail here, not an easy job.</td>', 'nice exposure to bring out the detail here, not an easy job.', '2006-09-05 05:40:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2799461, 387259, 25355, '<td valign="top">But look out, there''s a monster behind you! ;&gt;þ</td>', 'But look out, there''s a monster behind you! ;>þ', '2006-09-05 05:42:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2799463, 380640, 25355, '<td valign="top">I thought you only got down from ducks. ;&gt;þ<br/> <br/>Joking aside, it''s a great shot. I guess it''s some kind of egret. The (white) ones around here are pretty camera-shy; you must have used quite a long lens, eh.</td>', 'I thought you only got down from ducks. ;>þ Joking aside, it''s a great shot. I guess it''s some kind of egret. The (white) ones around here are pretty camera-shy; you must have used quite a long lens, eh.', '2006-09-05 05:47:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2799464, 377866, 25355, '<td valign="top">A happy-looking child who has perambulator rage? ;&gt;þ<br/> <br/>I like the lighting - you''ve handled the shadows very well.</td>', 'A happy-looking child who has perambulator rage? ;>þ I like the lighting - you''ve handled the shadows very well.', '2006-09-05 05:50:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2799467, 388169, 25355, '<td valign="top">Another single tree!<br/> <br/>Something seems a little off in the focus - and it doesn''t look like it''s supposed to be soft focus...</td>', 'Another single tree! Something seems a little off in the focus - and it doesn''t look like it''s supposed to be soft focus...', '2006-09-05 05:51:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2799468, 388830, 6999, '<td valign="top">Strong detail and toning - and the orange makes a real difference from the usual green for this kind of shot. The less bokeh''d leaves in the background will proably be pointed out as a distraction by some - I''m unsure, but they certainly add a dynamic that works somewhat against the lines of the rest of the image.</td>', 'Strong detail and toning - and the orange makes a real difference from the usual green for this kind of shot. The less bokeh''d leaves in the background will proably be pointed out as a distraction by some - I''m unsure, but they certainly add a dynamic that works somewhat against the lines of the rest of the image.', '2006-09-05 05:52:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2799469, 376291, 25355, '<td valign="top">Terrific cloudscape - I''m not sure that you need the plants in the foreground...</td>', 'Terrific cloudscape - I''m not sure that you need the plants in the foreground...', '2006-09-05 05:53:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2799470, 382659, 6999, '<td valign="top">Good spirit, good moment. A little flattened by the flash perhaps, but its a nice portrait.</td>', 'Good spirit, good moment. A little flattened by the flash perhaps, but its a nice portrait.', '2006-09-05 05:53:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2799471, 388030, 25355, '<td valign="top">A little grainy, but a very nice portrait.<br/> <br/>Guanaco? Alpaca?</td>', 'A little grainy, but a very nice portrait. Guanaco? Alpaca?', '2006-09-05 05:54:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2799473, 388847, 6999, '<td valign="top">Fun - especially catching them airborne. The foreground ... ? Sure, it adds some depth, but perhaps it might have been darkened more to draw the eye a little less.</td>', 'Fun - especially catching them airborne. The foreground ... ? Sure, it adds some depth, but perhaps it might have been darkened more to draw the eye a little less.', '2006-09-05 05:55:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2799477, 388575, 6999, '<td valign="top">I enjoy this almost as much for its sheer contrast to the rest of these images as for itself. Can''t imagine I''ll come back to it much, but it breaks up the show nicely.</td>', 'I enjoy this almost as much for its sheer contrast to the rest of these images as for itself. Can''t imagine I''ll come back to it much, but it breaks up the show nicely.', '2006-09-05 05:57:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2799480, 386591, 22301, '<td valign="top">If I could vote this higher than a 10 I would. I don''t think I have ever added a favorite during a challenge, yours is the first. I just see no wrong, and have captured something simple and honest I can''t explain. superior image, good luck.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-09-08 00:37:24.</i></td>', 'If I could vote this higher than a 10 I would. I don''t think I have ever added a favorite during a challenge, yours is the first. I just see no wrong, and have captured something simple and honest I can''t explain. superior image, good luck.', '2006-09-05 05:58:02.000000', '2006-09-08 01:37:24.000000', 1),
(2799481, 379739, 6999, '<td valign="top">Excellent photo. Has a distortion of scale, and a bizareness of composition and organisation of subject that I really enjoy. Marvellous toning, too. Lovely work.</td>', 'Excellent photo. Has a distortion of scale, and a bizareness of composition and organisation of subject that I really enjoy. Marvellous toning, too. Lovely work.', '2006-09-05 05:58:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2799482, 387486, 32848, '<td valign="top">Lovely composition and lighting. I even like the frame in this case (I don''t like frames as a rule!)</td>', 'Lovely composition and lighting. I even like the frame in this case (I don''t like frames as a rule!)', '2006-09-05 05:59:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2799494, 385160, 22301, '<td valign="top">what a great scene, its as if the animals were listening to cues as to where to be in the photo. I think there is a slight too much of a blue tint to the photo and I may have dodged the face of the pig to bring out his face. but thats just what I would do.excellent 10.</td>', 'what a great scene, its as if the animals were listening to cues as to where to be in the photo. I think there is a slight too much of a blue tint to the photo and I may have dodged the face of the pig to bring out his face. but thats just what I would do.excellent 10.', '2006-09-05 06:11:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2799497, 388693, 22301, '<td valign="top">stellar color and composition, and I like the title to even pull your attention off the photo. I also like the lines of the chains lead the eye to the numbers. I wouldn''t change a thing. 10</td>', 'stellar color and composition, and I like the title to even pull your attention off the photo. I also like the lines of the chains lead the eye to the numbers. I wouldn''t change a thing. 10', '2006-09-05 06:13:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2799502, 388618, 22301, '<td valign="top">spectacular wedding shot, and has photojournalism quality to it. My one critique would be to fix the red eye in the bride''s eyes. still a wonderful catch. 10</td>', 'spectacular wedding shot, and has photojournalism quality to it. My one critique would be to fix the red eye in the bride''s eyes. still a wonderful catch. 10', '2006-09-05 06:15:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2799504, 388034, 22301, '<td valign="top">awesome low key color image, it was my first 10 in the challenge, good luck.</td>', 'awesome low key color image, it was my first 10 in the challenge, good luck.', '2006-09-05 06:16:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2799508, 381339, 22301, '<td valign="top">I love how bright the night is and the calmness of the water giving a perfect reflection. maybe too bright on some of the rocks on the right but it doesn''t bother me, just trying to thinkof something constructive to help you out. good luck 10.</td>', 'I love how bright the night is and the calmness of the water giving a perfect reflection. maybe too bright on some of the rocks on the right but it doesn''t bother me, just trying to thinkof something constructive to help you out. good luck 10.', '2006-09-05 06:18:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2799511, 383593, 22301, '<td valign="top">what great fireworks, I have no idea how you captured them like that but it looks like a painting.</td>', 'what great fireworks, I have no idea how you captured them like that but it looks like a painting.', '2006-09-05 06:19:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2799517, 388704, 22301, '<td valign="top">I love the awkwardness of this photo, from the stiff pose and straight faces and centered composition. I wouldn''t change a thing. 10</td>', 'I love the awkwardness of this photo, from the stiff pose and straight faces and centered composition. I wouldn''t change a thing. 10', '2006-09-05 06:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2799520, 387498, 22301, '<td valign="top">an amazing candid, priceless expression, I would have like to have seen it bigger at 720 pix and a smaller border, but the shot is too god to not get a ten from me.</td>', 'an amazing candid, priceless expression, I would have like to have seen it bigger at 720 pix and a smaller border, but the shot is too god to not get a ten from me.', '2006-09-05 06:23:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2799522, 382219, 31885, '<td valign="top">Wonderful contrasting textures!</td>', 'Wonderful contrasting textures!', '2006-09-05 06:24:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2799524, 374261, 22301, '<td valign="top">Poor baby!! lol, I love the natural desaturation and yet the photo feels very saturated and lush with color. good luck! 10</td>', 'Poor baby!! lol, I love the natural desaturation and yet the photo feels very saturated and lush with color. good luck! 10', '2006-09-05 06:25:05.000000', NULL, 1),
