(2799848, 376291, 31230, '<td valign="top">Nice landscape.  What great colors.</td>', 'Nice landscape.  What great colors.', '2006-09-05 09:22:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2799850, 385584, 31230, '<td valign="top">Beautiful feel.  It has more than a dancing feel.  Almost like peaking in.</td>', 'Beautiful feel.  It has more than a dancing feel.  Almost like peaking in.', '2006-09-05 09:23:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2799851, 380694, 31230, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.</td>', 'Nice shot.', '2006-09-05 09:23:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2799854, 383689, 27524, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic... lots of cool textures.</td>', 'Very dramatic... lots of cool textures.', '2006-09-05 09:23:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2799855, 387868, 31230, '<td valign="top">Nice action shot.  Wish you had pulled back to get more of the surrounding in the shot.  Give him more of a sense of flying.</td>', 'Nice action shot.  Wish you had pulled back to get more of the surrounding in the shot.  Give him more of a sense of flying.', '2006-09-05 09:24:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2799868, 386395, 43463, '<td valign="top">Presentation in this photo is clean and sharp. The butterfly and thistle really  pop off the page because of the stark white background. Sharpness of focus shows all the lovely details of the Monarch and the thistle.</td>', 'Presentation in this photo is clean and sharp. The butterfly and thistle really  pop off the page because of the stark white background. Sharpness of focus shows all the lovely details of the Monarch and the thistle.', '2006-09-05 09:29:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2799876, 388299, 43463, '<td valign="top">Wow, those bold and vibrant colors really pop off the page! The colors grab hold of the viewer by the collar and shout look at me! Love the set-up, lighting, and colors of this clown. Love the expression not just on the clown''s face but also in his posture. It communicates the thought that he is saying, "I''ve got two ideas here for you to choose from. Pick one! Choose one and I will make you laugh." Wonderful work.</td>', 'Wow, those bold and vibrant colors really pop off the page! The colors grab hold of the viewer by the collar and shout look at me! Love the set-up, lighting, and colors of this clown. Love the expression not just on the clown''s face but also in his posture. It communicates the thought that he is saying, "I''ve got two ideas here for you to choose from. Pick one! Choose one and I will make you laugh." Wonderful work.', '2006-09-05 09:34:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2799879, 386498, 19708, '<td valign="top">I like the humorous connection with the title.<br/>Nice, clear image with a good focal point and interest.<br/>Good colors here without going overboard.</td>', 'I like the humorous connection with the title.Nice, clear image with a good focal point and interest.Good colors here without going overboard.', '2006-09-05 09:36:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2799883, 377313, 19708, '<td valign="top">Never tire of looking at butterflies and hope you aren''t getting knocked down due to the large number of them in this challenge. Nice overall point of interest and great detail &amp; clarity.</td>', 'Never tire of looking at butterflies and hope you aren''t getting knocked down due to the large number of them in this challenge. Nice overall point of interest and great detail & clarity.', '2006-09-05 09:38:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2799885, 387278, 19708, '<td valign="top">Have no idea what the title means or refers to, but really don''t need to in order to appreciate a beautiful picture. Well done!</td>', 'Have no idea what the title means or refers to, but really don''t need to in order to appreciate a beautiful picture. Well done!', '2006-09-05 09:39:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2799886, 385057, 19708, '<td valign="top">A very nostalgic looking shot <i>(her dress style adds a lot for that)</i> of something close to me (ex-Navy guy here).<br/>Very calming shot with a story to tell. Well done.</td>', 'A very nostalgic looking shot (her dress style adds a lot for that) of something close to me (ex-Navy guy here).Very calming shot with a story to tell. Well done.', '2006-09-05 09:39:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2799887, 387511, 29748, '<td valign="top">Nice scene</td>', 'Nice scene', '2006-09-05 09:39:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2799888, 388704, 29748, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful concept.  Why do they look so unhappy?</td>', 'What a beautiful concept.  Why do they look so unhappy?', '2006-09-05 09:40:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2799890, 385991, 19708, '<td valign="top">Unique image in this challenge and great control over the lighting.<br/>Not sure the green would have been my first choice though.</td>', 'Unique image in this challenge and great control over the lighting.Not sure the green would have been my first choice though.', '2006-09-05 09:41:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2799892, 388670, 43463, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and the framing on your subject. You captured the steam engine from an angle that makes it appear that it is approaching the viewer - which always adds visual interest. But you carried the illusion one step further. The steam train''s smoke rises out of the frame giving the photo an overall illusion that the train is about to chug right out of the frame and into our living rooms. I also how the frame is outlined by a thin red border that not only pops off the black border but it also compliments the red on the steam engine.</td>', 'I like the composition and the framing on your subject. You captured the steam engine from an angle that makes it appear that it is approaching the viewer - which always adds visual interest. But you carried the illusion one step further. The steam train''s smoke rises out of the frame giving the photo an overall illusion that the train is about to chug right out of the frame and into our living rooms. I also how the frame is outlined by a thin red border that not only pops off the black border but it also compliments the red on the steam engine.', '2006-09-05 09:42:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2799895, 380632, 19708, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photograph and composition.<br/>The water seems to have a bit more Cyan in it than I would have chosen and think it may have looked a bit better reducing the Cyan saturation a bit.</td>', 'Beautiful photograph and composition.The water seems to have a bit more Cyan in it than I would have chosen and think it may have looked a bit better reducing the Cyan saturation a bit.', '2006-09-05 09:43:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2799896, 388692, 19708, '<td valign="top">These are difficult birds to catch sitting still <i>(been there)</i>.<br/>This little one seems to have a certain attitude about it sitting there.</td>', 'These are difficult birds to catch sitting still (been there).This little one seems to have a certain attitude about it sitting there.', '2006-09-05 09:44:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2799899, 388987, 19708, '<td valign="top">Most unusual look &amp; feel in Infra-Red, and like the overall effect.<br/>A bit too much noise in the sky for my tastes, but that''s just me.</td>', 'Most unusual look & feel in Infra-Red, and like the overall effect.A bit too much noise in the sky for my tastes, but that''s just me.', '2006-09-05 09:46:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2799902, 388600, 19708, '<td valign="top">HA! The world needs more silly, and applaud you for this unique shot.<br/>A bit lighter in the faces would have been a plus here.<br/>Fun and creative shot regardless.</td>', 'HA! The world needs more silly, and applaud you for this unique shot.A bit lighter in the faces would have been a plus here.Fun and creative shot regardless.', '2006-09-05 09:48:03.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2799905, 388585, 19708, '<td valign="top">Not something I see every day and sometimes we should look at the marvels of nature to realize the unique things all around us.</td>', 'Not something I see every day and sometimes we should look at the marvels of nature to realize the unique things all around us.', '2006-09-05 09:50:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2799906, 378761, 43463, '<td valign="top">Butterfly? Moth? I don''t see the hairy antenae that is typical with moths, but the coloration and design is that of a typical moth. So I am left wondering if it is a butterfly or moth. O.K. now onto the composition, lighting illuminates this moth/butterfly wonderfully so that we get to see ALL the lovely rich detail of it''s color and patterns on it''s wings. The composition even gives us the rough texture of the bark of the tree.</td>', 'Butterfly? Moth? I don''t see the hairy antenae that is typical with moths, but the coloration and design is that of a typical moth. So I am left wondering if it is a butterfly or moth. O.K. now onto the composition, lighting illuminates this moth/butterfly wonderfully so that we get to see ALL the lovely rich detail of it''s color and patterns on it''s wings. The composition even gives us the rough texture of the bark of the tree.', '2006-09-05 09:50:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2799908, 389003, 19708, '<td valign="top">Great point of view to give the viewer an amazing sense of scale.</td>', 'Great point of view to give the viewer an amazing sense of scale.', '2006-09-05 09:51:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2799910, 384198, 19708, '<td valign="top">HA! Thank you for putting a smile on my face.<br/>Great detail and clarity here, as well as a most unique &amp; funny shot!</td>', 'HA! Thank you for putting a smile on my face.Great detail and clarity here, as well as a most unique & funny shot!', '2006-09-05 09:52:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2799912, 377089, 63779, '<td valign="top">This is a very touching, intimate moment. Great capture.</td>', 'This is a very touching, intimate moment. Great capture.', '2006-09-05 09:53:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2799920, 379913, 63779, '<td valign="top">I always thought people who were afraid of clowns were a little off, but with this picture I understand it now. Nice image.</td>', 'I always thought people who were afraid of clowns were a little off, but with this picture I understand it now. Nice image.', '2006-09-05 09:57:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2799925, 389021, 19708, '<td valign="top">Precious moments...<br/>A most unusual and pleasnat color scheme here, as many/most shots similar to this are done in black &amp; white.</td>', 'Precious moments...A most unusual and pleasnat color scheme here, as many/most shots similar to this are done in black & white.', '2006-09-05 09:59:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2799930, 388309, 58125, '<td valign="top">Strong eyes!</td>', 'Strong eyes!', '2006-09-05 10:01:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2799931, 388707, 43463, '<td valign="top">I like the textures and colors that this composition presents to us. The yellow hues are bold and dominate the scene while there is the added element of color in that splash of red of the ladybug. In this small little ladybug''s world it follows a yellow pathway - hmmm, makes me think of Dorothy as she followed the Yellow Brick Road:-)My only critique on this photo is that the top 20% of the image is nothing but negative space that does nothing for the overall composition. I think you could easily crop that out so that the attention stays tightly focused on the ladybug and the yellow plantlife.</td>', 'I like the textures and colors that this composition presents to us. The yellow hues are bold and dominate the scene while there is the added element of color in that splash of red of the ladybug. In this small little ladybug''s world it follows a yellow pathway - hmmm, makes me think of Dorothy as she followed the Yellow Brick Road:-)My only critique on this photo is that the top 20% of the image is nothing but negative space that does nothing for the overall composition. I think you could easily crop that out so that the attention stays tightly focused on the ladybug and the yellow plantlife.', '2006-09-05 10:01:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2799933, 381947, 58125, '<td valign="top">Wow.</td>', 'Wow.', '2006-09-05 10:02:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2799935, 388882, 19708, '<td valign="top">Nice tones and color levels here.<br/>This image seems to have a couple focal points competing for my attention really.<br/>I want to look at the bridge in the distance, as it is mysterious in a way, yet the angled tubular base upon which the fisherman is standing is very strong, taking my eyes away from the bridge. Not sure the fisherman is really adding to this shot, and may be a distracting element really.</td>', 'Nice tones and color levels here.This image seems to have a couple focal points competing for my attention really.I want to look at the bridge in the distance, as it is mysterious in a way, yet the angled tubular base upon which the fisherman is standing is very strong, taking my eyes away from the bridge. Not sure the fisherman is really adding to this shot, and may be a distracting element really.', '2006-09-05 10:03:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2799937, 387689, 58125, '<td valign="top">Beautiful</td>', 'Beautiful', '2006-09-05 10:04:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2799938, 387348, 19708, '<td valign="top">Interesting use of natural framing, but creates a lot of competition for main focal point. Dropping the red''s intensity would have helped bring out the textures and details in the lighthouse.</td>', 'Interesting use of natural framing, but creates a lot of competition for main focal point. Dropping the red''s intensity would have helped bring out the textures and details in the lighthouse.', '2006-09-05 10:05:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2799942, 388325, 19708, '<td valign="top">I like the composition on this and the presence of the structures on the rock.<br/>My eyes keep being drawn to the rock in the foreground and also the mid-section of the red reflection that is sharp vs. the area above &amp; below where is is smooth/blurred.</td>', 'I like the composition on this and the presence of the structures on the rock.My eyes keep being drawn to the rock in the foreground and also the mid-section of the red reflection that is sharp vs. the area above & below where is is smooth/blurred.', '2006-09-05 10:07:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2799946, 377938, 63779, '<td valign="top">I think this is a fantastic portrait, but I dislike the fade-to-border.</td>', 'I think this is a fantastic portrait, but I dislike the fade-to-border.', '2006-09-05 10:09:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2799947, 388744, 19708, '<td valign="top">Didn''t know Mt. Everest have a cityscape below it <i>(just kidding..)</i> <br/>Nice point of view here with a great sky to accent the cityscape.</td>', 'Didn''t know Mt. Everest have a cityscape below it (just kidding..) Nice point of view here with a great sky to accent the cityscape.', '2006-09-05 10:09:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2799948, 387091, 43463, '<td valign="top">A nice candid capture of a street artist selling and displaying his talent and work. My critique is that I think the composition would be strengthened if you zoomed in or cropped out more of the stone wall surrounding him. Getting closer to the subject and even having him fully dominate the scene would be good because it gives the viewer an up close and personal look. Lastly I think that the composition would have greater visual impact if his face was not in the shadow of the hat - the brim actually covers his eyes. As such that his eyes are hidden from view and his face is not readily visible we don''t get to see his expression. Showing the expression on the face would heighten visual interest. Is he lost in thought? Is he concentrating on his painting? We don''t know because we can''t see his face or eyes. Showing the human expression establishes a connection with the viewer and makes for a more compelling image.</td>', 'A nice candid capture of a street artist selling and displaying his talent and work. My critique is that I think the composition would be strengthened if you zoomed in or cropped out more of the stone wall surrounding him. Getting closer to the subject and even having him fully dominate the scene would be good because it gives the viewer an up close and personal look. Lastly I think that the composition would have greater visual impact if his face was not in the shadow of the hat - the brim actually covers his eyes. As such that his eyes are hidden from view and his face is not readily visible we don''t get to see his expression. Showing the expression on the face would heighten visual interest. Is he lost in thought? Is he concentrating on his painting? We don''t know because we can''t see his face or eyes. Showing the human expression establishes a connection with the viewer and makes for a more compelling image.', '2006-09-05 10:09:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2799952, 381642, 19708, '<td valign="top">Not a scene most of us would ever get the chance to see.<br/>Most unusual colors down there. Good use of leading lines to draw the eyes to the miner.</td>', 'Not a scene most of us would ever get the chance to see.Most unusual colors down there. Good use of leading lines to draw the eyes to the miner.', '2006-09-05 10:10:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2799964, 387719, 19708, '<td valign="top">Not sure where my eyes should be going here - the tree or the structure.<br/>A soft focus on the background or dropping the colors &amp; contrast would help to make the background supplemental, and overall the image needs a counter-clockwise rotation to corrct the tilt.</td>', 'Not sure where my eyes should be going here - the tree or the structure.A soft focus on the background or dropping the colors & contrast would help to make the background supplemental, and overall the image needs a counter-clockwise rotation to corrct the tilt.', '2006-09-05 10:13:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2799973, 388573, 43463, '<td valign="top">I can''t help but hear the song "Just the two of us" going through my head as I gaze upon this photo. The gold and orange hues are nice warm tones that are visually appealing and invoke the memories of summer days. The two figures in silhouette holding hands adds human interest and the element of romance to the image. My only critique on this image is that the distracting element of the sun flares that appear in the photo. A slight change in angle or position may or may not have eliminated that element. But as it appears here it detracts from the appeal of the photo because it breaks up that nice smooth tonal range of warm orange &amp; gold colors.</td>', 'I can''t help but hear the song "Just the two of us" going through my head as I gaze upon this photo. The gold and orange hues are nice warm tones that are visually appealing and invoke the memories of summer days. The two figures in silhouette holding hands adds human interest and the element of romance to the image. My only critique on this image is that the distracting element of the sun flares that appear in the photo. A slight change in angle or position may or may not have eliminated that element. But as it appears here it detracts from the appeal of the photo because it breaks up that nice smooth tonal range of warm orange & gold colors.', '2006-09-05 10:16:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2799985, 387790, 58125, '<td valign="top">Interesting. The specs of light are a bit distracting</td>', 'Interesting. The specs of light are a bit distracting', '2006-09-05 10:19:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2799990, 382227, 58125, '<td valign="top">Would have liked to see the car in sharper focus. Interesting perspective and angles.</td>', 'Would have liked to see the car in sharper focus. Interesting perspective and angles.', '2006-09-05 10:20:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2799993, 385862, 58125, '<td valign="top">Interesting landscape. The bridge seems to blend into the background.</td>', 'Interesting landscape. The bridge seems to blend into the background.', '2006-09-05 10:21:18.000000', NULL, 1),
