(2800720, 386997, 32378, '<td valign="top">Nice job, great lighting.  The only suggestion and it is only a suggestion is remove the helmet from the shot.  Helmet centered perfectly makes this look really set up. Someone contiplating something wouldn''t appear quite as stagged. You have the expression in his face, don''t draw my attention away from it with the helmet.</td>', 'Nice job, great lighting.  The only suggestion and it is only a suggestion is remove the helmet from the shot.  Helmet centered perfectly makes this look really set up. Someone contiplating something wouldn''t appear quite as stagged. You have the expression in his face, don''t draw my attention away from it with the helmet.', '2006-09-05 14:42:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2800722, 388988, 63163, '<td valign="top">Lovely colors.</td>', 'Lovely colors.', '2006-09-05 14:43:44.000000', NULL, 1),
