(2801394, 375476, 42100, '<td valign="top">Very interesting combination of subject and satiny dress with the gritty locale.  Great clarity and color tone.  Well done!</td>', 'Very interesting combination of subject and satiny dress with the gritty locale.  Great clarity and color tone.  Well done!', '2006-09-05 18:17:45.000000', NULL, 1),
