(2801472, 384061, 5354, '<td valign="top">Wow what a composition. How the hell did you get a tripod in there without attracting the attention of security?</td>', 'Wow what a composition. How the hell did you get a tripod in there without attracting the attention of security?', '2006-09-05 18:39:27.000000', NULL, 1),
