(2801482, 387478, 5354, '<td valign="top">Good detail on the bird, but I just find the surrounding foliage a little distracting.</td>', 'Good detail on the bird, but I just find the surrounding foliage a little distracting.', '2006-09-05 18:41:33.000000', NULL, 1),
