(2801488, 388432, 5354, '<td valign="top">I like the image concept, just the distortion on the babes face is spoiling this for me.</td>', 'I like the image concept, just the distortion on the babes face is spoiling this for me.', '2006-09-05 18:42:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2801495, 388114, 5354, '<td valign="top">Something here is a little un-nerving, possibly the sky. I can''t put my finger on it.</td>', 'Something here is a little un-nerving, possibly the sky. I can''t put my finger on it.', '2006-09-05 18:46:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2801497, 388863, 5354, '<td valign="top">How the hell did you get this?<br/>The grain and the monochrome really does work well. 7 from me.</td>', 'How the hell did you get this?The grain and the monochrome really does work well. 7 from me.', '2006-09-05 18:46:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2801501, 385991, 5354, '<td valign="top">I love this one. The tattoos really give this guy some special character and you have accentuated this with the directional lighting. Well done.</td>', 'I love this one. The tattoos really give this guy some special character and you have accentuated this with the directional lighting. Well done.', '2006-09-05 18:48:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2801502, 383661, 31443, '<td valign="top">hahaha, cute</td>', 'hahaha, cute', '2006-09-05 18:48:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2801504, 388299, 5354, '<td valign="top">Woah , bright and colourful. Just starting to lose the white bulbs against the white background though</td>', 'Woah , bright and colourful. Just starting to lose the white bulbs against the white background though', '2006-09-05 18:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2801510, 387130, 5354, '<td valign="top">Peacock Feathers. Thats what jumped into my mind when I first saw this. Terrific detal in those lashes, but the face feels over processed and slightly plastic to me. Sorry 7</td>', 'Peacock Feathers. Thats what jumped into my mind when I first saw this. Terrific detal in those lashes, but the face feels over processed and slightly plastic to me. Sorry 7', '2006-09-05 18:52:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2801513, 388990, 45475, '<td valign="top">Great close up and I love the ''film'' grain. The only nitpick is the crop. My guess is that this was composed in camera and so there isn''t much that can be done about the bottom crop (would have preferred to see more chin), however, I would''ve been inclined to crop the top right down to about an inch above the topmost brow to give more importance to the face. As it is now, I feel like I''m being presented with the subject''s forehead and hair line first before being able to enjoy the rest of what this image has to offer :P</td>', 'Great close up and I love the ''film'' grain. The only nitpick is the crop. My guess is that this was composed in camera and so there isn''t much that can be done about the bottom crop (would have preferred to see more chin), however, I would''ve been inclined to crop the top right down to about an inch above the topmost brow to give more importance to the face. As it is now, I feel like I''m being presented with the subject''s forehead and hair line first before being able to enjoy the rest of what this image has to offer :P', '2006-09-05 18:53:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2801523, 384808, 5354, '<td valign="top">The placement of the canoe is just slightly troublesome for me. Its bang on centre, but leans slightly disturbing the symmetry. Also it probably just needs a little more space at the bottom of the image, just under the prow. I want to see a little more beach to link the left and right sides.</td>', 'The placement of the canoe is just slightly troublesome for me. Its bang on centre, but leans slightly disturbing the symmetry. Also it probably just needs a little more space at the bottom of the image, just under the prow. I want to see a little more beach to link the left and right sides.', '2006-09-05 18:55:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2801524, 382206, 42100, '<td valign="top">Kind of whimsical and almost personification with those moppy manes looking like the latest in trendy human hair styles.  Great photo!</td>', 'Kind of whimsical and almost personification with those moppy manes looking like the latest in trendy human hair styles.  Great photo!', '2006-09-05 18:56:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2801525, 388908, 5354, '<td valign="top">Velvet texture, well composed, but has so many other great photos to run against and just doesn''t stand out enough.</td>', 'Velvet texture, well composed, but has so many other great photos to run against and just doesn''t stand out enough.', '2006-09-05 18:56:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2801526, 388306, 42100, '<td valign="top">Lots of great character and detail in this portrait.  Very good tones as well.  Nicely done!</td>', 'Lots of great character and detail in this portrait.  Very good tones as well.  Nicely done!', '2006-09-05 18:56:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2801530, 376642, 5354, '<td valign="top">Wonderful, possibly in need of a little more light on the person, or move her 2 steps left so she is against the white sand.</td>', 'Wonderful, possibly in need of a little more light on the person, or move her 2 steps left so she is against the white sand.', '2006-09-05 18:57:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2801531, 386989, 45475, '<td valign="top">Now here''s a familiar site that takes me back...</td>', 'Now here''s a familiar site that takes me back...', '2006-09-05 18:59:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2801538, 388416, 61818, '<td valign="top">Chicks in bikinis won''t sway this vot...wait, wait a minute.  Nevermind, I''m swayed.</td>', 'Chicks in bikinis won''t sway this vot...wait, wait a minute.  Nevermind, I''m swayed.', '2006-09-05 19:04:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2801541, 377866, 5354, '<td valign="top">Good capture, but lacking in DPC friendly wow</td>', 'Good capture, but lacking in DPC friendly wow', '2006-09-05 19:08:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2801544, 388814, 31443, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!</td>', 'Beautiful!', '2006-09-05 19:09:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2801546, 388956, 5354, '<td valign="top">I like this one, but would possibly have tried a shallower depth of field to try and knock out some of the detail in those bushes. That way the eye couldn''t even get past the girl (not that my eye wanders away very far anyway hehe)</td>', 'I like this one, but would possibly have tried a shallower depth of field to try and knock out some of the detail in those bushes. That way the eye couldn''t even get past the girl (not that my eye wanders away very far anyway hehe)', '2006-09-05 19:10:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2801552, 388765, 5354, '<td valign="top">Thats quite some image. Hope there was a sheet of glass between you and it ;-)</td>', 'Thats quite some image. Hope there was a sheet of glass between you and it ;-)', '2006-09-05 19:14:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2801568, 388256, 61818, '<td valign="top">The pose here is not very good.  Going to show me a nicely lit nude surrounded by negative space, exploit all the curves the body has to offer.  Because really, that is all the nude body has to offer.  My eye keeps looking for the missing arm, the midriff looks distorted, etc.  Could also use a bit brighter light to enhance the contrast here.  This just doesn''t work for me.  Possibly it would be more appealing cropped tighter with the body running diagonal across the entire photo w/o the head in the frame.  Good luck.</td>', 'The pose here is not very good.  Going to show me a nicely lit nude surrounded by negative space, exploit all the curves the body has to offer.  Because really, that is all the nude body has to offer.  My eye keeps looking for the missing arm, the midriff looks distorted, etc.  Could also use a bit brighter light to enhance the contrast here.  This just doesn''t work for me.  Possibly it would be more appealing cropped tighter with the body running diagonal across the entire photo w/o the head in the frame.  Good luck.', '2006-09-05 19:22:44.000000', NULL, 1),
