(2801602, 387174, 61818, '<td valign="top">So the kid is either about to have a sibling or looks to be stocked up on nourishment for about the next 11 years.  Sorry, I don''t find the shot appealing.  Cute kid, nice and softly lit.  The other side of the photo is not appealing in the least and could have benefited from an equal or greater amount of soft focus/blurring.  Some call it beautiful because it''s natural.  A bird vomiting food into the mouth of its chicks is also natural, and I wouldn''t call that beautiful either.  To each his own.</td>', 'So the kid is either about to have a sibling or looks to be stocked up on nourishment for about the next 11 years.  Sorry, I don''t find the shot appealing.  Cute kid, nice and softly lit.  The other side of the photo is not appealing in the least and could have benefited from an equal or greater amount of soft focus/blurring.  Some call it beautiful because it''s natural.  A bird vomiting food into the mouth of its chicks is also natural, and I wouldn''t call that beautiful either.  To each his own.', '2006-09-05 19:35:38.000000', NULL, 1),
