(2802275, 387096, 19708, '<td valign="top">I like the composition, but the overall tone seems a bit "flat".<br/>A minor bump in contrast maybe?<br/>OK, I saved it and took it into Photoshop to see what I think it needs.<br/>Image, Adjustments, Levels, Options, 0.5 clip set in shadows and highlights <i>(my defaults)</i>, OK, then Edit, Fade, fade to taste, but not below 50%. <i>(60-70% looks pretty decent to me)</i></td>', 'I like the composition, but the overall tone seems a bit "flat".A minor bump in contrast maybe?OK, I saved it and took it into Photoshop to see what I think it needs.Image, Adjustments, Levels, Options, 0.5 clip set in shadows and highlights (my defaults), OK, then Edit, Fade, fade to taste, but not below 50%. (60-70% looks pretty decent to me)', '2006-09-05 23:17:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2802278, 388859, 1031, '<td valign="top">Nice expressive portrait -- good work with the lighting and the catchlight.</td>', 'Nice expressive portrait -- good work with the lighting and the catchlight.', '2006-09-05 23:18:07.000000', NULL, 1),
