(2802327, 381762, 1031, '<td valign="top">With the rest of the colors so vivid, the ultra-pale sky kind-of makes the photo seem somewhat unbalanced. There are many ways to deal with that, both pre- and post-exposure -- details on request.<br/> <br/>But I''d be more than happy to sit for a while on that bench over there -- it looks like a very nice place : )</td>', 'With the rest of the colors so vivid, the ultra-pale sky kind-of makes the photo seem somewhat unbalanced. There are many ways to deal with that, both pre- and post-exposure -- details on request. But I''d be more than happy to sit for a while on that bench over there -- it looks like a very nice place : )', '2006-09-05 23:31:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2802329, 388814, 25787, '<td valign="top">Wow, nice lighting.</td>', 'Wow, nice lighting.', '2006-09-05 23:31:57.000000', NULL, 1);
