(2802696, 384714, 60862, '<td valign="top">This shot has a lot of potential, but there are a few problems that keep my vote lower than it could''ve been.  The lighting is harsh, so you lose a lot of detail on the boar''s face.  The dead center composition can work well in a closeup, but here it doesn''t really grab me.  And the animal is so close in color to the dirt that my eye yearns for more contrast.</td>', 'This shot has a lot of potential, but there are a few problems that keep my vote lower than it could''ve been.  The lighting is harsh, so you lose a lot of detail on the boar''s face.  The dead center composition can work well in a closeup, but here it doesn''t really grab me.  And the animal is so close in color to the dirt that my eye yearns for more contrast.', '2006-09-06 00:52:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2802701, 388781, 1031, '<td valign="top">Indeed, great colors and texture in the mountain. Personally, I think I''d darken the sky a little, but not so much as to conflict with the almost-glowing colors in the mid-ground.</td>', 'Indeed, great colors and texture in the mountain. Personally, I think I''d darken the sky a little, but not so much as to conflict with the almost-glowing colors in the mid-ground.', '2006-09-06 00:53:13.000000', NULL, 1),
