(2804196, 388829, 38032, '<td valign="top">Nice tall feeling here. The effect isn''t gonna go over well with these voters i''m thinking.  The subject is abstract and interesting on its own i would think though.</td>', 'Nice tall feeling here. The effect isn''t gonna go over well with these voters i''m thinking.  The subject is abstract and interesting on its own i would think though.', '2006-09-06 09:05:03.000000', NULL, 1),
