(2804203, 380632, 39184, '<td valign="top">Very nice comosition and use of shutter speed to obtain the sheer effect of the water.  However, I don''t like the artificial look of the blue in the water.  I''ve taken a few waterfall and cascade shots myself and understand that it is very difficult to overcome the blown out whites in the moving water, but I prefer more of the blown out whites to the artificial blue look.  I''ve seen this before in my shots after I''ve post processed using the shadow/highlight tool a little too much.  With the addition of the seemingly oversaturated greens it becomes a little to unnaturally colorful.  I''ve also seen these colors in someone else''s shots and it will be interesting to see if I am right about who took this shot.</td>', 'Very nice comosition and use of shutter speed to obtain the sheer effect of the water.  However, I don''t like the artificial look of the blue in the water.  I''ve taken a few waterfall and cascade shots myself and understand that it is very difficult to overcome the blown out whites in the moving water, but I prefer more of the blown out whites to the artificial blue look.  I''ve seen this before in my shots after I''ve post processed using the shadow/highlight tool a little too much.  With the addition of the seemingly oversaturated greens it becomes a little to unnaturally colorful.  I''ve also seen these colors in someone else''s shots and it will be interesting to see if I am right about who took this shot.', '2006-09-06 09:06:11.000000', NULL, 1),
