(2804724, 387401, 43463, '<td valign="top">Love the soft lighting and the pose of the mother &amp; child. The soft lighting casts a gentle glow and feel to the photo. Perfect for it adds to the tender moment of the mother cradling her child. My only critique on improving the photo is that it is a shame that the shirt hides some of the baby''s face. For if the shirt was not obstructing the view, the viewer would then actually see another tender moment of the child''s head resting comfortably upon his mother''s chest.</td>', 'Love the soft lighting and the pose of the mother & child. The soft lighting casts a gentle glow and feel to the photo. Perfect for it adds to the tender moment of the mother cradling her child. My only critique on improving the photo is that it is a shame that the shirt hides some of the baby''s face. For if the shirt was not obstructing the view, the viewer would then actually see another tender moment of the child''s head resting comfortably upon his mother''s chest.', '2006-09-06 11:11:02.000000', NULL, 1),
