(2804809, 387806, 43463, '<td valign="top">There are alot of interesting lines and shapes presented in this abstract composition. The only thing that is a major distraction from the visual appeal of the photo is that the image is overexposed/blown out. There is a loss of tonal detail in the upper portions of the shopping carts. Many of the crossbar lines of the basket are a flat one tone shade of bright white. The brightness of the white is almost glaring to view.</td>', 'There are alot of interesting lines and shapes presented in this abstract composition. The only thing that is a major distraction from the visual appeal of the photo is that the image is overexposed/blown out. There is a loss of tonal detail in the upper portions of the shopping carts. Many of the crossbar lines of the basket are a flat one tone shade of bright white. The brightness of the white is almost glaring to view.', '2006-09-06 11:27:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2804811, 386679, 31230, '<td valign="top">Nice sharp image.  Nice use of rule of thirds</td>', 'Nice sharp image.  Nice use of rule of thirds', '2006-09-06 11:27:33.000000', NULL, 1),
