(2804817, 381536, 31230, '<td valign="top">Wow, excellent capture.  Love the feel of this shot.</td>', 'Wow, excellent capture.  Love the feel of this shot.', '2006-09-06 11:28:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2804820, 385813, 31230, '<td valign="top">Nice one light work.  Love it</td>', 'Nice one light work.  Love it', '2006-09-06 11:28:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2804821, 378498, 31230, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot.</td>', 'Beautiful shot.', '2006-09-06 11:28:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2804822, 388729, 31230, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  Love the action and your sunset</td>', 'Beautiful.  Love the action and your sunset', '2006-09-06 11:29:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2804833, 388927, 43463, '<td valign="top">I like the off center kilter presentation of this portrait shot. It makes the photo interesting and appealing AND it really calls attention to his hands. The photo is not only visually interesting because of the composition but because you show us the artist at work. It is as if we are sitting accross the table watching him as he sketchs. His hands and the sketch dominate 50% of the photo and the foreground which makes them more of the focus of attention - now that is a great composition choice for it really draws us into the photo. My only critique is that too much of his face is lost in shadow. I would have liked to have also been able to see the concentration/expression on the artist face more.</td>', 'I like the off center kilter presentation of this portrait shot. It makes the photo interesting and appealing AND it really calls attention to his hands. The photo is not only visually interesting because of the composition but because you show us the artist at work. It is as if we are sitting accross the table watching him as he sketchs. His hands and the sketch dominate 50% of the photo and the foreground which makes them more of the focus of attention - now that is a great composition choice for it really draws us into the photo. My only critique is that too much of his face is lost in shadow. I would have liked to have also been able to see the concentration/expression on the artist face more.', '2006-09-06 11:33:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2804843, 386386, 38732, '<td valign="top">Great processing and I really like the colourful lights against the dark surroundings.  Bumping up!</td>', 'Great processing and I really like the colourful lights against the dark surroundings.  Bumping up!', '2006-09-06 11:36:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2804846, 384061, 38732, '<td valign="top">I like the perspective and the sense of urgency of the people with the use of motion blur.  The title combined with the motion makes for a great message.  Bumping up!</td>', 'I like the perspective and the sense of urgency of the people with the use of motion blur.  The title combined with the motion makes for a great message.  Bumping up!', '2006-09-06 11:39:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2804847, 388271, 16004, '<td valign="top">gave this a nine.  it''s not perfect; the skin looks a bit red, it might be a bit over exposed, hands and some of face isn''t quite sharp enough (compared to the tap), the crop feels a tad tight and the background kind of draws attention away from the action.  however, as far as self-portraits go, this is incredibly original and creative, the water looks fantastic (especially love the sense of motion in the basin), the chrome fittings don''t show the camera.  it''s also very, well, not self deprecating exactly, but not an ego trip either, which some SPs have a tendancy to be.  it''s an openly honest SP, which is weird given you''re hiding your face.  i like the concept of this a lot and i hope it does well.</td>', 'gave this a nine.  it''s not perfect; the skin looks a bit red, it might be a bit over exposed, hands and some of face isn''t quite sharp enough (compared to the tap), the crop feels a tad tight and the background kind of draws attention away from the action.  however, as far as self-portraits go, this is incredibly original and creative, the water looks fantastic (especially love the sense of motion in the basin), the chrome fittings don''t show the camera.  it''s also very, well, not self deprecating exactly, but not an ego trip either, which some SPs have a tendancy to be.  it''s an openly honest SP, which is weird given you''re hiding your face.  i like the concept of this a lot and i hope it does well.', '2006-09-06 11:39:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2804852, 377423, 38732, '<td valign="top">Great detail with the wetness and all the wrinkles and crevices of the skin.  Nice close crop.  Bumping up!</td>', 'Great detail with the wetness and all the wrinkles and crevices of the skin.  Nice close crop.  Bumping up!', '2006-09-06 11:40:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2804859, 387056, 50695, '<td valign="top">she seems to be of the wind, a spirit who can dissolve into your eyes. 10</td>', 'she seems to be of the wind, a spirit who can dissolve into your eyes. 10', '2006-09-06 11:44:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2804864, 388755, 50695, '<td valign="top">her face, though highly expressive, is ambiguous. she could be afraid, or sad, or just anxious. I see this as a metaphor for growing up, skating into the unknown. That''s why it is appropriate that there is so much space in front of her, and it''s "blacked out" by that curtain. 10</td>', 'her face, though highly expressive, is ambiguous. she could be afraid, or sad, or just anxious. I see this as a metaphor for growing up, skating into the unknown. That''s why it is appropriate that there is so much space in front of her, and it''s "blacked out" by that curtain. 10', '2006-09-06 11:46:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2804871, 386620, 16004, '<td valign="top">i love the composition of this, and the style (specifically the specs themselves, the b&amp;w tones, and the clearly defined shade and light) is really visually striking.  i just wish the whole image was smoooother.  grain i like, but here there seems to be a high level of left over artefacts from possibly too much sharpening. just left wanting for more, really - so it''s really good, but not great.  6.</td>', 'i love the composition of this, and the style (specifically the specs themselves, the b&w tones, and the clearly defined shade and light) is really visually striking.  i just wish the whole image was smoooother.  grain i like, but here there seems to be a high level of left over artefacts from possibly too much sharpening. just left wanting for more, really - so it''s really good, but not great.  6.', '2006-09-06 11:47:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2804886, 380638, 50695, '<td valign="top">it took me several viewings before I recognized the hand beneath the water. what a powerful mystery. What finally wins me over is the roughness of the shapes, it really does feel like something is being restored, and it''s a rough, painful process, or at least a profound process that requires disintegration and reintegration. I am reminded of Achilles being dipped into the holy waters, of Vulcan''s forge, of Jesus''s baptism. 10</td>', 'it took me several viewings before I recognized the hand beneath the water. what a powerful mystery. What finally wins me over is the roughness of the shapes, it really does feel like something is being restored, and it''s a rough, painful process, or at least a profound process that requires disintegration and reintegration. I am reminded of Achilles being dipped into the holy waters, of Vulcan''s forge, of Jesus''s baptism. 10', '2006-09-06 11:51:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2804897, 379739, 50695, '<td valign="top">amazing effect, it seems like the same cow floating in space in four different incarnations. The exaggerated perspective is dizzying. And the backdrop for them is nice and dark and thematically neutral. Pure pleasure to look at. 10</td>', 'amazing effect, it seems like the same cow floating in space in four different incarnations. The exaggerated perspective is dizzying. And the backdrop for them is nice and dark and thematically neutral. Pure pleasure to look at. 10', '2006-09-06 11:57:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2804902, 387498, 50695, '<td valign="top">the boy''s expression is perfect, and the composition, though complex, effectively draws the eye to the boy. this photo feels like a classic from the 50s or 60s. It''s static, but jazzy. Reality is condensed into highly figurative shapes that are forced to mingle with each other. 10</td>', 'the boy''s expression is perfect, and the composition, though complex, effectively draws the eye to the boy. this photo feels like a classic from the 50s or 60s. It''s static, but jazzy. Reality is condensed into highly figurative shapes that are forced to mingle with each other. 10', '2006-09-06 12:00:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2804906, 388606, 50695, '<td valign="top">that is one profound pile of chairs. it becomes their habitat, and they are supremely at home their. I feel like I''m looking at a pride of lions, or a leatherclad gang from the 50s. Their beverage cans become icons of leisure. One boy dares to look into the depths of his environment, but here the story ends. We are left to wonder what he finds, what he dares to see. 10</td>', 'that is one profound pile of chairs. it becomes their habitat, and they are supremely at home their. I feel like I''m looking at a pride of lions, or a leatherclad gang from the 50s. Their beverage cans become icons of leisure. One boy dares to look into the depths of his environment, but here the story ends. We are left to wonder what he finds, what he dares to see. 10', '2006-09-06 12:02:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2804907, 382659, 53755, '<td valign="top">Wow, great photograpy! I think this photo is amazing. Good job.</td>', 'Wow, great photograpy! I think this photo is amazing. Good job.', '2006-09-06 12:02:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2804912, 378530, 43463, '<td valign="top">I really like the look and feel of this photo. The colors and textures present give it an earthy &amp; grungy feel that gives a really moody feel. Even though the  house appears run down the man stands there and one gets the feeling he is comfortable just we he is - it is his home after all which is what the title of the piece communicates to us. The only critique I have for the this photo is that while it shows the realism of the place, those telephone wires do nothing but distract and detract. I know some would clone them out and perhaps that might be an option so that they do not draw attention away from the main focal points of the photo.</td>', 'I really like the look and feel of this photo. The colors and textures present give it an earthy & grungy feel that gives a really moody feel. Even though the  house appears run down the man stands there and one gets the feeling he is comfortable just we he is - it is his home after all which is what the title of the piece communicates to us. The only critique I have for the this photo is that while it shows the realism of the place, those telephone wires do nothing but distract and detract. I know some would clone them out and perhaps that might be an option so that they do not draw attention away from the main focal points of the photo.', '2006-09-06 12:04:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2804914, 381288, 50695, '<td valign="top">I have never cares so much for a macro. The bee is caught in such a deep embrace, revealing the desperation of its need, and everything is soft and grainy like an old movie. 10</td>', 'I have never cares so much for a macro. The bee is caught in such a deep embrace, revealing the desperation of its need, and everything is soft and grainy like an old movie. 10', '2006-09-06 12:04:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2804915, 384877, 53755, '<td valign="top">Great Photograpy!</td>', 'Great Photograpy!', '2006-09-06 12:04:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2804919, 380991, 50695, '<td valign="top">this is somehow both Victorian and Baroque. An allegorical wonderland. 10</td>', 'this is somehow both Victorian and Baroque. An allegorical wonderland. 10', '2006-09-06 12:05:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2804920, 388956, 38032, '<td valign="top">This is great.  I love the title because it allows for the mystery to be easily realized here.  <br/> <br/>That''s really what the title is for IMO - to make the 2-10 seconds we look at the image help us see what the photographer was thinking ...  <br/> <br/>and the ... um ... well this whole morning after idea - a hurricane, a saultry affair, a murder ... very intriguing and beautiful. Not a think negative I can say here. <b>10</b></td>', 'This is great.  I love the title because it allows for the mystery to be easily realized here.   That''s really what the title is for IMO - to make the 2-10 seconds we look at the image help us see what the photographer was thinking ...   and the ... um ... well this whole morning after idea - a hurricane, a saultry affair, a murder ... very intriguing and beautiful. Not a think negative I can say here. 10', '2006-09-06 12:05:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2804923, 387835, 38032, '<td valign="top">I love the scrrrrrrattchiness!!!</td>', 'I love the scrrrrrrattchiness!!!', '2006-09-06 12:05:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2804928, 389023, 53755, '<td valign="top">Wow, great photograpy! Awesome subject to work with.</td>', 'Wow, great photograpy! Awesome subject to work with.', '2006-09-06 12:07:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2804935, 382300, 53755, '<td valign="top">Great Photograpy!</td>', 'Great Photograpy!', '2006-09-06 12:09:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2804937, 388985, 38032, '<td valign="top">Water Boy!!! ... Still laughing about that one.  These are great action shots.  Almost looks like everyone is just standing there.</td>', 'Water Boy!!! ... Still laughing about that one.  These are great action shots.  Almost looks like everyone is just standing there.', '2006-09-06 12:10:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2804940, 388712, 53755, '<td valign="top">Wow, great photo!</td>', 'Wow, great photo!', '2006-09-06 12:11:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2804951, 387290, 53755, '<td valign="top">Wow, what a photo!</td>', 'Wow, what a photo!', '2006-09-06 12:12:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2804953, 388927, 50695, '<td valign="top">this is how you do a portrait. The photo becomes the subject. You become the sketch artist, working with fierce shapes of black, scratchy fields of gray, harsh lines and shapes. You sketch the artist and his work, the artist creating his work, and the artist becoming his work (it looks as though he''s falling into his own picture!). Portraiting doesn''t get better than this, and that includes the pizza and the soda. 10</td>', 'this is how you do a portrait. The photo becomes the subject. You become the sketch artist, working with fierce shapes of black, scratchy fields of gray, harsh lines and shapes. You sketch the artist and his work, the artist creating his work, and the artist becoming his work (it looks as though he''s falling into his own picture!). Portraiting doesn''t get better than this, and that includes the pizza and the soda. 10', '2006-09-06 12:13:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2804957, 386904, 53755, '<td valign="top">Wow, how did you do this? It is Great!</td>', 'Wow, how did you do this? It is Great!', '2006-09-06 12:13:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2804961, 388416, 38032, '<td valign="top">I love the band AID !!!! --- Since this image isn''t really about beauty at least not exclusively  - it is about a moment somewhere that looks nice and relaxing - and we all know she''s on a cell phone .... And the bandaid keeps her real, much like the cell ... phone.  Sometimes we don''t like "real" sometimes we do.  Here, I do.</td>', 'I love the band AID !!!! --- Since this image isn''t really about beauty at least not exclusively  - it is about a moment somewhere that looks nice and relaxing - and we all know she''s on a cell phone .... And the bandaid keeps her real, much like the cell ... phone.  Sometimes we don''t like "real" sometimes we do.  Here, I do.', '2006-09-06 12:14:41.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2804963, 385810, 32378, '<td valign="top">Well done, you really conveyed the futuristic look in this.</td>', 'Well done, you really conveyed the futuristic look in this.', '2006-09-06 12:15:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2804965, 386028, 32378, '<td valign="top">Wonderful rich colors, even though horizon seems to cut this in half, which I''m sure others will mention, I think it works well in this shot.  good luck.</td>', 'Wonderful rich colors, even though horizon seems to cut this in half, which I''m sure others will mention, I think it works well in this shot.  good luck.', '2006-09-06 12:15:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2804967, 388026, 32378, '<td valign="top">Great shot and the name of the boat fits perfectly.  good luck.</td>', 'Great shot and the name of the boat fits perfectly.  good luck.', '2006-09-06 12:15:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2804969, 388657, 32378, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot and beautiful model, great eyes.  I like the soft feel with good lighting.  good luck.</td>', 'Wonderful shot and beautiful model, great eyes.  I like the soft feel with good lighting.  good luck.', '2006-09-06 12:15:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2804970, 386146, 32378, '<td valign="top">Great shot, like the effect.  Good luck.</td>', 'Great shot, like the effect.  Good luck.', '2006-09-06 12:15:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2804972, 380852, 32378, '<td valign="top">Great shot, like how the road leads right to the most dramatic part of the horizon.  Good luck.</td>', 'Great shot, like how the road leads right to the most dramatic part of the horizon.  Good luck.', '2006-09-06 12:16:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2804978, 379977, 53755, '<td valign="top">Wow, is this for real or taken from a photo? Incredible. My favorite!</td>', 'Wow, is this for real or taken from a photo? Incredible. My favorite!', '2006-09-06 12:16:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2804979, 377866, 50695, '<td valign="top">So simply and directly you convey something that could take hours to explain. A child innocently holding up an emotion he does not understand. The way we lift up signs without truly knowing what they signify, the way we get into lines and parades and demonstrations and offices and try to feel a certain way because we are scheduled to do so, and because we have flat white helpers with big letters. <br/> <br/>One can sense consequences right outside the frame. The photo is funny and tragic at the same time... mostly tragic in the time and mood I am in. 10</td>', 'So simply and directly you convey something that could take hours to explain. A child innocently holding up an emotion he does not understand. The way we lift up signs without truly knowing what they signify, the way we get into lines and parades and demonstrations and offices and try to feel a certain way because we are scheduled to do so, and because we have flat white helpers with big letters.  One can sense consequences right outside the frame. The photo is funny and tragic at the same time... mostly tragic in the time and mood I am in. 10', '2006-09-06 12:16:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2804980, 375743, 43463, '<td valign="top">Wow, look at all sharp details on that insect. I like that you caught the moment with the bee in side profile so that one can appreciate the details of it''s body from head to back. The only critique I have on this photo is the crop. I think you could strengthen the composition even more if you bring us in closer to the insect and all the lovely details we see we would see even more. A closer zoom or crop to your main subject can give the viewer an up close and  personal view.</td>', 'Wow, look at all sharp details on that insect. I like that you caught the moment with the bee in side profile so that one can appreciate the details of it''s body from head to back. The only critique I have on this photo is the crop. I think you could strengthen the composition even more if you bring us in closer to the insect and all the lovely details we see we would see even more. A closer zoom or crop to your main subject can give the viewer an up close and  personal view.', '2006-09-06 12:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2804981, 388935, 32378, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting for the color of these flowers, really brings out the feeling and mood.  good luck.</td>', 'Nice lighting for the color of these flowers, really brings out the feeling and mood.  good luck.', '2006-09-06 12:17:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2804982, 387758, 38032, '<td valign="top">What a great character - unmistakably resembling a human.</td>', 'What a great character - unmistakably resembling a human.', '2006-09-06 12:18:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2804984, 387181, 32378, '<td valign="top">wonderful shot.  Nice colors, and choice of depth of field.  good luck.</td>', 'wonderful shot.  Nice colors, and choice of depth of field.  good luck.', '2006-09-06 12:18:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2804985, 377518, 32378, '<td valign="top">I like the effect you achieved with this photo.  Not your run of the mill DPC shot.  Good luck.</td>', 'I like the effect you achieved with this photo.  Not your run of the mill DPC shot.  Good luck.', '2006-09-06 12:18:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2804991, 387056, 38032, '<td valign="top">Like it! I prefer a shot like this a an "all dolled-up" shot any day.</td>', 'Like it! I prefer a shot like this a an "all dolled-up" shot any day.', '2006-09-06 12:19:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2804993, 385096, 53755, '<td valign="top">Fabulous Photo! Good work.</td>', 'Fabulous Photo! Good work.', '2006-09-06 12:19:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2805001, 374508, 18197, '<td valign="top">I like the color and composition. Subject is interesting. Lighting is very good. But it appears so over sharpened as to spoil the photo.</td>', 'I like the color and composition. Subject is interesting. Lighting is very good. But it appears so over sharpened as to spoil the photo.', '2006-09-06 12:23:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2805004, 388310, 50695, '<td valign="top">Oh Albert, my uncle, my prince! How I adore you and love you, how I *am* you. Yes, I see myself in that corner. I feel your resolve, and how it feels the same as resignation. 10</td>', 'Oh Albert, my uncle, my prince! How I adore you and love you, how I *am* you. Yes, I see myself in that corner. I feel your resolve, and how it feels the same as resignation. 10', '2006-09-06 12:24:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2805018, 387806, 50695, '<td valign="top">a stunning display of the geometry that surrounds us. Notice how they are individuals yet completely networked together into a greater being... and at the same time you never let us forget the banality of the setting. The high contrast is perfect for this. 10</td>', 'a stunning display of the geometry that surrounds us. Notice how they are individuals yet completely networked together into a greater being... and at the same time you never let us forget the banality of the setting. The high contrast is perfect for this. 10', '2006-09-06 12:27:12.000000', NULL, 1),
