(2805073, 379977, 18197, '<td valign="top">Interesting character. Potentially a fine photo but two things in post are over the top IMO: Sharpening; and Color Saturation. Better again IMO to back off a bit on these.</td>', 'Interesting character. Potentially a fine photo but two things in post are over the top IMO: Sharpening; and Color Saturation. Better again IMO to back off a bit on these.', '2006-09-06 12:32:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2805076, 378856, 50695, '<td valign="top">the horse does seem lost, and not just lost, but coming apart... losing itself to the flora it is immersed in. I think this effect is created by having the cutoff right at the torso and having its nose immersed. You are right on the edge: is it a picture of a horse, or a field? I love the edge. Also, a beautiful raking light on the horse. 9</td>', 'the horse does seem lost, and not just lost, but coming apart... losing itself to the flora it is immersed in. I think this effect is created by having the cutoff right at the torso and having its nose immersed. You are right on the edge: is it a picture of a horse, or a field? I love the edge. Also, a beautiful raking light on the horse. 9', '2006-09-06 12:33:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2805084, 386234, 50695, '<td valign="top">This is fun, and allegorically profound, and visually profound with all those layers of beach, puddle, beach, pool, beach, ocean. And the title is the coup de gras! 9</td>', 'This is fun, and allegorically profound, and visually profound with all those layers of beach, puddle, beach, pool, beach, ocean. And the title is the coup de gras! 9', '2006-09-06 12:34:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2805095, 384883, 18197, '<td valign="top">I like the subject and your composition. Colors are quite good. Lighting is pleasing. But I would have preferred the foreground to be less sharpened.</td>', 'I like the subject and your composition. Colors are quite good. Lighting is pleasing. But I would have preferred the foreground to be less sharpened.', '2006-09-06 12:36:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2805101, 384844, 50695, '<td valign="top">I love the swirl of arm and hair around the partially obscured face, and the way she presses her lips against this frame, emphasizing just how closely, sensually hemmed in she is by it, but also suggesting some sort of love of herself, an impish self-affirmation that makes her all the more attractive. 10</td>', 'I love the swirl of arm and hair around the partially obscured face, and the way she presses her lips against this frame, emphasizing just how closely, sensually hemmed in she is by it, but also suggesting some sort of love of herself, an impish self-affirmation that makes her all the more attractive. 10', '2006-09-06 12:37:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2805110, 386620, 50695, '<td valign="top">terrific splash of shape and form with so little solidness, it''s almost all flatness except for one item, and even that item is folded up! I feel like I''m in a world that exists between the second and third dimensions... and I''m flying! 9</td>', 'terrific splash of shape and form with so little solidness, it''s almost all flatness except for one item, and even that item is folded up! I feel like I''m in a world that exists between the second and third dimensions... and I''m flying! 9', '2006-09-06 12:39:08.000000', NULL, 1),
