(2805199, 375476, 16197, '<td valign="top">cute idea, to me it isn''t bold enough with the colours.  Everything seems to soft and conserved.  I think if upping the curves for a darker richer colour and bringing her dress out more would really make this image POP!.  As it is now to me it is fairly flat.</td>', 'cute idea, to me it isn''t bold enough with the colours.  Everything seems to soft and conserved.  I think if upping the curves for a darker richer colour and bringing her dress out more would really make this image POP!.  As it is now to me it is fairly flat.', '2006-09-06 12:48:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2805206, 387362, 18197, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot. The way you captured the mist creates a wonderful emotional impact. I like the rays from the lights (hope they''re legal). The only thing I would try to improve would be to straighten the horizon. Your subject isn''t enhanced by the slant and it is one of my personal rants.</td>', 'Lovely shot. The way you captured the mist creates a wonderful emotional impact. I like the rays from the lights (hope they''re legal). The only thing I would try to improve would be to straighten the horizon. Your subject isn''t enhanced by the slant and it is one of my personal rants.', '2006-09-06 12:49:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2805213, 386317, 16197, '<td valign="top">Really fun image.  Probably one of the more orginal for this challenge. I like the larger droplets of water, but the really small ones throws me off.  I understand not a lot you can do in editing for that... but the white speckles distracts me. (the ity bity ones, not the reflections on the drops)</td>', 'Really fun image.  Probably one of the more orginal for this challenge. I like the larger droplets of water, but the really small ones throws me off.  I understand not a lot you can do in editing for that... but the white speckles distracts me. (the ity bity ones, not the reflections on the drops)', '2006-09-06 12:50:33.000000', NULL, 1),
