(2805231, 388914, 18197, '<td valign="top">Normally I don''t like borders but I DO like this one. Well executed. The subject and its composition are very good. It may be just a bit oversharpened. In general the saturation is quite good, but the blue in the lower right is too intense for my taste. If I were editing it, I might have used a layer mask to tone it down just a bit. As is, it puls my eye away from the rest of the photo.</td>', 'Normally I don''t like borders but I DO like this one. Well executed. The subject and its composition are very good. It may be just a bit oversharpened. In general the saturation is quite good, but the blue in the lower right is too intense for my taste. If I were editing it, I might have used a layer mask to tone it down just a bit. As is, it puls my eye away from the rest of the photo.', '2006-09-06 12:52:51.000000', NULL, 1),
