(2805264, 377518, 18197, '<td valign="top">You have captured and brought out the essence of a Harley and the Harley mentality. Superb! I really love this "as art" but it''s no longer a photo. Normally I would react quite negatively to the amount of post processing, ..., but somehow I can''t. Well done. Among my top picks.</td>', 'You have captured and brought out the essence of a Harley and the Harley mentality. Superb! I really love this "as art" but it''s no longer a photo. Normally I would react quite negatively to the amount of post processing, ..., but somehow I can''t. Well done. Among my top picks.', '2006-09-06 12:59:04.000000', NULL, 1),
