(2805720, 388114, 32345, '<td valign="top">Beautifull pictire, colors are great and so is the sky. Really moody... can we say that?<br/> <br/>Very well done, this should get a really good score in the challenge</td>', 'Beautifull pictire, colors are great and so is the sky. Really moody... can we say that? Very well done, this should get a really good score in the challenge', '2006-09-06 14:25:18.000000', NULL, 1),
