(2805722, 383713, 32345, '<td valign="top">Great lighting, the mood is great. Should finish with a very good score. Well done and good luck.</td>', 'Great lighting, the mood is great. Should finish with a very good score. Well done and good luck.', '2006-09-06 14:25:24.000000', NULL, 1),
