(2805823, 386003, 44611, '<td valign="top">I feel I would have liked this shot more without the dinghy in it - it seems somehow ordinary and inconcruous against the magnificent rock structures and the brilliant way you''ve caught the sunrise.</td>', 'I feel I would have liked this shot more without the dinghy in it - it seems somehow ordinary and inconcruous against the magnificent rock structures and the brilliant way you''ve caught the sunrise.', '2006-09-06 14:52:11.000000', NULL, 1),
