(2805841, 386248, 44611, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lighting and clarity - I only wish we could see the lovely purple colour of the lavender flowers more distinctly - it just would have helped with the contrast of the shot overall.</td>', 'Beautiful lighting and clarity - I only wish we could see the lovely purple colour of the lavender flowers more distinctly - it just would have helped with the contrast of the shot overall.', '2006-09-06 15:01:53.000000', NULL, 1),
