(2806031, 388990, 44611, '<td valign="top">The graininess of the portrait is offset by the smoothness of the glasses and the reflections within the lenses which is really effective.  I like this .. its an interesting image.</td>', 'The graininess of the portrait is offset by the smoothness of the glasses and the reflections within the lenses which is really effective.  I like this .. its an interesting image.', '2006-09-06 15:31:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2806033, 378603, 44611, '<td valign="top">Wow, what a sunrise - magnificent colours and well composed image.  Hope this does well for you.</td>', 'Wow, what a sunrise - magnificent colours and well composed image.  Hope this does well for you.', '2006-09-06 15:32:07.000000', NULL, 1),
