(2806949, 385077, 12733, '<td valign="top">The cat''s face is completely blacked out! A white reflector (cardboard or cloth, for instance) to reflect some light back would make this a charming picture. Cropping out the boxes and paper on the right-hand side would also bring out the cat''s beauty. There''s nothing wrong with a tall, narrow picture if that''s what best displays your subject.</td>', 'The cat''s face is completely blacked out! A white reflector (cardboard or cloth, for instance) to reflect some light back would make this a charming picture. Cropping out the boxes and paper on the right-hand side would also bring out the cat''s beauty. There''s nothing wrong with a tall, narrow picture if that''s what best displays your subject.', '2006-09-06 19:56:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2806951, 388874, 12733, '<td valign="top">Fantastic capture of the texture of the wings.</td>', 'Fantastic capture of the texture of the wings.', '2006-09-06 19:57:24.000000', NULL, 1),
