(2806983, 380676, 49652, '<td valign="top">Great capture.  The dark background really works here to highlight him.  I like the motion of the wings.</td>', 'Great capture.  The dark background really works here to highlight him.  I like the motion of the wings.', '2006-09-06 20:11:14.000000', NULL, 1),
