(2807072, 388461, 57775, '<td valign="top">I like the texture on this (assume it''s a photoshop filter?) - gives me the impression of foliage trapped beneath ice.  Very creative.</td>', 'I like the texture on this (assume it''s a photoshop filter?) - gives me the impression of foliage trapped beneath ice.  Very creative.', '2006-09-06 20:31:44.000000', NULL, 1),
