(2807088, 388678, 57775, '<td valign="top">Hahaha - great shot - I kept calling this challenge a "Freestyle" challenge, so it fits perfectly.</td>', 'Hahaha - great shot - I kept calling this challenge a "Freestyle" challenge, so it fits perfectly.', '2006-09-06 20:33:57.000000', NULL, 1),
