(2807107, 388938, 57775, '<td valign="top">Oh wow, this is SUCH perfect lighting!  Would love to hear what your light source was for this.  (And by the way, very adorable cat too.)</td>', 'Oh wow, this is SUCH perfect lighting!  Would love to hear what your light source was for this.  (And by the way, very adorable cat too.)', '2006-09-06 20:36:56.000000', NULL, 1),
