(2807203, 387292, 16197, '<td valign="top">Nice colours, don''t care for the powerpoles in the distance.  Just doesn''t give me a Wow effect though.  But a very nice image.</td>', 'Nice colours, don''t care for the powerpoles in the distance.  Just doesn''t give me a Wow effect though.  But a very nice image.', '2006-09-06 20:59:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2807206, 388373, 16197, '<td valign="top">nice side sunset shot.  I like the blue on the mountains but don''t care for the smoggy looking orange/brown/gray over them.  The boat is cute, to me there is to much grass out front.  Sadly as well the birds look like sensor dust )-;.  But a nice overall shot.</td>', 'nice side sunset shot.  I like the blue on the mountains but don''t care for the smoggy looking orange/brown/gray over them.  The boat is cute, to me there is to much grass out front.  Sadly as well the birds look like sensor dust )-;.  But a nice overall shot.', '2006-09-06 21:02:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2807209, 385257, 3569, '<td valign="top">cool feeding avocet.</td>', 'cool feeding avocet.', '2006-09-06 21:03:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2807211, 388780, 3569, '<td valign="top">excellent dragon for sure</td>', 'excellent dragon for sure', '2006-09-06 21:05:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2807213, 388633, 3569, '<td valign="top">soft as a baby, nice...</td>', 'soft as a baby, nice...', '2006-09-06 21:05:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2807214, 379416, 16197, '<td valign="top">Ok this is strange, that tattoo looks very similar to another also in this challenge on the back of a nude female.  Hmmm.  Anyway, It is a nice shot the wood grain looks good, the tones look nice, except for the bright spot on our right it distracts my eye.  As well as the spot under her elbo.  For this type of shot, I think it would be better to have more of the window frame showing.  This perspective/distortion to me doesn''t hold enough entrest.</td>', 'Ok this is strange, that tattoo looks very similar to another also in this challenge on the back of a nude female.  Hmmm.  Anyway, It is a nice shot the wood grain looks good, the tones look nice, except for the bright spot on our right it distracts my eye.  As well as the spot under her elbo.  For this type of shot, I think it would be better to have more of the window frame showing.  This perspective/distortion to me doesn''t hold enough entrest.', '2006-09-06 21:06:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2807215, 386421, 18191, '<td valign="top">I <i>LOVE</i> Roy Hargrove. His new album Reflections and Distractions is amazing, you must check it out.</td>', 'I LOVE Roy Hargrove. His new album Reflections and Distractions is amazing, you must check it out.', '2006-09-06 21:06:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2807220, 388364, 16197, '<td valign="top">Yummy fish dinner.  Nice capture.  Only thing is the colours make it uninteresting for me.  Tones are reall close and leave the excitement wanting.</td>', 'Yummy fish dinner.  Nice capture.  Only thing is the colours make it uninteresting for me.  Tones are reall close and leave the excitement wanting.', '2006-09-06 21:07:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2807226, 388744, 16197, '<td valign="top">pretty, But if you could have turned certain lights on to spell out DPC that would have been great L()L.. Just kidding.  Its a nice capture,  Only thing that gets me is its one sided.  the Lights are one side sunset and traffic, the other side dark clouds. to me it just doesn''t balance but a nice capture.</td>', 'pretty, But if you could have turned certain lights on to spell out DPC that would have been great L()L.. Just kidding.  Its a nice capture,  Only thing that gets me is its one sided.  the Lights are one side sunset and traffic, the other side dark clouds. to me it just doesn''t balance but a nice capture.', '2006-09-06 21:09:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2807230, 388714, 16197, '<td valign="top">Fun, nice details and colours dof nice, just doesnt give me a stronge feeling of what it is.  Could be tin cans. or pistons...</td>', 'Fun, nice details and colours dof nice, just doesnt give me a stronge feeling of what it is.  Could be tin cans. or pistons...', '2006-09-06 21:10:47.000000', NULL, 1),
