(2808549, 385607, 19708, '<td valign="top">Great use of leading lines and superb tones &amp; detail.<br/>Visually heart-warming and superb in composition.<br/>One of the BEST black &amp; white images I have seen in a very, very long time.</td>', 'Great use of leading lines and superb tones & detail.Visually heart-warming and superb in composition.One of the BEST black & white images I have seen in a very, very long time.', '2006-09-07 01:31:25.000000', NULL, 1),
