(2808570, 384767, 47906, '<td valign="top">Nice Sky, Good Coloration, compostion and clarity</td>', 'Nice Sky, Good Coloration, compostion and clarity', '2006-09-07 01:35:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2808571, 386028, 19708, '<td valign="top">Stunning photograph.<br/>This woudn''t have nearly the impact without that fabulous sky.<br/>Well done on being in the right place at the right time.</td>', 'Stunning photograph.This woudn''t have nearly the impact without that fabulous sky.Well done on being in the right place at the right time.', '2006-09-07 01:35:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2808578, 388830, 47906, '<td valign="top">Nice macro, good DOF.. Neat Photo</td>', 'Nice macro, good DOF.. Neat Photo', '2006-09-07 01:37:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2808584, 379977, 19708, '<td valign="top">A marvelous capture.<br/>The post-processing here hurts this for me. Perhaps too much shadow/highlight adjustments and an uneven/unusual burn/darkening at the top.<br/>I would love to try my hand at the original after the challenge.</td>', 'A marvelous capture.The post-processing here hurts this for me. Perhaps too much shadow/highlight adjustments and an uneven/unusual burn/darkening at the top.I would love to try my hand at the original after the challenge.', '2006-09-07 01:38:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2808586, 388030, 47906, '<td valign="top">Watchout they spit... Great shot, nice reflection in the eyes and good DOF</td>', 'Watchout they spit... Great shot, nice reflection in the eyes and good DOF', '2006-09-07 01:38:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2808587, 387409, 47906, '<td valign="top">Nice Portrait.</td>', 'Nice Portrait.', '2006-09-07 01:39:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2808588, 377518, 19708, '<td valign="top">Certainly a unique image here in this challenge.<br/>The post-processing has taken this out of the realm of photography in my opinion. Have you tried this in a high-contrast black &amp; white?</td>', 'Certainly a unique image here in this challenge.The post-processing has taken this out of the realm of photography in my opinion. Have you tried this in a high-contrast black & white?', '2006-09-07 01:39:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2808593, 384133, 47906, '<td valign="top">Cool Shot, nice B&amp;W!</td>', 'Cool Shot, nice B&W!', '2006-09-07 01:40:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2808597, 382729, 50641, '<td valign="top">Oh, how joyful.... you should be really happy with this shot.  I love his burst of color, but I bet it would be fun to fool around with b/w or sepia too. The stopped water is great.</td>', 'Oh, how joyful.... you should be really happy with this shot.  I love his burst of color, but I bet it would be fun to fool around with b/w or sepia too. The stopped water is great.', '2006-09-07 01:40:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2808598, 385287, 23458, '<td valign="top">This is really cool... but I daresay that most people''s monitors won''t allow them to see what''s going on here. I can only just make it out on a laptop (which I find is generally brighter than most computer screens). 8.</td>', 'This is really cool... but I daresay that most people''s monitors won''t allow them to see what''s going on here. I can only just make it out on a laptop (which I find is generally brighter than most computer screens). 8.', '2006-09-07 01:41:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2808599, 384105, 33947, '<td valign="top">BEAUTIFUL, wet rays!!! Love the light on the trees. Neat mood.</td>', 'BEAUTIFUL, wet rays!!! Love the light on the trees. Neat mood.', '2006-09-07 01:41:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2808600, 388077, 19708, '<td valign="top">I can''t lace my finger on what is so unusual here.<br/>There is little really that is sharp/well-defined and the color palette seems off for some reason - I think - not sure I have ever seen one either.</td>', 'I can''t lace my finger on what is so unusual here.There is little really that is sharp/well-defined and the color palette seems off for some reason - I think - not sure I have ever seen one either.', '2006-09-07 01:41:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2808606, 376022, 47906, '<td valign="top">Nice detail. I like the B&amp;W especially on the roots.</td>', 'Nice detail. I like the B&W especially on the roots.', '2006-09-07 01:42:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2808607, 388687, 50641, '<td valign="top">Wow what depth and clarity.  Great clouds and wonderful subtle (non-nuclear) colors.  Only nit is that the frame might be a touch on the heavy side for this shot.</td>', 'Wow what depth and clarity.  Great clouds and wonderful subtle (non-nuclear) colors.  Only nit is that the frame might be a touch on the heavy side for this shot.', '2006-09-07 01:42:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2808611, 388921, 3214, '<td valign="top">I like the high contrast, and the composition--wishing there was a wee bit more detail in her fingers so they''d look less alien.  Nice rule of thirds!</td>', 'I like the high contrast, and the composition--wishing there was a wee bit more detail in her fingers so they''d look less alien.  Nice rule of thirds!', '2006-09-07 01:42:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2808612, 388967, 50641, '<td valign="top">I love stuff like this.  Nice texture on the wheel.  Might possibly reduce the cyan of the sky to make it a little more natural.</td>', 'I love stuff like this.  Nice texture on the wheel.  Might possibly reduce the cyan of the sky to make it a little more natural.', '2006-09-07 01:43:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2808620, 388822, 19708, '<td valign="top">I''m trying to find what is the main focal point / point of interest here.<br/>There really isn''t a main subject here to see and leaves me kind of losing interest.</td>', 'I''m trying to find what is the main focal point / point of interest here.There really isn''t a main subject here to see and leaves me kind of losing interest.', '2006-09-07 01:44:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2808621, 386620, 50641, '<td valign="top">Iconic.  Like the shadow.  If you didn''t intend for noise, could reduce. B/W was the right choice.</td>', 'Iconic.  Like the shadow.  If you didn''t intend for noise, could reduce. B/W was the right choice.', '2006-09-07 01:45:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2808623, 386242, 47906, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot, like the star in the lighthouse.</td>', 'Very nice shot, like the star in the lighthouse.', '2006-09-07 01:46:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2808627, 387711, 50641, '<td valign="top">Wow, did you process the eyes separately, or is it just a soft focus vignette?  Interesting treatment.</td>', 'Wow, did you process the eyes separately, or is it just a soft focus vignette?  Interesting treatment.', '2006-09-07 01:47:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2808632, 388670, 47906, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, great composition with the tracks going out the lower left</td>', 'Nice photo, great composition with the tracks going out the lower left', '2006-09-07 01:49:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2808635, 386911, 19708, '<td valign="top">Composition-wise seems a bit busy, but that''s just what it is.<br/>Overall, the white balance and/or tones is not really appealing, and wasn''t sure what to suggest, so I took it into Photoshop, adjusted the white balance and then dropped the levels and was a really big difference, especially in the sky.</td>', 'Composition-wise seems a bit busy, but that''s just what it is.Overall, the white balance and/or tones is not really appealing, and wasn''t sure what to suggest, so I took it into Photoshop, adjusted the white balance and then dropped the levels and was a really big difference, especially in the sky.', '2006-09-07 01:50:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2808639, 388127, 47906, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, looks like a greeting card. The red adds just the right amount of contrast</td>', 'Nice shot, looks like a greeting card. The red adds just the right amount of contrast', '2006-09-07 01:51:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2808641, 389037, 50641, '<td valign="top">I think the purple sets her hair off wonderfully. Love the flushed cheeks and the impish expression.</td>', 'I think the purple sets her hair off wonderfully. Love the flushed cheeks and the impish expression.', '2006-09-07 01:52:15.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2808644, 388988, 47906, '<td valign="top">Would have also done well in the single tree challenge, nice sharpness and colors</td>', 'Would have also done well in the single tree challenge, nice sharpness and colors', '2006-09-07 01:52:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2808647, 387283, 3214, '<td valign="top">OK, Lori. :-)  Nice highlight control, but I''d guess you''d be expert with that about Paints!  What a cutie pie!</td>', 'OK, Lori. :-)  Nice highlight control, but I''d guess you''d be expert with that about Paints!  What a cutie pie!', '2006-09-07 01:52:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2808648, 383689, 19708, '<td valign="top">Hard to know what to say other than Wow!<br/>Looks like something out of Hollywood, for a movie like End of Days.<br/>Only thing I kind of disliked was the lower corner vignette/darkened corners.</td>', 'Hard to know what to say other than Wow!Looks like something out of Hollywood, for a movie like End of Days.Only thing I kind of disliked was the lower corner vignette/darkened corners.', '2006-09-07 01:52:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2808652, 388541, 47906, '<td valign="top">Reall cute photo, nice portrait</td>', 'Reall cute photo, nice portrait', '2006-09-07 01:53:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2808657, 381916, 47906, '<td valign="top">Nice fireworks</td>', 'Nice fireworks', '2006-09-07 01:55:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2808660, 388306, 50641, '<td valign="top">Great smile!!  Take more pics of this fella, he''s very photogenic.</td>', 'Great smile!!  Take more pics of this fella, he''s very photogenic.', '2006-09-07 01:55:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2808661, 388990, 19708, '<td valign="top">Your crop/composition really works very well here.<br/>Nice to see the image grain in a great black &amp; white, when the trend seems to be smooth things over, even to the point of looking like plastic skin.<br/>Only thing I could suggest would be having the crop in such a way as he is looking into the frame, rather than out of it, but then again it wouldn''t have the smae feel. Nevermind ignore me, I''m a lunatic - lol<br/>Well done!</td>', 'Your crop/composition really works very well here.Nice to see the image grain in a great black & white, when the trend seems to be smooth things over, even to the point of looking like plastic skin.Only thing I could suggest would be having the crop in such a way as he is looking into the frame, rather than out of it, but then again it wouldn''t have the smae feel. Nevermind ignore me, I''m a lunatic - lolWell done!', '2006-09-07 01:55:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2808663, 386910, 47906, '<td valign="top">To dark around face, overall nice portrait.</td>', 'To dark around face, overall nice portrait.', '2006-09-07 01:56:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2808669, 386658, 47906, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sky. nice clouds. Beautiful contrast in the water colors</td>', 'Beautiful sky. nice clouds. Beautiful contrast in the water colors', '2006-09-07 01:58:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2808673, 376642, 47906, '<td valign="top">Really cool shot, would make good screen saver.</td>', 'Really cool shot, would make good screen saver.', '2006-09-07 01:59:38.000000', NULL, 1),
