(2808955, 385287, 19708, '<td valign="top">I can only imagine the comments from those without calibrated monitors, as this is really on the border of very little visible.<br/>A bit too obscure and sinister in appearance for my taste.</td>', 'I can only imagine the comments from those without calibrated monitors, as this is really on the border of very little visible.A bit too obscure and sinister in appearance for my taste.', '2006-09-07 04:37:56.000000', NULL, 1),
