(2809215, 387520, 31230, '<td valign="top">What a great portrait but it seems blurry.  You shot her well.  You got down to her level instead of shooting her from above but you need to change your focal point to her eyes.  Kids have amazing eyes and if you get those right you will have a stunning portrait every time.</td>', 'What a great portrait but it seems blurry.  You shot her well.  You got down to her level instead of shooting her from above but you need to change your focal point to her eyes.  Kids have amazing eyes and if you get those right you will have a stunning portrait every time.', '2006-09-07 07:15:22.000000', NULL, 1),
