(2809225, 384907, 31230, '<td valign="top">Now thats just odd.  I like your composition though.  I even like the tilt it actually add to the oddness of the shot. Your light is nice</td>', 'Now thats just odd.  I like your composition though.  I even like the tilt it actually add to the oddness of the shot. Your light is nice', '2006-09-07 07:17:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2809246, 387711, 19708, '<td valign="top">Besides being a very nice and flattering pose, the detail in her eyes is an excellent focal point. Nice work in the post-processing!</td>', 'Besides being a very nice and flattering pose, the detail in her eyes is an excellent focal point. Nice work in the post-processing!', '2006-09-07 07:30:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2809249, 388402, 19708, '<td valign="top">Spectacular timing on this shot!!<br/>The detail and depth of field <i>(pun intended)</i> is great!!</td>', 'Spectacular timing on this shot!!The detail and depth of field (pun intended) is great!!', '2006-09-07 07:32:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2809250, 385577, 31230, '<td valign="top">I don''t get your title.  Is that the term for a femail skate boarder?  As far as your shot I like it.</td>', 'I don''t get your title.  Is that the term for a femail skate boarder?  As far as your shot I like it.', '2006-09-07 07:33:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2809256, 387709, 19708, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot, and one of the better butterfly shots I have seen in a while.<br/>Minor sharpening halo, but easy enough to clean up.  Well done.</td>', 'Very nice shot, and one of the better butterfly shots I have seen in a while.Minor sharpening halo, but easy enough to clean up.  Well done.', '2006-09-07 07:36:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2809267, 388619, 19708, '<td valign="top">Ok, this is dumb.<br/>Still made me smile though :)<br/>Technically not great with the harsh shadow, but I still grinned...</td>', 'Ok, this is dumb.Still made me smile though :)Technically not great with the harsh shadow, but I still grinned...', '2006-09-07 07:45:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2809273, 379442, 19708, '<td valign="top">Was a tobacco ND gradient filter used here? <i>(I have one)</i> <br/>The un-natural color is not really too pleasing to me, and would have probably liked this better in black &amp; white, but then the title wouldn''t fit ;)</td>', 'Was a tobacco ND gradient filter used here? (I have one) The un-natural color is not really too pleasing to me, and would have probably liked this better in black & white, but then the title wouldn''t fit ;)', '2006-09-07 07:47:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2809278, 375068, 19708, '<td valign="top">With the dead-on focal point and the levels here, the one fish is a bit difficult to see and doesn''t stand out well in a busy background.</td>', 'With the dead-on focal point and the levels here, the one fish is a bit difficult to see and doesn''t stand out well in a busy background.', '2006-09-07 07:49:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2809281, 385811, 19708, '<td valign="top">The center of this flower would would have made so much more of an impact in this shot had it been tack sharp.</td>', 'The center of this flower would would have made so much more of an impact in this shot had it been tack sharp.', '2006-09-07 07:50:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2809291, 383911, 16004, '<td valign="top">gave this one a 10.  the level of detail is quite stunning, and though macros of insects are becoming quite the frequent subject here on dpc, rarely is it done so spectacularly as this.  his little furry body, and the liquidy appearance of the wings are so interesting!  and (for an insect) he is displaying such personailty and cute characteristics, busily working away in a world of contentment, concentrating on the pollen - you can easily imagine him happily humming kaiser chief songs to himself (i think it''s an indie bee).  composition is a little bit too in yer face for me; stepping back a bit to give greater context from the surroundings might have enhanced the overall appeal a bit.  but still stunning nonetheless.</td>', 'gave this one a 10.  the level of detail is quite stunning, and though macros of insects are becoming quite the frequent subject here on dpc, rarely is it done so spectacularly as this.  his little furry body, and the liquidy appearance of the wings are so interesting!  and (for an insect) he is displaying such personailty and cute characteristics, busily working away in a world of contentment, concentrating on the pollen - you can easily imagine him happily humming kaiser chief songs to himself (i think it''s an indie bee).  composition is a little bit too in yer face for me; stepping back a bit to give greater context from the surroundings might have enhanced the overall appeal a bit.  but still stunning nonetheless.', '2006-09-07 07:53:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2809314, 387689, 38032, '<td valign="top">Defiinitely reminds me of my trips to lake McCray .... not sure if I spelled that right but you''ve captured the essence of that area - -is that a canoe in the forground? I wonder .... The distant horizon begs for a slight rotation but other than that extremely beautiful. 8</td>', 'Defiinitely reminds me of my trips to lake McCray .... not sure if I spelled that right but you''ve captured the essence of that area - -is that a canoe in the forground? I wonder .... The distant horizon begs for a slight rotation but other than that extremely beautiful. 8', '2006-09-07 07:58:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2809330, 386391, 38032, '<td valign="top">This is a great location and  great POV  - I think the model needs to be more prominent or something.  It''s as if I wonder why she''s half nude  - and what is her expression exactly ... hopfully this makes sense.  The shadow and water on the floor are quite interesting too. I guess this needs to be viewed bigger the way it is composed is wht I am saying. 7</td>', 'This is a great location and  great POV  - I think the model needs to be more prominent or something.  It''s as if I wonder why she''s half nude  - and what is her expression exactly ... hopfully this makes sense.  The shadow and water on the floor are quite interesting too. I guess this needs to be viewed bigger the way it is composed is wht I am saying. 7', '2006-09-07 08:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2809344, 378856, 38032, '<td valign="top">This is different and emotional horse imagery. 8</td>', 'This is different and emotional horse imagery. 8', '2006-09-07 08:07:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2809346, 387498, 38032, '<td valign="top">This is striking and super cute.</td>', 'This is striking and super cute.', '2006-09-07 08:07:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2809369, 384717, 16004, '<td valign="top">i gave this a 6.  as a choice of subject, i like it; it''s obviously structurally knackered, and the amount of delapidation gives the house both a sense of age, and a sense of a sad, unloved history.  i also like the pleasing use of symmetry, and how it is bordered by the drain pipes on either side.  what tones down it''s WOW! is the bland colour of the brickwork that seems to infiltrate everything, including the windows and window frames.  changing to b&amp;w and really maxing the contrast might have enhanced the grunginess appeal somewhat.  i''d also like to see how a close-up photograph of the number 100 with the house as a softer background might look...</td>', 'i gave this a 6.  as a choice of subject, i like it; it''s obviously structurally knackered, and the amount of delapidation gives the house both a sense of age, and a sense of a sad, unloved history.  i also like the pleasing use of symmetry, and how it is bordered by the drain pipes on either side.  what tones down it''s WOW! is the bland colour of the brickwork that seems to infiltrate everything, including the windows and window frames.  changing to b&w and really maxing the contrast might have enhanced the grunginess appeal somewhat.  i''d also like to see how a close-up photograph of the number 100 with the house as a softer background might look...', '2006-09-07 08:16:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2809428, 375837, 20941, '<td valign="top">beautifully detailed and skillfully composed, this is a fantastic elephant portrait!</td>', 'beautifully detailed and skillfully composed, this is a fantastic elephant portrait!', '2006-09-07 08:50:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2809436, 387690, 20941, '<td valign="top">minimalism at it''s best! fantastic capture with vibrance and clarity</td>', 'minimalism at it''s best! fantastic capture with vibrance and clarity', '2006-09-07 08:53:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2809446, 381208, 20941, '<td valign="top">great angle and detail the steeley color adds to the sense of power to this image</td>', 'great angle and detail the steeley color adds to the sense of power to this image', '2006-09-07 08:55:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2809460, 384877, 23430, '<td valign="top">Great model and very nice light.</td>', 'Great model and very nice light.', '2006-09-07 09:02:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2809512, 384243, 30049, '<td valign="top">Lovely cat, and so much potential with this shot...if only it was in focus.  :(  If those eyes and the nose were tack sharp this would be rocking!  Poster potential.  Best of luck in the challenge to you.</td>', 'Lovely cat, and so much potential with this shot...if only it was in focus.  :(  If those eyes and the nose were tack sharp this would be rocking!  Poster potential.  Best of luck in the challenge to you.', '2006-09-07 09:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2809550, 388698, 56828, '<td valign="top">Nice capture and color.  The fence sort of takes away from the photo for me.</td>', 'Nice capture and color.  The fence sort of takes away from the photo for me.', '2006-09-07 09:43:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2809557, 388984, 56828, '<td valign="top">The pupils of her eyes look a little off.  They probably should have been darkened some to give them a none ghostly look.  The overall crop and color of the photos is done well.</td>', 'The pupils of her eyes look a little off.  They probably should have been darkened some to give them a none ghostly look.  The overall crop and color of the photos is done well.', '2006-09-07 09:45:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2809558, 388657, 56828, '<td valign="top">Great work.  Nice DOF.  Gorgeous eyes.  The negative space on the left actually enhances the photo.  Great color.</td>', 'Great work.  Nice DOF.  Gorgeous eyes.  The negative space on the left actually enhances the photo.  Great color.', '2006-09-07 09:46:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2809563, 388332, 56828, '<td valign="top">nice use of selective color</td>', 'nice use of selective color', '2006-09-07 09:48:10.000000', NULL, 1);
