(2809627, 388751, 35545, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but it looks as if it''s tilting to the left.  (Look at the horizontal lines of the bricks.)  Maybe if you had taken this head-on you could have avoided this.  It''s a distractin.  Nice view through the window, though.</td>', 'Good idea, but it looks as if it''s tilting to the left.  (Look at the horizontal lines of the bricks.)  Maybe if you had taken this head-on you could have avoided this.  It''s a distractin.  Nice view through the window, though.', '2006-09-07 10:14:46.000000', NULL, 1),
