(2809801, 384243, 16780, '<td valign="top">I have a black cat &amp; know how hard it is to get a good lit pic of them.  The lighting is really good in this one, but I''d like to see a stronger focus on the eyes to really make them jump out at you.  The softness takes away it''s strength.  At least yours kept it''s eyes open ;)  Mine always blink.</td>', 'I have a black cat & know how hard it is to get a good lit pic of them.  The lighting is really good in this one, but I''d like to see a stronger focus on the eyes to really make them jump out at you.  The softness takes away it''s strength.  At least yours kept it''s eyes open ;)  Mine always blink.', '2006-09-07 10:54:38.000000', NULL, 1),
