(2809964, 374261, 30049, '<td valign="top">Oh, that''s so sad!  Here the kid is crying and obviously distressed, yet you''ve found time to set up and take a photo?!  I''d comment on the quality of the image, lighting, exposure, etc...but can''t speak objectively as I find the image too unsettling.  I guess if you''re looking for an emotive response from viewers, you''ve garnered one here.  :(</td>', 'Oh, that''s so sad!  Here the kid is crying and obviously distressed, yet you''ve found time to set up and take a photo?!  I''d comment on the quality of the image, lighting, exposure, etc...but can''t speak objectively as I find the image too unsettling.  I guess if you''re looking for an emotive response from viewers, you''ve garnered one here.  :(', '2006-09-07 11:34:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2809980, 387675, 46097, '<td valign="top">I would say that improved lighting would strengthen this. The wilting, bug-chewed petals up top, and the busy background to the left distract me a bit. But I find the focal point nicely sharp, and the depth of field is good too.</td>', 'I would say that improved lighting would strengthen this. The wilting, bug-chewed petals up top, and the busy background to the left distract me a bit. But I find the focal point nicely sharp, and the depth of field is good too.', '2006-09-07 11:39:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2809989, 387868, 30049, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=449990&amp;highlight=dock%20dog" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Photographing Dockdogs</a> <br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=382997" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/35739/thumb/382997.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/35739/thumb/382997.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/35739/thumb/382997.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>What a coincidence...these dogs look very similar.  Hmmm...<br/> <br/>Anyway, a cool shot, but looks to be oversharpened.</td>', 'Photographing Dockdogs    What a coincidence...these dogs look very similar.  Hmmm... Anyway, a cool shot, but looks to be oversharpened.', '2006-09-07 11:44:43.000000', NULL, 1),
