(2810177, 388872, 43463, '<td valign="top">What I like about this photograph is the sense of movement &amp; light of the wheel in the foreground AND the circular shapes present in both the foreground &amp; background. The colors are vibrant and rich. The composition as it stands now I would rate just as average but the image does have potential to move into the above average as that it has many appealing elements to it. Shapes, color, movement are all there but what is detracting in the composition is the inclusion of the people at the bottom of the image. That added element takes attention away from the main attraction/main focus of your image which are the two wheels dominating the scene. Crop the people out of the composition and you really have a visually appealing nighttime scene of the amusement park rides.</td>', 'What I like about this photograph is the sense of movement & light of the wheel in the foreground AND the circular shapes present in both the foreground & background. The colors are vibrant and rich. The composition as it stands now I would rate just as average but the image does have potential to move into the above average as that it has many appealing elements to it. Shapes, color, movement are all there but what is detracting in the composition is the inclusion of the people at the bottom of the image. That added element takes attention away from the main attraction/main focus of your image which are the two wheels dominating the scene. Crop the people out of the composition and you really have a visually appealing nighttime scene of the amusement park rides.', '2006-09-07 12:49:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2810179, 380991, 13026, '<td valign="top">oh my, i love this.  8</td>', 'oh my, i love this.  8', '2006-09-07 12:50:33.000000', NULL, 1),
