(2810208, 386459, 30049, '<td valign="top">I''m looking around for a person.  ;^)  Too bad you couldn''t have had a kid in one of the fringe seats where you could just see most of his/her head.  Very cool color in this shot, kind of glows.  Crop is non-traditional, even for a panoramic look (you''re 650 on the long side, the short should be 325).  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I''m looking around for a person.  ;^)  Too bad you couldn''t have had a kid in one of the fringe seats where you could just see most of his/her head.  Very cool color in this shot, kind of glows.  Crop is non-traditional, even for a panoramic look (you''re 650 on the long side, the short should be 325).  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-09-07 13:03:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2810213, 388912, 43463, '<td valign="top">First off this is an adorable shot showing sibling love. Lighting is good and the color hues are soft in tone conveying a the mood of a tender moment. I like the added touch of the boy on the right holding his sister''s hand. Compositionally this is good but could be even better. The reason? The boy on the right''s kiss on his sister''s head is lost behind her bow. And the boy on the right kiss is not as visible as it could be. Had both boys heads been in profile perfectly symmetrical on either side of their sister''s forehead it would FURTHER capture a enduring moment where all facial features of everyone in the shot is wonderfully visible.</td>', 'First off this is an adorable shot showing sibling love. Lighting is good and the color hues are soft in tone conveying a the mood of a tender moment. I like the added touch of the boy on the right holding his sister''s hand. Compositionally this is good but could be even better. The reason? The boy on the right''s kiss on his sister''s head is lost behind her bow. And the boy on the right kiss is not as visible as it could be. Had both boys heads been in profile perfectly symmetrical on either side of their sister''s forehead it would FURTHER capture a enduring moment where all facial features of everyone in the shot is wonderfully visible.', '2006-09-07 13:05:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2810215, 388729, 30049, '<td valign="top">The kid really brings this together.  While this image could have stood on it''s own with the beautiful scenery, having an active subject is the icing on the cake.  Well done!</td>', 'The kid really brings this together.  While this image could have stood on it''s own with the beautiful scenery, having an active subject is the icing on the cake.  Well done!', '2006-09-07 13:05:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2810221, 388921, 30049, '<td valign="top">What a wonderful doll!  Is this available at stores only in your area?  It looks so real, my daughter would love one.  I like the lighting you''ve used in this, nice contrast and shadows.  The dolls hand looks overexposed perhaps a little.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'What a wonderful doll!  Is this available at stores only in your area?  It looks so real, my daughter would love one.  I like the lighting you''ve used in this, nice contrast and shadows.  The dolls hand looks overexposed perhaps a little.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-09-07 13:09:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2810234, 388857, 43463, '<td valign="top">Happy, carefree, childhood days just spend laying in the grass at the park is what this photo communicates to me. The pose of the little girl with her feet raised &amp; crossed and her laying in the grass with head resting in her hands is a classic pose that communicates a carefree moment just enjoying the breezy summer/spring day. I like the sepia look for it adds a nostalgic look and feel to it. And by far it is that wonderful and adorable SMILE that makes this photo such a feel good &amp; happy one. Great shot - bumping up from 7 to 9 to move it into the exceptional good category.</td>', 'Happy, carefree, childhood days just spend laying in the grass at the park is what this photo communicates to me. The pose of the little girl with her feet raised & crossed and her laying in the grass with head resting in her hands is a classic pose that communicates a carefree moment just enjoying the breezy summer/spring day. I like the sepia look for it adds a nostalgic look and feel to it. And by far it is that wonderful and adorable SMILE that makes this photo such a feel good & happy one. Great shot - bumping up from 7 to 9 to move it into the exceptional good category.', '2006-09-07 13:13:06.000000', NULL, 1),
