(2810327, 386832, 53095, '<td valign="top">A little too noisey for my liking.</td>', 'A little too noisey for my liking.', '2006-09-07 13:28:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2810341, 383713, 43463, '<td valign="top">The colors are absolutely rich and vibrant where they need to be. Love how you have a range of beautiful rich greens in differnt shades and tones in this composition. The slight spotlight that illuminates the chameleon is wonderful! It serves to illuminate the background just behind it creating a warm, rich green ''glow'' on your subject all the while perfectly lighting the lovely greens &amp; details of this lizard. The square crop is a nice addition too because it keeps attention tightly focused on your main subject.</td>', 'The colors are absolutely rich and vibrant where they need to be. Love how you have a range of beautiful rich greens in differnt shades and tones in this composition. The slight spotlight that illuminates the chameleon is wonderful! It serves to illuminate the background just behind it creating a warm, rich green ''glow'' on your subject all the while perfectly lighting the lovely greens & details of this lizard. The square crop is a nice addition too because it keeps attention tightly focused on your main subject.', '2006-09-07 13:32:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2810342, 379739, 38732, '<td valign="top">Great capture!  Love the processing, particularly how the cows stand out against the dark background.  What really impresses me is the formation that these cows are standing in.  Bumping up!</td>', 'Great capture!  Love the processing, particularly how the cows stand out against the dark background.  What really impresses me is the formation that these cows are standing in.  Bumping up!', '2006-09-07 13:32:49.000000', NULL, 1),
