(2811063, 388978, 42100, '<td valign="top">Very weird looking bug, kind of looks like something George Lucas would make-up for his next movie.  I like the bright color and high-keyness of this.  Well done!</td>', 'Very weird looking bug, kind of looks like something George Lucas would make-up for his next movie.  I like the bright color and high-keyness of this.  Well done!', '2006-09-07 16:27:21.000000', NULL, 1),
