(2811093, 386660, 42100, '<td valign="top">Crazy pose, would of been good for the rope challenge.  Some very, very nice color tones and detail in this photo.  Great job!</td>', 'Crazy pose, would of been good for the rope challenge.  Some very, very nice color tones and detail in this photo.  Great job!', '2006-09-07 16:32:43.000000', NULL, 1),
