(2811146, 388178, 50641, '<td valign="top">Yes, me too. I''ve been trying to do backlit gooseberries and tomatillos this summer. The warm light really works here. I''ll have to try that.  Good luck :)</td>', 'Yes, me too. I''ve been trying to do backlit gooseberries and tomatillos this summer. The warm light really works here. I''ll have to try that.  Good luck :)', '2006-09-07 16:49:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2811151, 388712, 4411, '<td valign="top">Nice capture. Can just about see the drivers eyes too. Of course Holden kick Ford backside, but it''s great to see one of these V8 monsters on DPC anyway. ;)</td>', 'Nice capture. Can just about see the drivers eyes too. Of course Holden kick Ford backside, but it''s great to see one of these V8 monsters on DPC anyway. ;)', '2006-09-07 16:51:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2811156, 386667, 50641, '<td valign="top">I dunno. There is a distortion here, perhaps from the perspective(?), that  my eye isn''t crazy about.  The lighting and tonality are very good though.</td>', 'I dunno. There is a distortion here, perhaps from the perspective(?), that  my eye isn''t crazy about.  The lighting and tonality are very good though.', '2006-09-07 16:52:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2811160, 387130, 4411, '<td valign="top">One of those times where we need two photos. As beautiful as this is, I want to see her eyes, yet that shot wouldn''t be the same as this one and I would miss that great peacock-feather makeup. I wanna see more post challenge :)</td>', 'One of those times where we need two photos. As beautiful as this is, I want to see her eyes, yet that shot wouldn''t be the same as this one and I would miss that great peacock-feather makeup. I wanna see more post challenge :)', '2006-09-07 16:54:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2811167, 387806, 4411, '<td valign="top">Excellent. The processing suits this down to the ground. Love the patterns.</td>', 'Excellent. The processing suits this down to the ground. Love the patterns.', '2006-09-07 16:55:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2811169, 388327, 16197, '<td valign="top">cute idea, just not bold enough for me.  The lightpost is distracting and very small image for as much as is going on.</td>', 'cute idea, just not bold enough for me.  The lightpost is distracting and very small image for as much as is going on.', '2006-09-07 16:56:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2811171, 385057, 16197, '<td valign="top">Nice cute idea.  Maybe if it was a touch darker around them on the ground and more highlight on them.  Give them an glow one might say.  But very nice.</td>', 'Nice cute idea.  Maybe if it was a touch darker around them on the ground and more highlight on them.  Give them an glow one might say.  But very nice.', '2006-09-07 16:56:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2811172, 388760, 50641, '<td valign="top">Sharp :)</td>', 'Sharp :)', '2006-09-07 16:56:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2811173, 382060, 4411, '<td valign="top">Nice bit of zoom! Seems sharper in the top corner than in the middle, but still one heck of an achievement. The moon rocks. Literally.</td>', 'Nice bit of zoom! Seems sharper in the top corner than in the middle, but still one heck of an achievement. The moon rocks. Literally.', '2006-09-07 16:56:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2811176, 385257, 16197, '<td valign="top">Very nice action shot.  Great Capture.  Just needs to bump the colour up more for extra POP!</td>', 'Very nice action shot.  Great Capture.  Just needs to bump the colour up more for extra POP!', '2006-09-07 16:57:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2811178, 386028, 48717, '<td valign="top">BEAUTIFUL!!!!<br/> <br/>Nothing else to say...well wait...maybe I would have cloned out the poles in the water...but that is the only thing.</td>', 'BEAUTIFUL!!!! Nothing else to say...well wait...maybe I would have cloned out the poles in the water...but that is the only thing.', '2006-09-07 16:58:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2811179, 385245, 16197, '<td valign="top">This is a really great image.  Might look into sellin it to the National Dairy Industry or such.  Very wll done.  Just maybe a touch lighter in the eyes to make them more visable.</td>', 'This is a really great image.  Might look into sellin it to the National Dairy Industry or such.  Very wll done.  Just maybe a touch lighter in the eyes to make them more visable.', '2006-09-07 16:58:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2811182, 386588, 16197, '<td valign="top">I have a feeling I have been here before.... Nice fun capture, Just needs an extra POP! for colour maybe some curves adjustment will do it.</td>', 'I have a feeling I have been here before.... Nice fun capture, Just needs an extra POP! for colour maybe some curves adjustment will do it.', '2006-09-07 16:59:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2811186, 388309, 16197, '<td valign="top">not really a stand of if you''re the only one... Nice eagle capture.  I think this is the 5th or so I have seen and only 25% through them L()L.  Nice details in the body feathers... yet the head feathers are a little washed out.  But nice as well.  Just something is missing for me.  But a good capture overall.</td>', 'not really a stand of if you''re the only one... Nice eagle capture.  I think this is the 5th or so I have seen and only 25% through them L()L.  Nice details in the body feathers... yet the head feathers are a little washed out.  But nice as well.  Just something is missing for me.  But a good capture overall.', '2006-09-07 17:00:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2811189, 386384, 16197, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture. Seems to be working well.  Except for the clouds.  Maybe up the levels/curves and see what happens.  But a nice positioning on them.</td>', 'Very nice capture. Seems to be working well.  Except for the clouds.  Maybe up the levels/curves and see what happens.  But a nice positioning on them.', '2006-09-07 17:01:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2811194, 389012, 16197, '<td valign="top">Nice snapshot for the photo album.  Colours seems a touch flat for my taste.</td>', 'Nice snapshot for the photo album.  Colours seems a touch flat for my taste.', '2006-09-07 17:02:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2811197, 388945, 16197, '<td valign="top">Very cute little guy.  Don''t know what the colours are like but might be better.  Or maybe hand in b/w and the little friend in colour make him Pop! more.</td>', 'Very cute little guy.  Don''t know what the colours are like but might be better.  Or maybe hand in b/w and the little friend in colour make him Pop! more.', '2006-09-07 17:03:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2811199, 388897, 16197, '<td valign="top">Fun little capture.  Needs a touch more WOW factor, maybe in colour or movement.</td>', 'Fun little capture.  Needs a touch more WOW factor, maybe in colour or movement.', '2006-09-07 17:03:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2811200, 388655, 16197, '<td valign="top">Nice sky grad, ladder looks fun, just doesn''t do anything for me.  To me its a really boring image.nothing going on.</td>', 'Nice sky grad, ladder looks fun, just doesn''t do anything for me.  To me its a really boring image.nothing going on.', '2006-09-07 17:04:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2811202, 388556, 16197, '<td valign="top">Fun backlighting on this guy.  Just maybe two dark on the front.  Doesn''t need a lot more light, just a touch.</td>', 'Fun backlighting on this guy.  Just maybe two dark on the front.  Doesn''t need a lot more light, just a touch.', '2006-09-07 17:05:26.000000', NULL, 1),
