(2811208, 388803, 16197, '<td valign="top">This is Almost really cool.  Needs to be worked a touch more.  The idea.  Something just doesn''t balance to me.  Maybe the flares reflecting or the tilt.  Just doesn''t hold right.</td>', 'This is Almost really cool.  Needs to be worked a touch more.  The idea.  Something just doesn''t balance to me.  Maybe the flares reflecting or the tilt.  Just doesn''t hold right.', '2006-09-07 17:07:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2811212, 388590, 16197, '<td valign="top">nice soft image here.  I personaly don''t care for the haze.  It is always much better in person.  But still fairly nice.  Eyes stay mostly in the center image and dont'' move around to much.</td>', 'nice soft image here.  I personaly don''t care for the haze.  It is always much better in person.  But still fairly nice.  Eyes stay mostly in the center image and dont'' move around to much.', '2006-09-07 17:08:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2811213, 388978, 50641, '<td valign="top">I love caterpillar shots, but maybe changing the orientation on this might help make him recognizeable.  In any case, great capture.</td>', 'I love caterpillar shots, but maybe changing the orientation on this might help make him recognizeable.  In any case, great capture.', '2006-09-07 17:09:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2811214, 383553, 16197, '<td valign="top">Looks like you took the comments I had on the other hummingbird image and implemented them here.  Its a nice capture good colours.  Still missing something though.</td>', 'Looks like you took the comments I had on the other hummingbird image and implemented them here.  Its a nice capture good colours.  Still missing something though.', '2006-09-07 17:09:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2811219, 388978, 35602, '<td valign="top">Thanks for taking this pic.  I took one a few weeks ago of the same caterpiller but couldn''t place what it was.  This is a very nice photo.  The green moss is nicely detailed.  The caterpiller is a bit dark, though.  I also think there may be too much white space around it.</td>', 'Thanks for taking this pic.  I took one a few weeks ago of the same caterpiller but couldn''t place what it was.  This is a very nice photo.  The green moss is nicely detailed.  The caterpiller is a bit dark, though.  I also think there may be too much white space around it.', '2006-09-07 17:09:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2811222, 387842, 50641, '<td valign="top">Subtly wonderful.</td>', 'Subtly wonderful.', '2006-09-07 17:10:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2811224, 388985, 16197, '<td valign="top">Nice clearity, action, good since of the game.  But I think it would have been more apealing to get a ''Cruch'' shot or even a ''Snot Bubble'' shot.  Those are the ones people remember.  But very nice.</td>', 'Nice clearity, action, good since of the game.  But I think it would have been more apealing to get a ''Cruch'' shot or even a ''Snot Bubble'' shot.  Those are the ones people remember.  But very nice.', '2006-09-07 17:10:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2811230, 386580, 16197, '<td valign="top">Cute image.  have a couple spects that might should have been taken care of.  But eveyrthing seems to work here... Except maybe the right and left open edges.  To me it cuts the image off short and makes me feel cheated.</td>', 'Cute image.  have a couple spects that might should have been taken care of.  But eveyrthing seems to work here... Except maybe the right and left open edges.  To me it cuts the image off short and makes me feel cheated.', '2006-09-07 17:11:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2811232, 385245, 35602, '<td valign="top">Interesting angle.  I think the cow is too shadowed, though.  To get the sky so nicely kind of affected the exposure of the cow.  Did you try adjusting brightness on cow to give more detail, in post processing?</td>', 'Interesting angle.  I think the cow is too shadowed, though.  To get the sky so nicely kind of affected the exposure of the cow.  Did you try adjusting brightness on cow to give more detail, in post processing?', '2006-09-07 17:11:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2811234, 388114, 50641, '<td valign="top">Some outlining issues but I like the cartoony/arty feel.</td>', 'Some outlining issues but I like the cartoony/arty feel.', '2006-09-07 17:12:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2811235, 389018, 16197, '<td valign="top">Very cute little critter ya got there.  Nice image nice light nice colours. Very Cute.</td>', 'Very cute little critter ya got there.  Nice image nice light nice colours. Very Cute.', '2006-09-07 17:12:19.000000', NULL, 1),
