(2813645, 375823, 13077, '<td valign="top">I like it. Good composition, nice bright colors, and attractive scenery. It''s a shame the sky is blown out, I think a grad ND or some processing would help there - having a dark and saturated part at the top of cloudy skies can really help the image sometimes.</td>', 'I like it. Good composition, nice bright colors, and attractive scenery. It''s a shame the sky is blown out, I think a grad ND or some processing would help there - having a dark and saturated part at the top of cloudy skies can really help the image sometimes.', '2006-09-08 01:42:21.000000', NULL, 0),
