(2813675, 375823, 48560, '<td valign="top">Leroy, this is good work. I liked the vivid colours and also the ripples in the water (refreshing compared to longer exposed, smooth silky waters). If there''s anything thing at all that I''d like to point out, it''s the distracting tilt/rotation that the photo seems to appear - they seem to lean to the right. Overall, good photo and worthy attempt at landscape.<br/> <br/>crayon</td>', 'Leroy, this is good work. I liked the vivid colours and also the ripples in the water (refreshing compared to longer exposed, smooth silky waters). If there''s anything thing at all that I''d like to point out, it''s the distracting tilt/rotation that the photo seems to appear - they seem to lean to the right. Overall, good photo and worthy attempt at landscape. crayon', '2006-09-08 01:54:17.000000', NULL, 0),
