(2814213, 384387, 24744, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by lahulfman:</b></div><hr/><i> boost the colours to help make shot stronger </i></td></tr></table> <br/>But i don''t want to make the shot stronger, it''s meant to be subtle!<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by levyj413:</b></div><hr/><i> Where is it currently Autumn? :)  I can see the photo has the "feeling" of Autumn, but given the date of the challenge, it jars me. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>In scotland, it''s ALWAYS autumn...<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by yantski:</b></div><hr/><i> Is this that muted, or is there some desat? </i></td></tr></table> <br/>No desat, in fact some selective increase in contrast.</td>', 'Originally posted by lahulfman: boost the colours to help make shot stronger  But i don''t want to make the shot stronger, it''s meant to be subtle! Originally posted by levyj413: Where is it currently Autumn? :)  I can see the photo has the "feeling" of Autumn, but given the date of the challenge, it jars me.  In scotland, it''s ALWAYS autumn... Originally posted by yantski: Is this that muted, or is there some desat?  No desat, in fact some selective increase in contrast.', '2006-09-08 08:04:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(2814225, 388830, 18722, '<td valign="top">I love the colors on this -- most of all the distinction between the leaf and the similarly colored background -- absolutely great.<br/> <br/>I would however offer the timid advice of a more dynamic angle for the main subject -- the horizontally flat composition saps a great deal of energy from this vibrant image.<br/> <br/>David</td>', 'I love the colors on this -- most of all the distinction between the leaf and the similarly colored background -- absolutely great. I would however offer the timid advice of a more dynamic angle for the main subject -- the horizontally flat composition saps a great deal of energy from this vibrant image. David', '2006-09-08 08:09:08.000000', NULL, 0),
