(2814258, 386053, 40386, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot Lynne, I only got to vote on 54% of this challenge and didnt get to this but I love it, Miss Twix has sure turned out to be a beautiful girl!  Love the rim light.</td>', 'Lovely shot Lynne, I only got to vote on 54% of this challenge and didnt get to this but I love it, Miss Twix has sure turned out to be a beautiful girl!  Love the rim light.', '2006-09-08 08:25:36.000000', NULL, 0),
