(2814414, 388661, 37961, '<td valign="top">Dumb Question of the day: What do you focus on in a situation like this? Obviously I don''t do much wildlife shooting. Did you meter on the sky? I guess I''m having trouble imagining time to meter and focus on the bird in flight?</td>', 'Dumb Question of the day: What do you focus on in a situation like this? Obviously I don''t do much wildlife shooting. Did you meter on the sky? I guess I''m having trouble imagining time to meter and focus on the bird in flight?', '2006-09-08 09:36:10.000000', NULL, 0),
