(2814426, 384769, 31403, '<td valign="top">so because it''s not big enough voters punish you to THIS extent?  This is ridiculous.  No matter what size this is great composition and should be voted on for the photography.<br/> <br/>I''m sorry.  If I could change the small minded voting trends I would - :-)</td>', 'so because it''s not big enough voters punish you to THIS extent?  This is ridiculous.  No matter what size this is great composition and should be voted on for the photography. I''m sorry.  If I could change the small minded voting trends I would - :-)', '2006-09-08 09:39:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(2814428, 387755, 12827, '<td valign="top">I can''t believe this didn''t do better! Better luck next time!!</td>', 'I can''t believe this didn''t do better! Better luck next time!!', '2006-09-08 09:41:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(2814430, 387738, 61679, '<td valign="top">Hello from the Critique Club.<br/> <br/>What are the odds that I would be assigned both this image and your silhouette entry to critique?  It is really amazing how much lighting can change the mood of an image.  You received a considerable number of comments on this image regarding the lightings and I have to agree with most of them.  The how and where to change the lighting I''m not technically competent enough to give you advise on but I encourage you to post this to the forums and ask for lighting suggestions.  <br/> <br/>One aspect I think was missed by those who commented is the lack of sharpness in the fireman''s eyes.  His expression for this image is exceptional but the lack of sharpness kept me from locking in on his eyes and making the emotional attachment that this image demands.  You have an image here that could be exceptional with a few technical changes.  I hope you have the time and interest to re-shoot this image sometime in the future.<br/> <br/>Tim<br/></td>', 'Hello from the Critique Club. What are the odds that I would be assigned both this image and your silhouette entry to critique?  It is really amazing how much lighting can change the mood of an image.  You received a considerable number of comments on this image regarding the lightings and I have to agree with most of them.  The how and where to change the lighting I''m not technically competent enough to give you advise on but I encourage you to post this to the forums and ask for lighting suggestions.   One aspect I think was missed by those who commented is the lack of sharpness in the fireman''s eyes.  His expression for this image is exceptional but the lack of sharpness kept me from locking in on his eyes and making the emotional attachment that this image demands.  You have an image here that could be exceptional with a few technical changes.  I hope you have the time and interest to re-shoot this image sometime in the future. Tim', '2006-09-08 09:42:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(2814435, 383713, 50142, '<td valign="top">I did not vote on this one, but it definately would''ve gotten a 8 from me. I also have a pet like this - mine is not timid though. He is a massive male with an attitude. Love him, he hates cats (obvious reasons, but he is too big for cats to hurt him - they are afraid of him.<br/>Quality of photo - brilliant. Perfection. Good subject - they tend to not too move too fast. LOL.</td>', 'I did not vote on this one, but it definately would''ve gotten a 8 from me. I also have a pet like this - mine is not timid though. He is a massive male with an attitude. Love him, he hates cats (obvious reasons, but he is too big for cats to hurt him - they are afraid of him.Quality of photo - brilliant. Perfection. Good subject - they tend to not too move too fast. LOL.', '2006-09-08 09:46:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(2814438, 388077, 43714, '<td valign="top">Shezzie, you sure know how to find really cool shots, and I love this one its so unusual!!! Way to go.</td>', 'Shezzie, you sure know how to find really cool shots, and I love this one its so unusual!!! Way to go.', '2006-09-08 09:48:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(2814441, 385163, 61818, '<td valign="top">Great shot and a well deserved ribbon (should have placed 1st!)</td>', 'Great shot and a well deserved ribbon (should have placed 1st!)', '2006-09-08 09:49:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(2814444, 387011, 50641, '<td valign="top">Hi.  I was one of your 5''s.  I think your tones and focus are good in this shot.  However, the combination of the close-up and the tight crop really puts her face in my face, and it''s not comfortable. Plus she''s looking right at me. She''s a lovely girl, but the processing is very realistic.  Maybe a little too realistic?  To me, the key to improving the impact of this picture would be to back off, let the viewer have a little perspective on the model.  Then you can consider whether to soften it up a touch, or give it an interesting twist of some sort.  Just my 2c.  Have fun experimenting :)</td>', 'Hi.  I was one of your 5''s.  I think your tones and focus are good in this shot.  However, the combination of the close-up and the tight crop really puts her face in my face, and it''s not comfortable. Plus she''s looking right at me. She''s a lovely girl, but the processing is very realistic.  Maybe a little too realistic?  To me, the key to improving the impact of this picture would be to back off, let the viewer have a little perspective on the model.  Then you can consider whether to soften it up a touch, or give it an interesting twist of some sort.  Just my 2c.  Have fun experimenting :)', '2006-09-08 09:50:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(2814451, 383713, 63398, '<td valign="top">Congrats! Very rich, peaceful pic.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Congrats! Very rich, peaceful pic. ', '2006-09-08 09:54:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(2814455, 387011, 37961, '<td valign="top">I think you are a little too close to your model or too zoomed in. I don''t feel like there is any breathing space for the viewer. Your light isn''t too bad, but there seems to be a dark area straight on. <br/> <br/>Focus is good and she is a nice looking model. Just keep foolin with your lights. Studio is a little tricky.</td>', 'I think you are a little too close to your model or too zoomed in. I don''t feel like there is any breathing space for the viewer. Your light isn''t too bad, but there seems to be a dark area straight on.  Focus is good and she is a nice looking model. Just keep foolin with your lights. Studio is a little tricky.', '2006-09-08 09:55:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(2814461, 379109, 12827, '<td valign="top">Wow, this deserved a better finish!</td>', 'Wow, this deserved a better finish!', '2006-09-08 09:57:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(2814466, 387096, 24503, '<td valign="top">Gave an 8. Incredible it didn''t score higher. Very cute girl, she doesn''t seem so young.<br/> <br/>Álex.</td>', 'Gave an 8. Incredible it didn''t score higher. Very cute girl, she doesn''t seem so young. Álex.', '2006-09-08 09:58:10.000000', NULL, 0),
