(2814480, 388990, 56828, '<td valign="top">I commented below on how I liked the photo, but wished it hadn''t been cropped so tight and i gave you a 7.  I just went back and read over the comments and realized that the glasses didn''t have any grain in them.  I liked that.  I wish I had noticed it during voting I would have given you even higher than a 7.  Very artistic.</td>', 'I commented below on how I liked the photo, but wished it hadn''t been cropped so tight and i gave you a 7.  I just went back and read over the comments and realized that the glasses didn''t have any grain in them.  I liked that.  I wish I had noticed it during voting I would have given you even higher than a 7.  Very artistic.', '2006-09-08 10:01:16.000000', NULL, 0),
