(2814644, 375476, 24454, '<td valign="top">This one was yours???  Oh my, Jimmy you did a FANTASTIC job!!!   I love the story because it means for your first photo shoot like this was a HUGE success!!!  Congratulations!  I have a feeling there will be plenty more of this kind of work for you!   <br/> <br/>AWESOME work!!!!</td>', 'This one was yours???  Oh my, Jimmy you did a FANTASTIC job!!!   I love the story because it means for your first photo shoot like this was a HUGE success!!!  Congratulations!  I have a feeling there will be plenty more of this kind of work for you!    AWESOME work!!!!', '2006-09-08 10:52:17.000000', NULL, 0),
