(2814650, 384883, 51538, '<td valign="top">So that was the location.  It''s one of the best in the south of England.  Durdle Door is just over the headland to your right, as I remember from geology field trips.</td>', 'So that was the location.  It''s one of the best in the south of England.  Durdle Door is just over the headland to your right, as I remember from geology field trips.', '2006-09-08 10:54:58.000000', NULL, 0),
