(2815582, 377912, 15711, '<td valign="top">I think the shallow DOF is fine.  It really makes you study the old guy''s face.  I think what may have hurt you in a Free Study is just the fact that it isn''t quite as visually appealing, considering such diversity in that type of challenge.  Had it been "old" or "animals" it would have scored much higher.  Not to say that everything has to be eye candy and pretty, but that''s just my take on it.  I thought it met the challenge, but just didn''t give me the pow factor I was looking for in a free study.<br/> <br/>Hope this helps!!! ;~D</td>', 'I think the shallow DOF is fine.  It really makes you study the old guy''s face.  I think what may have hurt you in a Free Study is just the fact that it isn''t quite as visually appealing, considering such diversity in that type of challenge.  Had it been "old" or "animals" it would have scored much higher.  Not to say that everything has to be eye candy and pretty, but that''s just my take on it.  I thought it met the challenge, but just didn''t give me the pow factor I was looking for in a free study. Hope this helps!!! ;~D', '2006-09-08 15:45:20.000000', NULL, 0),
