(2816163, 388402, 1031, '<td valign="top">A nice variation on the at-bat action shot -- I just had an entry where I went with the more common ball just-off-the-bat type shot.<br/> <br/>It''s interesting that you (apparently) don''t care that the catcher is cut-off. I don''t do sports as a rule ... is it usually considered OK to crop the catcher or ump as long as you have a good shot of batter/bat/ball? (I hope so -- it makes a lot more of my shots "acceptable"!)</td>', 'A nice variation on the at-bat action shot -- I just had an entry where I went with the more common ball just-off-the-bat type shot. It''s interesting that you (apparently) don''t care that the catcher is cut-off. I don''t do sports as a rule ... is it usually considered OK to crop the catcher or ump as long as you have a good shot of batter/bat/ball? (I hope so -- it makes a lot more of my shots "acceptable"!)', '2006-09-08 19:32:27.000000', NULL, 0),
