(2816222, 387435, 34192, '<td valign="top">Since you grumbled... :)<br/>I also gave you a 5.  And I too miss the ground.  This image screams out for an anchor point.  Like the silhouette though.</td>', 'Since you grumbled... :)I also gave you a 5.  And I too miss the ground.  This image screams out for an anchor point.  Like the silhouette though.', '2006-09-08 20:03:12.000000', NULL, 0),
