(2816410, 387409, 19982, '<td valign="top">This was one of my highest scoring images in the challenge.  I''m so surprised to see it clear down at 158th (I guess it''s all relative, with nearly 700 images to choose from, they can''t all be at the top, still it seems out of place).  Anyway, you do great work Kevin.  You''ve provided me a lot of inspiration over the last two years, so keep it up!</td>', 'This was one of my highest scoring images in the challenge.  I''m so surprised to see it clear down at 158th (I guess it''s all relative, with nearly 700 images to choose from, they can''t all be at the top, still it seems out of place).  Anyway, you do great work Kevin.  You''ve provided me a lot of inspiration over the last two years, so keep it up!', '2006-09-08 21:47:19.000000', NULL, 0),
