(2816692, 388325, 61012, '<td valign="top">To answer some of the questions below...<br/> <br/>Nubble Light is in York ME<br/> <br/>The Cape Neddick Nubble is the name for the rocky island that the lighthouse sits on.<br/> <br/>The light is red! The color and timing of a lighthouse is refered to as it''s characteristic. The lights can vary between white, green, red or combinations of each. By knowing the different characteristics of lighthouses in an area you can pinpoint your location. If they were all the same they would be a much of a navigation aid. Nubble light''s characteristics is 3 seconds red followed by 3 seconds dark.<br/> <br/>nice shot bmora!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-09-08 23:05:48.</i></td>', 'To answer some of the questions below... Nubble Light is in York ME The Cape Neddick Nubble is the name for the rocky island that the lighthouse sits on. The light is red! The color and timing of a lighthouse is refered to as it''s characteristic. The lights can vary between white, green, red or combinations of each. By knowing the different characteristics of lighthouses in an area you can pinpoint your location. If they were all the same they would be a much of a navigation aid. Nubble light''s characteristics is 3 seconds red followed by 3 seconds dark. nice shot bmora!', '2006-09-09 00:02:27.000000', '2006-09-09 00:05:48.000000', 0),
