(2816731, 385439, 60862, '<td valign="top">I really liked this shot - voted it a 7.  I also requested the DQ validation, because I didn''t get the half-inverted reflection.  I was delighted when it was validated, though, because it meant you''d caught something really intriguing!  Hope it didn''t cause you too much stress.  I had someone comment on mine suggesting I''d faked something, so I was glad to get it validated.<br/> <br/>Then I came looking for it after the challenge was over.<br/> <br/>Any idea what''s going there?  Do your other shots have that effect?</td>', 'I really liked this shot - voted it a 7.  I also requested the DQ validation, because I didn''t get the half-inverted reflection.  I was delighted when it was validated, though, because it meant you''d caught something really intriguing!  Hope it didn''t cause you too much stress.  I had someone comment on mine suggesting I''d faked something, so I was glad to get it validated. Then I came looking for it after the challenge was over. Any idea what''s going there?  Do your other shots have that effect?', '2006-09-09 00:25:35.000000', NULL, 0),
