(2816816, 387435, 59415, '<td valign="top">I gave it a 5 and here is why.  The light at the bottom drew my eye right away.  Then the main tower was crooked slightly and I felt it would have been nicer if that would have been strait since to me it was the main subject.  The clouds around the tower also were not in the ideal position.  They didn''t add depth but detracted from the detail of the tower in my humble and non-expert opinion.</td>', 'I gave it a 5 and here is why.  The light at the bottom drew my eye right away.  Then the main tower was crooked slightly and I felt it would have been nicer if that would have been strait since to me it was the main subject.  The clouds around the tower also were not in the ideal position.  They didn''t add depth but detracted from the detail of the tower in my humble and non-expert opinion.', '2006-09-09 01:23:22.000000', NULL, 0),
