(2817756, 388921, 32997, '<td valign="top">I don''t know whether you were robbed or not...but I know this..if the voters had to walk through a gallery filled with the shots from the challenge they would find themselves bored by technically perfect renditions of the same sorts of things again and again..then they would come into a room with only one light, and it would be focussed on this shot..and many would stop and say...oh I didn''t really see this one...and then they might start talking, thinking, and be surprised by how much they missed...</td>', 'I don''t know whether you were robbed or not...but I know this..if the voters had to walk through a gallery filled with the shots from the challenge they would find themselves bored by technically perfect renditions of the same sorts of things again and again..then they would come into a room with only one light, and it would be focussed on this shot..and many would stop and say...oh I didn''t really see this one...and then they might start talking, thinking, and be surprised by how much they missed...', '2006-09-09 14:11:37.000000', NULL, 0),
