(2817856, 376022, 19708, '<td valign="top">I think I just about like anything in black &amp; white better, and this is no exception. You did a good job on the post-processing here, as there is good tones without going to extreme darkness, nor having areas over-exposed. Well-seen too. This is an interesting place, and so not boring.<br/>The two main trees look like huge bird legs, especially with the roots exposed like that. Think the horizon is off a little. j/k<br/>:P<br/> <br/>Thought this was gonna'' be a where''s WaldoPug picture - amazingly none to be found!</td>', 'I think I just about like anything in black & white better, and this is no exception. You did a good job on the post-processing here, as there is good tones without going to extreme darkness, nor having areas over-exposed. Well-seen too. This is an interesting place, and so not boring.The two main trees look like huge bird legs, especially with the roots exposed like that. Think the horizon is off a little. j/k:P Thought this was gonna'' be a where''s WaldoPug picture - amazingly none to be found!', '2006-09-09 15:09:35.000000', NULL, 0),
