(2820073, 385160, 20462, '<td valign="top">i too loved this.  actually this is the only one of the whole lot i kept coming back to over and over.  goodman is right, surreal.</td>', 'i too loved this.  actually this is the only one of the whole lot i kept coming back to over and over.  goodman is right, surreal.', '2006-09-10 12:34:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(2820181, 387096, 53572, '<td valign="top">this is really easy to do, although not legal in basic.  i do a duplicate layer, and do a high pass filter on it, blending option soft light.  do a layer mask, and just have the eyes show through.  this sharpens and slightly darkens the eyes.  i do another layer and set it to screen in the blending options, using the same layer mask pattern.  i usually set the opacity of the screen layer a bit lower, or it looks a little freaky...<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-09-10 13:27:14.</i></td>', 'this is really easy to do, although not legal in basic.  i do a duplicate layer, and do a high pass filter on it, blending option soft light.  do a layer mask, and just have the eyes show through.  this sharpens and slightly darkens the eyes.  i do another layer and set it to screen in the blending options, using the same layer mask pattern.  i usually set the opacity of the screen layer a bit lower, or it looks a little freaky...', '2006-09-10 13:40:44.000000', '2006-09-10 14:27:14.000000', 0),
