(2821963, 386588, 60495, '<td valign="top">DJ, yes I agreed with the score and the comments especially the fact that it lacks a subject, my son said it needed a drunk on the corner he said DPC voters like that sort of thing...lol  My wife just liked the way you tend to look down the street then end up looking all the way up on the hill. She said I needed to leave it in and she would take the responsibility for the score!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-09-10 23:44:38.</i></td>', 'DJ, yes I agreed with the score and the comments especially the fact that it lacks a subject, my son said it needed a drunk on the corner he said DPC voters like that sort of thing...lol  My wife just liked the way you tend to look down the street then end up looking all the way up on the hill. She said I needed to leave it in and she would take the responsibility for the score!', '2006-09-11 00:44:02.000000', '2006-09-11 00:44:38.000000', 0),
