(2822870, 388969, 48228, '<td valign="top">I like this concept but feel your focus has let you down. The thumbnail look realy inviting, but when blown up one find it a little blury. Everytime you try something, look closely andsay to yourself is this the best I can do. Hopefully you will see what needs to be done, by learning from others, who have given you very good advice.</td>', 'I like this concept but feel your focus has let you down. The thumbnail look realy inviting, but when blown up one find it a little blury. Everytime you try something, look closely andsay to yourself is this the best I can do. Hopefully you will see what needs to be done, by learning from others, who have given you very good advice.', '2006-09-11 09:11:31.000000', NULL, 0),
