(2824805, 385708, 17837, '<td valign="top">I like the image. It has nice color, and the lighting is very good. I''d love to see more light on the road, but sometimes that just isnt possible.<br/> <br/>I might even crop the top part of the photograph off, and make it more panoramic. I believe it would give a stronger feel to the image, even softening it up a bit, giving that dreamy feel to it. <br/> <br/>Good job, and 119/679 isnt too shabby!</td>', 'I like the image. It has nice color, and the lighting is very good. I''d love to see more light on the road, but sometimes that just isnt possible. I might even crop the top part of the photograph off, and make it more panoramic. I believe it would give a stronger feel to the image, even softening it up a bit, giving that dreamy feel to it.  Good job, and 119/679 isnt too shabby!', '2006-09-11 17:40:36.000000', NULL, 0),
