(2828663, 386782, 26464, '<td valign="top">tip for shooting with timer: put an object/your hand into the frame where you plan to be during the shot and then press the shutter. in the 10-20 seconds after, since the cam is already locked on, you can casually wander back into the frame and get it bang on.<br/> <br/>that aside, nice shot! could have been a bit darker to bring out ''true'' blacks.<br/></td>', 'tip for shooting with timer: put an object/your hand into the frame where you plan to be during the shot and then press the shutter. in the 10-20 seconds after, since the cam is already locked on, you can casually wander back into the frame and get it bang on. that aside, nice shot! could have been a bit darker to bring out ''true'' blacks.', '2006-09-12 19:14:37.000000', NULL, 0),
