(2831491, 388742, 50695, '<td valign="top">ok, I''ll admit that I wasn''t really struck by this picture, but I did give it a 6, which is the same score I gave the blue and red ribbons. Like you said, the color matching is a nice element, and the strong geometry of a bowling alley makes for a good composition.</td>', 'ok, I''ll admit that I wasn''t really struck by this picture, but I did give it a 6, which is the same score I gave the blue and red ribbons. Like you said, the color matching is a nice element, and the strong geometry of a bowling alley makes for a good composition.', '2006-09-13 12:19:00.000000', NULL, 0),
