(2842543, 377423, 53147, '<td valign="top">I didnt get to vote on this challenge (I so wish I could have). I would have scored this a 6-7. Very cool shot - I wish I had hippos at our zoo. Great focus and detail on him overall and cool colors. I think my only issue is the cropping out of the eye onthe left. I think I would have liked to have seen all of it in the shot which may have given you more of his cool snout as well. Overall - good stats (a 6 would have been better and more appropriate IMO) and only having 5 votes 3 and under is great. Nice work here.</td>', 'I didnt get to vote on this challenge (I so wish I could have). I would have scored this a 6-7. Very cool shot - I wish I had hippos at our zoo. Great focus and detail on him overall and cool colors. I think my only issue is the cropping out of the eye onthe left. I think I would have liked to have seen all of it in the shot which may have given you more of his cool snout as well. Overall - good stats (a 6 would have been better and more appropriate IMO) and only having 5 votes 3 and under is great. Nice work here.', '2006-09-17 13:56:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(2842557, 388651, 53147, '<td valign="top">Nice silhouette. I think a tighter crop on top and making the the silhouette all solid black could have boosted your score up. But a great capture overall.</td>', 'Nice silhouette. I think a tighter crop on top and making the the silhouette all solid black could have boosted your score up. But a great capture overall.', '2006-09-17 14:03:24.000000', NULL, 0),
