(2842570, 388026, 53147, '<td valign="top">I so wish I had gotten to vote in this challenge. Great shot. Love the moodiness of the b&amp;w. The lines are great and the background silhouette of the buildings is a nice touch. Glad to see this broke well into the 6s. If I could have voted it would have been a tad bit higher. Well done.</td>', 'I so wish I had gotten to vote in this challenge. Great shot. Love the moodiness of the b&w. The lines are great and the background silhouette of the buildings is a nice touch. Glad to see this broke well into the 6s. If I could have voted it would have been a tad bit higher. Well done.', '2006-09-17 14:10:41.000000', NULL, 0),
