(2863461, 380685, 18552, '<td valign="top">Van, this is so beautiful - so ethereal and unreal looking. I''d love to be able to take lightning pictures like this. No matter what I try mine always suck. I love the layered dark look in the sky above and the stop light (or train stop light) just adds that wonderful extra touch that ads to that lonely, stark feeling. It''s gorgeous!!!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-09-27 01:55:07.</i></td>', 'Van, this is so beautiful - so ethereal and unreal looking. I''d love to be able to take lightning pictures like this. No matter what I try mine always suck. I love the layered dark look in the sky above and the stop light (or train stop light) just adds that wonderful extra touch that ads to that lonely, stark feeling. It''s gorgeous!!!', '2006-09-25 14:43:20.000000', '2006-09-27 02:55:07.000000', 0),
