(2870325, 381899, 49865, '<td valign="top">My first reaction when I saw this was "with a PowershotS2 IS?!" It''s a great camera but I had seriously brushed it off for any potential with nighttime shots. This sure proves me wrong. Excellent work on the original capture and the post processing.</td>', 'My first reaction when I saw this was "with a PowershotS2 IS?!" It''s a great camera but I had seriously brushed it off for any potential with nighttime shots. This sure proves me wrong. Excellent work on the original capture and the post processing.', '2006-09-27 20:10:02.000000', NULL, 0),
