(2872936, 385287, 60862, '<td valign="top">Hey there.  Just came back to this while poking around your portfolio.  I''m a victim of my darkish home monitor.  When I voted on this at home, about all I saw were your eyes and some smudges.  Looking at it now on a brighter screen, it''s really powerful.  Well done!</td>', 'Hey there.  Just came back to this while poking around your portfolio.  I''m a victim of my darkish home monitor.  When I voted on this at home, about all I saw were your eyes and some smudges.  Looking at it now on a brighter screen, it''s really powerful.  Well done!', '2006-09-28 14:43:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(2874251, 384808, 49652, '<td valign="top">Lovely.  It''s so peaceful.</td>', 'Lovely.  It''s so peaceful.', '2006-09-28 23:14:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(2874588, 388663, 40718, '<td valign="top">I like the shot as a candid/portrait and his look does emote a lot to us.  I think the acid wash doesn''t serve a big purpose.  You look like you were going for a goodman, but naturally aren''t as skilled at the look as she is (who is?).  I''m not positive about the square crop either, although I don''t think it''s a huge minus.  I gave this a 4.  I did it primarily because the acid action didn''t make sense to me.</td>', 'I like the shot as a candid/portrait and his look does emote a lot to us.  I think the acid wash doesn''t serve a big purpose.  You look like you were going for a goodman, but naturally aren''t as skilled at the look as she is (who is?).  I''m not positive about the square crop either, although I don''t think it''s a huge minus.  I gave this a 4.  I did it primarily because the acid action didn''t make sense to me.', '2006-09-29 00:52:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(2875564, 388857, 36619, '<td valign="top">oh my, she''s so adorable, great natural pose!</td>', 'oh my, she''s so adorable, great natural pose!', '2006-09-29 12:37:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(2876454, 386716, 42495, '<td valign="top">The clarity and color of the flower jump off the screen in your picture.  I also like the angle that you used to capture the flower.  If you have control over your shutter, you may want to go with a lower number (not sure what camera chose for you) to decrease DOF.  That would blur the background a bit to keep the focus on your flower.  Cropping would also keep focus on your main subject.  While your light was good, you may also want to try shooting at different times to see what the light does for color.  Also, softer light (clouds) may bring out some more detail in the petals.</td>', 'The clarity and color of the flower jump off the screen in your picture.  I also like the angle that you used to capture the flower.  If you have control over your shutter, you may want to go with a lower number (not sure what camera chose for you) to decrease DOF.  That would blur the background a bit to keep the focus on your flower.  Cropping would also keep focus on your main subject.  While your light was good, you may also want to try shooting at different times to see what the light does for color.  Also, softer light (clouds) may bring out some more detail in the petals.', '2006-09-29 18:45:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(2877748, 383713, 60370, '<td valign="top">Well?  What''s the name?<br/>;-)</td>', 'Well?  What''s the name?;-)', '2006-09-30 11:55:45.000000', NULL, 0),
