(2889676, 383713, 25464, '<td valign="top">How about "Clover"?  I also thought of "Opal" since they change color in when you move them in the light. Also could go with "Peridot" or "Peri" for short" - August birthstone, lovely shade of green.  "Emerald" or Emie for short would also work.  (Seem to be on a gem stone theme here.</td>', 'How about "Clover"?  I also thought of "Opal" since they change color in when you move them in the light. Also could go with "Peridot" or "Peri" for short" - August birthstone, lovely shade of green.  "Emerald" or Emie for short would also work.  (Seem to be on a gem stone theme here.', '2006-10-03 01:13:49.000000', NULL, 0),
