(4592830, 388980, 69008, '<td valign="top">This is one of the nicest wild deer photos that I have seen.  The deer looks totally relaxed, and in it''s element, and the even light of twilight gives the whole scene a beautiful glow. The 20 mm perspective is just perfect also, as most shots like this have the compressed look of a long tele shot. <br/>It was a fortunate moment for you to be able to get so close and have the equipment ready to get this shot.</td>', 'This is one of the nicest wild deer photos that I have seen.  The deer looks totally relaxed, and in it''s element, and the even light of twilight gives the whole scene a beautiful glow. The 20 mm perspective is just perfect also, as most shots like this have the compressed look of a long tele shot. It was a fortunate moment for you to be able to get so close and have the equipment ready to get this shot.', '2008-03-28 01:48:03.000000', NULL, 0),
