(7150335, 377415, 27605, '<td valign="top">A few commenters asked how I was lucky enough to get three swallowtail butterflies in a single photo.  I was laying flat on my back in the bed of my pickup truck below a mimosa tree in full bloom, and the tree was covered with butterflies flitting from flower to flower and all around the canopy.</td>', 'A few commenters asked how I was lucky enough to get three swallowtail butterflies in a single photo.  I was laying flat on my back in the bed of my pickup truck below a mimosa tree in full bloom, and the tree was covered with butterflies flitting from flower to flower and all around the canopy.', '2014-01-01 15:46:48.000000', NULL, 0),
